INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.884023f8e109cf74','source.3e8b886a0f812354','2026-06-22','prediction.0f3d7e1692918892','Rival humanoid maker lands $500M-plus chip-and-cloud strategic round by Q4 2026','Rival humanoid maker lands $500M-plus chip-and-cloud strategic round by Q4 2026','Rival humanoid maker lands $500M-plus chip-and-cloud strategic round by Q4 2026','Rival humanoid maker lands $500M-plus chip-and-cloud strategic round by Q4 2026','2026-06-18','Hyundai''s board is set to vote today, June 22, to buy SoftBank''s residual 9.65% of Boston Dynamics for about $325 million, an implied ~$3.37 billion enterprise value that re-rates the humanoid maker to roughly three times its 2021 mark and pulls the firm fully inside a strategic owner with the capital and captive demand to fund its roadmap. That is the capital-and-strategic-backing-concentrating-around-humanoid-platforms direction this prediction tracks: a deep-pocketed industrial sponsor putting nine figures behind a humanoid program tied to a ~25,000-unit Atlas factory deployment from 2028. But the match is structural, not the named landing: this is a full buyout of a captive subsidiary, not a $500M-plus external strategic round into a rival pure-play, and there is no chip-and-cloud syndicate of the kind the prediction specifies.','[{"url": "https://www.kedglobal.com/robotics/newsView/ked202606210001", "title": "KED Global - Hyundai to take full ownership of Boston Dynamics in SoftBank buyout"}, {"url": "https://www.globalbankingandfinance.com/hyundai-buy-softbanks-remaining-stake-boston-dynamics-325/", "title": "Global Banking & Finance Review - Hyundai to buy SoftBank''s remaining stake in Boston Dynamics for $325 million"}]',3,'A deep-pocketed industrial owner is putting nine figures behind Boston Dynamics at a ~$3.37 billion re-rating, consolidating full control to fund a 25,000-unit Atlas factory roadmap — the capital concentrating around humanoid platforms the thesis tracks, with strategic money flowing to whoever can absorb the unit economics.','潤沢な資金を持つ産業界のオーナーが、~$3.37Bへの再評価でBoston Dynamicsに9桁の資金を投じ、25,000台規模のAtlas工場ロードマップに資金を投じるべく完全支配へと統合しつつある。これは本持論が追う、ヒューマノイドのプラットフォームに資本が集まる動きであり、戦略的な資金は単位あたりの採算を引き受けられる相手へと流れていく。','Un propietario industrial de bolsillos hondos está poniendo nueve cifras detrás de Boston Dynamics en una revalorización de unos 3.370 millones de dólares, consolidando el control total para financiar una hoja de ruta de fábrica de 25.000 unidades Atlas. Es el capital concentrándose en torno a las plataformas de humanoides que la tesis sigue, con el dinero estratégico fluyendo hacia quien pueda absorber la economía unitaria.','Isang malakas-ang-kapital na industrial owner ang naglalagay ng siyam na digit sa likod ng Boston Dynamics sa ~$3.37 billion na re-rating. Kinokonsolida nito ang buong kontrol upang pondohan ang isang 25,000-yunit na Atlas factory roadmap. Iyon ang kapital na nagtutuon sa mga humanoid platform na sinusubaybayan ng tesis, kung saan dumadaloy ang strategic money sa kung sino man ang makakaya ng unit economics.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'A deep-pocketed industrial owner is putting nine figures behind Boston Dynamics at a ~$3.37 billion re-rating, consolidating full control to fund a 25,000-unit Atlas factory roadmap — the capital concentrating around humanoid platforms the thesis tracks, with strategic money flowing to whoever can absorb the unit economics.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:02');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.4ff983c0102ab001','source.3e8b886a0f812354','2026-06-22','prediction.71427a4fdd178e43','A frontier AI lab files a public S-1 and prices its IPO by Q2 2027','A frontier AI lab files a public S-1 and prices its IPO by Q2 2027','A frontier AI lab files a public S-1 and prices its IPO by Q2 2027','A frontier AI lab files a public S-1 and prices its IPO by Q2 2027','2026-06-12','The Hyundai-SoftBank buyout reported today turns on an IPO clock: SoftBank''s exit is a put option from the 2021 deal that let it sell its residual Boston Dynamics shares back if the firm had not completed a US IPO by June 2026, and with no listing it notified Hyundai it would exercise. Korean business press frames full ownership as also clearing the path to accelerate a future Boston Dynamics IPO. The relevance to this prediction is thematic only, on the IPO-timing-and-exit-discipline thread it shares: a frontier-class private company facing a hard liquidity-window deadline. But the match is weak and off-target: Boston Dynamics is a robotics maker, not a frontier AI lab, the news is a missed-IPO put-option trigger rather than a priced S-1, and nothing today moves any named frontier lab to a public filing.','[{"url": "https://www.kedglobal.com/robotics/newsView/ked202606210001", "title": "KED Global - Hyundai to take full ownership of Boston Dynamics in SoftBank buyout"}, {"url": "https://cryptobriefing.com/hyundai-acquires-softbank-boston-dynamics-stake/", "title": "Crypto Briefing - Hyundai to acquire SoftBank''s remaining stake in Boston Dynamics for $325M"}]',2,'SoftBank''s exit fires because Boston Dynamics missed a US-IPO-by-June-2026 deadline baked into the 2021 deal, and full ownership is framed as clearing the path to accelerate a later listing — a live reminder that a hard IPO clock and exit discipline govern frontier-class private companies the way the thesis assumes.','SoftBankの撤退は、Boston Dynamicsが2021年の取引に織り込まれた「2026年6月までの米国IPO」という期限を達成できなかったために発動する。そして完全所有化は、後の上場を加速する道筋を開くものと位置づけられている。これは、厳しいIPOの期限と撤退の規律がフロンティア級の非公開企業を律するという、本持論が前提とする力を生きた形で思い起こさせる。','La salida de SoftBank se dispara porque Boston Dynamics incumplió un plazo de OPV en EE. UU. para junio de 2026 incorporado al acuerdo de 2021, y la propiedad total se plantea como el despeje del camino para acelerar una cotización posterior. Es un recordatorio vivo de que un reloj de OPV duro y la disciplina de salida gobiernan a las empresas privadas de clase frontera tal como supone la tesis.','Pumuputok ang paglabas ng SoftBank dahil hindi naabot ng Boston Dynamics ang deadline na US-IPO-bago-ang-June-2026 na nakapaloob sa deal noong 2021. Ibinabalangkas ang buong pagmamay-ari bilang pagbubukas ng landas upang pabilisin ang isang susunod na listing. Buhay na paalala ito na isang matigas na IPO clock at exit discipline ang namamahala sa mga frontier-class na pribadong kompanya sa paraang ipinapalagay ng tesis.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'SoftBank''s exit fires because Boston Dynamics missed a US-IPO-by-June-2026 deadline baked into the 2021 deal, and full ownership is framed as clearing the path to accelerate a later listing — a live reminder that a hard IPO clock and exit discipline govern frontier-class private companies the way the thesis assumes.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:02');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.2c5886d1e3a93c7d','source.3e8b886a0f812354','2026-06-22','prediction.6d9743241187213d','Confidential-GPU attestation lands as a cloud-AI contract term by Q2 2027','Confidential-GPU attestation lands as a cloud-AI contract term by Q2 2027','Confidential-GPU attestation lands as a cloud-AI contract term by Q2 2027','Confidential-GPU attestation lands as a cloud-AI contract term by Q2 2027','2026-06-14','Today''s events calendar puts the Confidential Computing Summit at the San Francisco Mint on June 23-24, now a day out, with confidential-AI and data-sovereignty keynotes featuring AMD, Google, Microsoft, NVIDIA, Meta and Samsung under the Linux Foundation and OPAQUE. That is the precise GPU-and-hyperscaler cohort whose attestation primitives this prediction expects to harden into a procurable cloud-AI contract term, convening on exactly the confidential-AI and data-sovereignty agenda that drives the thesis, with the soonest anchor among today''s three security sub-tracks. The relevance is on venue and imminent momentum, not the landing itself: a summit on the calendar surfaces the vendors and the demand framing but is not a published attestation clause, SLA or contracted procurement term, and no cloud provider or buyer has yet committed confidential-GPU attestation as a default deal term on data-jurisdiction grounds.','[{"url": "https://events.linuxfoundation.org/confidential-computing-summit/", "title": "Linux Foundation - Confidential Computing Summit 2026 (June 23-24, San Francisco)"}]',4,'A day out, the exact GPU-and-hyperscaler cohort the thesis depends on — AMD, NVIDIA, Google, Microsoft, Meta, Samsung — convenes at the Confidential Computing Summit on a confidential-AI and data-sovereignty agenda, the structural pull that has to mature before attestation guarantees harden into a procurable cloud-AI deal term.','数日後、本持論が依拠するGPUとハイパースケーラーの各社——AMD・NVIDIA・Google・Microsoft・Meta・Samsung——が、秘匿AIとデータ主権の議題のもとConfidential Computing Summitに集う。これは、アテステーションの保証が調達可能なクラウドAIの取引条件へと固まる前に成熟しなければならない構造的な引力である。','A un día vista, el grupo exacto de GPU e hiperescaladores del que depende la tesis —AMD, NVIDIA, Google, Microsoft, Meta, Samsung— se reúne en el Confidential Computing Summit con una agenda de IA confidencial y soberanía de datos. Es la tracción estructural que tiene que madurar antes de que las garantías de atestación se consoliden en un término de acuerdo de cloud-IA adquirible.','Isang araw na lamang ang layo, magtitipon sa Confidential Computing Summit ang eksaktong grupo ng GPU at hyperscaler na inaasahan ng tesis, sina AMD, NVIDIA, Google, Microsoft, Meta at Samsung, sa isang agenda ng confidential-AI at data-sovereignty. Iyon ang istrukturang puwersang kailangang lumago bago tumigas ang mga garantiya ng attestation tungo sa isang nabibiling cloud-AI deal term.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'A day out, the exact GPU-and-hyperscaler cohort the thesis depends on — AMD, NVIDIA, Google, Microsoft, Meta, Samsung — convenes at the Confidential Computing Summit on a confidential-AI and data-sovereignty agenda, the structural pull that has to mature before attestation guarantees harden into a procurable cloud-AI deal term.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:02');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.6cceb9948f11733b','source.3e8b886a0f812354','2026-06-22','prediction.c2b0ba20d4477cec','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','2026-06-21','Today''s events calendar lists AI Tinkerers San Francisco hosting an Offensive Security Demo Night on June 25 with live autonomous-pentesting-agent demos sponsored by XBOW, ahead of the Black Hat USA AI Summit and DEF CON AI Village in August. That is the same prove-the-finding-by-running-it capability this prediction tracks: agents that chain reconnaissance, build a working exploit and execute it to demonstrate reachability rather than merely flagging a possible weakness, which is exactly Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation move generalized to a vendor field. But the relevance is on momentum and adjacency, not the landing: a demo night is conference-stage validation, not the defensive exploit-validation pipeline becoming an industry baseline across named code-security vendors, and the offensive-pentest framing here points at attacker tooling rather than the defensive proof-of-exploit gate the prediction names.','[{"url": "https://www.ai.engineer/worldsfair/2026", "title": "AI Engineer World''s Fair 2026 (June 29-July 2, San Francisco)"}]',3,'Days out, an Offensive Security Demo Night puts autonomous agents on stage that chain recon, build a working exploit and run it to prove reachability — the prove-the-finding-by-running-it capability the thesis credits, generalizing Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation move into a competitive vendor field ahead of the August Black Hat window.','数日後、Offensive Security Demo Nightが、偵察を連ねて実際に動く攻撃コードを組み立て、それを実行して到達可能性を証明する自律エージェントを壇上に上げる。これは本持論が評価する「実際に動かして発見を証明する」能力であり、Continuumのサンドボックス攻撃コード検証の手立てを、8月のBlack Hatの時期に先立って競合するベンダー領域へ一般化するものだ。','A pocos días, una Offensive Security Demo Night pone en escena agentes autónomos que encadenan reconocimiento, construyen un exploit funcional y lo ejecutan para probar la alcanzabilidad: la capacidad de demostrar-el-hallazgo-ejecutándolo que la tesis acredita, generalizando el movimiento de validación de exploits en sandbox de Continuum a un campo competitivo de proveedores antes de la ventana de Black Hat en agosto.','Ilang araw na lamang ang layo, naglalagay ang isang Offensive Security Demo Night ng mga autonomous agent sa entablado na nagdurugtong ng recon, gumagawa ng gumaganang exploit at nagpapatakbo nito upang patunayan ang reachability. Iyon ang patunayan-ang-natuklasan-sa-pamamagitan-ng-pagpapatakbo na kakayahang kinikilala ng tesis, na nagpapalawak sa galaw ng sandbox exploit-validation ng Continuum tungo sa isang mapagkumpitensiyang vendor field bago ang Black Hat window sa Agosto.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Days out, an Offensive Security Demo Night puts autonomous agents on stage that chain recon, build a working exploit and run it to prove reachability — the prove-the-finding-by-running-it capability the thesis credits, generalizing Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation move into a competitive vendor field ahead of the August Black Hat window.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:02');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.351e3c9faa8166a0','source.3e8b886a0f812354','2026-06-22','prediction.197bc00f1714ad4b','Automaker-built humanoid programs add a second high-volume entrant by Q2 2027','Automaker-built humanoid programs add a second high-volume entrant by Q2 2027','Automaker-built humanoid programs add a second high-volume entrant by Q2 2027','Automaker-built humanoid programs add a second high-volume entrant by Q2 2027','2026-06-07','[REVIVED] Today''s Hyundai-SoftBank buyout, reported tied to a plan to deploy about 25,000 Atlas humanoids across Hyundai''s own factories from 2028, is a direct pulse on this dormant thesis that vertically integrated automakers will field high-volume humanoid programs on their own motor, battery and supply-chain foundations. By taking full ownership of Boston Dynamics at an implied ~$3.37 billion value and removing minority-shareholder friction around the captive-deployment roadmap, Hyundai positions itself as exactly the automaker-anchored, in-house-fleet humanoid entrant the prediction anticipated alongside Tesla and BYD. The match is strong on the structural claim but partial on the falsifiable bar: the news is an ownership consolidation and a stated 2028 unit target, not the on-record executive disclosure of a working prototype and production cost-down from a distinct second automaker that the prediction requires, and Hyundai/Boston Dynamics is an existing program rather than a fresh second entrant.','[{"url": "https://www.kedglobal.com/robotics/newsView/ked202606210001", "title": "KED Global - Hyundai to take full ownership of Boston Dynamics in SoftBank buyout"}, {"url": "https://www.globalbankingandfinance.com/hyundai-buy-softbanks-remaining-stake-boston-dynamics-325/", "title": "Global Banking & Finance Review - Hyundai to buy SoftBank''s remaining stake in Boston Dynamics for $325 million"}]',4,'Hyundai is taking full ownership of Boston Dynamics expressly to run about 25,000 Atlas units across its own plants from 2028 — a vertically integrated automaker committing its supply-chain and balance-sheet weight to a high-volume in-house humanoid program, precisely the automaker-anchored deployment pattern the thesis says will multiply.','Hyundaiは、2028年から自社工場群で約25,000台のAtlasを運用するためにこそ、Boston Dynamicsを完全所有化しようとしている。これは垂直統合された自動車メーカーが、サプライチェーンとバランスシートの重みを大量導入の社内ヒューマノイドの取り組みに投じるものであり、本持論が増えていくと述べる、自動車メーカーを軸とした導入の型そのものである。','Hyundai está tomando la propiedad total de Boston Dynamics expresamente para operar unas 25.000 unidades Atlas en sus propias plantas a partir de 2028: un fabricante de automóviles verticalmente integrado comprometiendo el peso de su cadena de suministro y su balance en un programa de humanoides interno de alto volumen, justo el patrón de despliegue anclado a un fabricante de automóviles que la tesis dice que se multiplicará.','Kinukuha ng Hyundai ang buong pagmamay-ari sa Boston Dynamics nang tahasan upang magpatakbo ng humigit-kumulang 25,000 Atlas unit sa sarili nitong mga planta mula 2028. Isang vertically integrated na automaker na inilalaan ang bigat ng supply-chain at balance-sheet nito sa isang high-volume na in-house humanoid program. Iyon mismo ang automaker-anchored na pattern ng deployment na sinasabi ng tesis na dadami.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Hyundai is taking full ownership of Boston Dynamics expressly to run about 25,000 Atlas units across its own plants from 2028 — a vertically integrated automaker committing its supply-chain and balance-sheet weight to a high-volume in-house humanoid program, precisely the automaker-anchored deployment pattern the thesis says will multiply.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:02');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.44dcc4423944e57f','source.b223b54796d63f54','2026-06-23','prediction.2593e0dadb6a21a3','Coding-agent harnesses adopt default-deny toolset gating as standard by H1 2027','Coding-agent harnesses adopt default-deny toolset gating as standard by H1 2027','Coding-agent harnesses adopt default-deny toolset gating as standard by H1 2027','Coding-agent harnesses adopt default-deny toolset gating as standard by H1 2027','2026-06-20','Today''s coding-agent harness story is a direct pulse on this thesis: the open harnesses shipped security hardening over feature flash and are converging on least-privilege-by-default execution. OpenClaw''s June 2026.6.x releases patched vCard and location-pin injection, tightened Docker sandbox boundaries, added Browser CDP endpoint validation, kept SSH tunnel checks pinned to loopback, and began rejecting unsafe chat, tool, package, and response lengths. NVIDIA''s NemoClaw prioritizes sandbox hardening, credential handling, and stricter network-policy defaults around OpenShell sandboxes, and Nous Research''s Hermes Agent adds MCP credential filtering that hands subprocesses only explicitly approved environment variables. The reporting''s explicit throughline -- harnesses treating their own tool-calling surface as the primary attack surface -- is the default-deny toolset gating this prediction names, reinforced by OWASP and StakeBench finding prompt injection the dominant agentic risk. The gap to the falsifiable bar: these are incremental per-release hardening steps, not yet a tagged stable release whose shipped default profile denies tool calls out-of-box on a clean install with no operator configuration.','[{"url": "https://thenewstack.io/nvidia-openclaw-agent-blueprints/", "title": "The New Stack - ''An agent is an LLM and a harness'': what NVIDIA really thinks about OpenClaw (NemoClaw)"}, {"url": "https://innfactory.ai/en/blog/openclaw-vs-hermes-agent-comparison/", "title": "innFactory - OpenClaw vs. Hermes Agent: comparison of the two dominant AI agent frameworks of 2026"}]',5,'Today''s open harnesses converge on least-privilege execution: OpenClaw patched injection vectors and tightened sandbox boundaries, NemoClaw defaults to stricter network policy, and Hermes filters MCP credentials to approved env vars. The reporting''s throughline -- harnesses treating their own tool-calling surface as the primary attack surface -- is exactly the default-deny gating this prediction names, echoed by OWASP and StakeBench injection findings.','本日のオープンなハーネス各社は最小権限での実行へ収束している。OpenClaw は注入経路を修正してサンドボックス境界を厳格化し、NemoClaw はより厳格なネットワークポリシーを既定とし、Hermes は MCP 認証情報を承認済みの環境変数だけに絞り込む。一連の報道に通底するのは、ハーネス自身が呼び出すツール群こそ最大の攻撃対象領域だと捉える姿勢であり、これはこの予測が指す既定拒否の制御そのものだ。OWASP と StakeBench の注入に関する調査結果も、これを裏付けている。','Los entornos abiertos de hoy convergen en una ejecución con privilegios mínimos: OpenClaw corrigió vectores de inyección y reforzó los límites del sandbox, NemoClaw aplica por defecto una política de red más estricta y Hermes filtra las credenciales MCP dejando solo las variables de entorno aprobadas. El hilo conductor de la cobertura -- los entornos tratan su propio conjunto de herramientas invocables como la principal superficie de ataque -- es exactamente el control con denegación por defecto que esta predicción describe, en línea con los hallazgos de inyección de OWASP y StakeBench.','Nagsasanib ngayon ang mga open harness tungo sa least-privilege na pagpapatakbo. Na-patch ng OpenClaw ang mga injection vector at hinigpitan ang mga hangganan ng sandbox, naka-default ang NemoClaw sa mas mahigpit na network policy, at sinasala ng Hermes ang mga MCP credential papunta lamang sa mga aprubadong env var. Ang pangkalahatang punto ng mga ulat, na itinuturing ng mga harness ang sarili nilang tool-calling surface bilang pangunahing attack surface, ang eksaktong default-deny gating na tinutukoy ng prediksyon na ito, at sinasalamin ito ng mga natuklasan ng OWASP at StakeBench tungkol sa injection.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Today''s open harnesses converge on least-privilege execution: OpenClaw patched injection vectors and tightened sandbox boundaries, NemoClaw defaults to stricter network policy, and Hermes filters MCP credentials to approved env vars. The reporting''s throughline -- harnesses treating their own tool-calling surface as the primary attack surface -- is exactly the default-deny gating this prediction names, echoed by OWASP and StakeBench injection findings.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.147c67eadd5a00ed','source.b223b54796d63f54','2026-06-23','prediction.dfc879415def54db','Agent meta-harness becomes the cross-vendor policy plane for agents by H1 2027','Agent meta-harness becomes the cross-vendor policy plane for agents by H1 2027','Agent meta-harness becomes the cross-vendor policy plane for agents by H1 2027','Agent meta-harness becomes the cross-vendor policy plane for agents by H1 2027','2026-06-15','Today''s harness coverage supports the meta-harness thesis from the supply side: NVIDIA''s NemoClaw is an open reference stack for running always-on agents like Hermes and OpenClaw inside its OpenShell sandboxes, packaging routed inference, lifecycle management, credential handling, and stricter network-policy defaults around a hardened blueprint that wraps multiple third-party agent frameworks. That is precisely the cross-vendor wrapper layer this prediction tracks -- a common control plane sitting above heterogeneous agents and enforcing sandbox, network, and credential policy uniformly. Nous Research''s Hermes Agent moving the same direction (MCP credential filtering, SSRF protection, a Tirith pre-execution scan over the MCP configuration) shows the policy primitives standardizing across vendors. The match stays one step short of the landing: NemoClaw is a single vendor''s reference blueprint and the harnesses are converging on a shared design pattern, not yet an adopted cross-vendor policy plane that competing agent makers route through as the interoperable enforcement layer.','[{"url": "https://thenewstack.io/nvidia-openclaw-agent-blueprints/", "title": "The New Stack - ''An agent is an LLM and a harness'': what NVIDIA really thinks about OpenClaw (NemoClaw)"}, {"url": "https://innfactory.ai/en/blog/openclaw-vs-hermes-agent-comparison/", "title": "innFactory - OpenClaw vs. Hermes Agent: comparison of the two dominant AI agent frameworks of 2026"}]',4,'NemoClaw is an open reference stack wrapping multiple third-party agent frameworks inside OpenShell sandboxes, packaging routed inference, lifecycle, credential handling, and stricter network policy -- precisely the cross-vendor wrapper enforcing sandbox, network, and credential policy uniformly above heterogeneous agents. Hermes moving the same direction (MCP credential filtering, SSRF protection, a Tirith pre-execution scan) shows the policy primitives standardizing across vendors.','NemoClaw は、複数のサードパーティ製エージェントフレームワークを OpenShell サンドボックス内に包み込むオープンな参照スタックであり、ルーティングされた推論・ライフサイクル・認証情報の取り扱い・より厳格なネットワークポリシーをまとめている。これはまさに、多様なエージェントの上位でサンドボックス・ネットワーク・認証情報のポリシーを一律に適用する、ベンダー横断の包み込み層だ。Hermes も同じ方向に進んでおり（MCP 認証情報フィルタリング、SSRF 対策、Tirith の実行前スキャン）、ポリシーの基本部品がベンダー間で標準化しつつあることを示す。','NemoClaw es una pila de referencia abierta que envuelve varios frameworks de agentes de terceros dentro de sandboxes de OpenShell, empaquetando inferencia enrutada, ciclo de vida, manejo de credenciales y una política de red más estricta -- precisamente la capa envolvente entre proveedores que aplica de forma uniforme la política de sandbox, red y credenciales por encima de agentes heterogéneos. Hermes avanzando en la misma dirección (filtrado de credenciales MCP, protección contra SSRF, un análisis Tirith previo a la ejecución) muestra que las primitivas de política se estandarizan entre proveedores.','Ang NemoClaw ay isang open reference stack na bumabalot sa maraming third-party agent framework sa loob ng mga OpenShell sandbox, na nagsasama ng routed inference, lifecycle, paghawak ng credential, at mas mahigpit na network policy. Ito mismo ang cross-vendor wrapper na pantay na nagpapatupad ng sandbox, network, at credential policy sa ibabaw ng magkakaibang agent. Ang paggalaw ng Hermes sa parehong direksyon, sa pamamagitan ng MCP credential filtering, SSRF protection, at isang Tirith pre-execution scan, ay nagpapakita na nagiging pamantayan ang mga policy primitive sa iba''t ibang vendor.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NemoClaw is an open reference stack wrapping multiple third-party agent frameworks inside OpenShell sandboxes, packaging routed inference, lifecycle, credential handling, and stricter network policy -- precisely the cross-vendor wrapper enforcing sandbox, network, and credential policy uniformly above heterogeneous agents. Hermes moving the same direction (MCP credential filtering, SSRF protection, a Tirith pre-execution scan) shows the policy primitives standardizing across vendors.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.a3f1e464f18173a8','source.b223b54796d63f54','2026-06-23','prediction.67f059f9cf2cf506','Inline MCP-channel policy enforcement ships as a platform default by Q1 2027','Inline MCP-channel policy enforcement ships as a platform default by Q1 2027','Inline MCP-channel policy enforcement ships as a platform default by Q1 2027','Inline MCP-channel policy enforcement ships as a platform default by Q1 2027','2026-06-16','Today''s harness hardening lands squarely on this prediction''s inline-MCP-policy thesis. Nous Research''s Hermes Agent now ships MCP credential filtering that hands subprocesses only explicitly approved environment variables, plus credential redaction, SSRF protection, and a Tirith pre-execution security scan run over the MCP configuration before each run -- enforcement that sits in the MCP channel itself rather than in an external gateway. NVIDIA''s NemoClaw reinforces the same axis with credential handling and stricter network-policy defaults around routed inference. That is the inline, per-call MCP-channel policy enforcement the prediction expects to become a shipped default, and the OWASP/StakeBench evidence that prompt injection is the dominant agentic risk supplies the catalyst. Still short of the bar: Hermes'' MCP filtering and pre-execution scan are one harness''s hardening features, not yet inline MCP-channel policy enforcement enabled by default on a broad platform, and the Tirith scan is pre-execution rather than continuous in-channel mediation.','[{"url": "https://innfactory.ai/en/blog/openclaw-vs-hermes-agent-comparison/", "title": "innFactory - OpenClaw vs. Hermes Agent: comparison of the two dominant AI agent frameworks of 2026"}, {"url": "https://thenewstack.io/nvidia-openclaw-agent-blueprints/", "title": "The New Stack - ''An agent is an LLM and a harness'': what NVIDIA really thinks about OpenClaw (NemoClaw)"}]',4,'Hermes now ships MCP credential filtering that hands subprocesses only approved env vars, plus credential redaction, SSRF protection, and a Tirith pre-execution scan over the MCP configuration -- enforcement sitting in the MCP channel itself, not an external gateway. NemoClaw reinforces the same axis with credential handling and stricter network defaults, and OWASP/StakeBench injection findings supply the catalyst.','Hermes は、承認済みの環境変数だけをサブプロセスに渡す MCP 認証情報フィルタリングに加え、認証情報の伏字化・SSRF 対策・MCP 設定に対する Tirith の実行前スキャンを出荷するようになった。これは外部のゲートウェイではなく、MCP チャネルそのものの内側で行う適用だ。NemoClaw も認証情報の取り扱いとより厳格なネットワークの既定値で同じ軸を補強し、OWASP/StakeBench の注入に関する調査結果がその引き金を供給する。','Hermes ya incorpora un filtrado de credenciales MCP que entrega a los subprocesos solo las variables de entorno aprobadas, además de redacción de credenciales, protección contra SSRF y un análisis Tirith previo a la ejecución sobre la configuración MCP -- una aplicación que reside en el propio canal MCP, no en una pasarela externa. NemoClaw refuerza el mismo eje con el manejo de credenciales y valores de red más estrictos, y los hallazgos de inyección de OWASP/StakeBench aportan el catalizador.','Nag-ship na ang Hermes ng MCP credential filtering na nagbibigay sa mga subprocess ng tanging mga aprubadong env var lamang, kasama ang credential redaction, SSRF protection, at isang Tirith pre-execution scan sa MCP configuration. Ang pagpapatupad na ito ay nasa loob mismo ng MCP channel, hindi sa panlabas na gateway. Pinalalakas ng NemoClaw ang parehong axis sa pamamagitan ng paghawak ng credential at mas mahigpit na network defaults, at ang mga natuklasan ng OWASP at StakeBench tungkol sa injection ang nagsisilbing catalyst.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Hermes now ships MCP credential filtering that hands subprocesses only approved env vars, plus credential redaction, SSRF protection, and a Tirith pre-execution scan over the MCP configuration -- enforcement sitting in the MCP channel itself, not an external gateway. NemoClaw reinforces the same axis with credential handling and stricter network defaults, and OWASP/StakeBench injection findings supply the catalyst.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.fa53cfb576fba424','source.b223b54796d63f54','2026-06-23','prediction.6d9743241187213d','Confidential-GPU attestation lands as a cloud-AI contract term by Q2 2027','Confidential-GPU attestation lands as a cloud-AI contract term by Q2 2027','Confidential-GPU attestation lands as a cloud-AI contract term by Q2 2027','Confidential-GPU attestation lands as a cloud-AI contract term by Q2 2027','2026-06-14','Today''s events calendar puts the Confidential Computing Summit open now, running June 23-24 at the San Francisco Mint, organized by the Linux Foundation and OPAQUE around AI sovereignty, agent security, IP protection, verifiable environments, and confidential-AI workloads, with speakers from Amazon, AMD, Google, Meta, Microsoft, NVIDIA, Samsung Electronics, TII and UC Berkeley. That is the exact GPU-and-hyperscaler cohort whose attestation primitives this prediction expects to harden into a procurable cloud-AI contract term, convening on precisely the confidential-AI and verifiable-environment agenda that drives the thesis -- and now opening today rather than a day out, the soonest anchor among the week''s three security sub-tracks. The relevance is on venue and live momentum, not the landing itself: a summit on the calendar surfaces the vendors and the demand framing but is not a published attestation clause, SLA, or contracted procurement term, and no cloud provider or buyer has yet committed confidential-GPU attestation as a default deal term on data-jurisdiction grounds.','[{"url": "https://ccsummit2026.sched.com/", "title": "Confidential Computing Summit 2026 schedule (June 23-24, San Francisco Mint)"}]',4,'The Confidential Computing Summit opens today at the SF Mint, convening Amazon, AMD, Google, Meta, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Samsung around AI sovereignty, verifiable environments and confidential-AI workloads. That is precisely the GPU-and-hyperscaler cohort and demand framing whose attestation primitives would harden into a procurable cloud-AI contract term, and it is the soonest-anchored of the week''s security tracks.','Confidential Computing Summit が本日 San Francisco Mint で開幕し、Amazon・AMD・Google・Meta・Microsoft・NVIDIA・Samsung が AI 主権・検証可能な実行環境・機密 AI ワークロードをテーマに集う。これはまさに、その認証(アテステーション)の基本部品が調達可能なクラウド AI の契約条項へと固まっていく、GPU 勢とハイパースケーラー勢の顔ぶれと需要側の語り口であり、今週のセキュリティ系トラックの中で最も早い足がかりだ。','La Confidential Computing Summit abre hoy en la SF Mint, reuniendo a Amazon, AMD, Google, Meta, Microsoft, NVIDIA y Samsung en torno a la soberanía de la IA, los entornos verificables y las cargas de trabajo de IA confidencial. Ese es precisamente el grupo de fabricantes de GPU e hiperescaladores y el encuadre de la demanda cuyas primitivas de atestación se consolidarían en una cláusula contractual de IA en la nube adquirible, y es la más próxima de las ramas de seguridad de la semana.','Bumubukas ngayon ang Confidential Computing Summit sa SF Mint, na nagtitipon sa Amazon, AMD, Google, Meta, Microsoft, NVIDIA, at Samsung sa paligid ng AI sovereignty, verifiable environments, at confidential-AI workloads. Iyan mismo ang grupo ng GPU at hyperscaler at ang paghuhubog ng demand na ang mga attestation primitive nila ay tatatag tungo sa isang mabibiling cloud-AI contract term, at ito ang may pinakamaagang anchor sa mga security track ng linggo.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Confidential Computing Summit opens today at the SF Mint, convening Amazon, AMD, Google, Meta, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Samsung around AI sovereignty, verifiable environments and confidential-AI workloads. That is precisely the GPU-and-hyperscaler cohort and demand framing whose attestation primitives would harden into a procurable cloud-AI contract term, and it is the soonest-anchored of the week''s security tracks.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.704ed815a795a447','source.b223b54796d63f54','2026-06-23','prediction.caadd5e48e1d9489','Enterprises self-host open-weight code models over hosted China APIs by Q2 2027','Enterprises self-host open-weight code models over hosted China APIs by Q2 2027','Enterprises self-host open-weight code models over hosted China APIs by Q2 2027','Enterprises self-host open-weight code models over hosted China APIs by Q2 2027','2026-06-18','Today''s lead directly advances the self-host-over-China-API thesis on its hardest axis -- making a Chinese frontier-class open-weight model runnable on owned hardware. Unsloth published Dynamic GGUF quantizations of Z.ai''s newly open-weighted GLM-5.2, a 744-billion-parameter mixture-of-experts model with a one-million-token context window, shrinking the 1.51TB checkpoint to about 239GB for the 2-bit build and roughly 217GB for the 1-bit build, small enough for a high-memory single-node workstation rather than a multi-GPU cluster, with local execution through Unsloth Studio. GLM-5.2 is positioned as benchmarking near the closed frontier on coding and reasoning, so the practical alternative to calling a hosted Chinese coding API is now self-hosting the same weights locally -- exactly the substitution the prediction tracks, and the data-locality logic strengthens against the same day''s OWASP/StakeBench agentic-security findings. The gap: this is a quantization-and-tooling enablement with compression and quality claims that are Unsloth''s own and unverified, not yet documented enterprise adoption choosing self-hosted GLM-class weights over hosted China APIs at scale.','[{"url": "https://aitoolly.com/ai-news/article/2026-06-23-unsloth-enables-local-execution-of-glm-52-a-744b-parameter-open-model-with-1m-context-window", "title": "AIToolly - Unsloth enables local execution of GLM-5.2, a 744B-parameter open model with a 1M context window"}]',4,'Unsloth''s Dynamic GGUF quantization shrinks Z.ai''s open-weight GLM-5.2, a 744B-parameter MoE benchmarking near the closed frontier, from a 1.51TB checkpoint to roughly 217-239GB, runnable on a single high-memory workstation via Unsloth Studio. That removes the multi-GPU-cluster barrier, making self-hosting frontier-class Chinese weights a practical substitute for calling a hosted China coding API.','Unsloth の Dynamic GGUF 量子化は、Z.ai のオープンウェイト GLM-5.2 ── クローズドなフロンティアに迫るベンチマーク水準の 7,440 億パラメータ MoE ── を、1.51TB のチェックポイントからおよそ 217〜239GB まで縮め、Unsloth Studio を介して大容量メモリの単一ワークステーションで動かせるようにする。これによりマルチ GPU クラスタという壁が取り払われ、フロンティア級の中国製の重みを自前ホストすることが、ホスト型の中国製コーディング API を呼ぶ現実的な代替手段になる。','La cuantización Dynamic GGUF de Unsloth reduce el GLM-5.2 de pesos abiertos de Z.ai, un MoE de 744.000 millones de parámetros cercano a la frontera cerrada, de un checkpoint de 1,51 TB a unos 217-239 GB, ejecutable en una sola estación de trabajo con mucha memoria mediante Unsloth Studio. Eso elimina la barrera del clúster multi-GPU y convierte el autoalojamiento de pesos chinos de clase frontera en un sustituto práctico de llamar a una API china de codificación alojada.','Pinaliit ng Dynamic GGUF quantization ng Unsloth ang open-weight na GLM-5.2 ng Z.ai, isang 744B-parameter MoE na halos kasinghusay ng saradong frontier, mula sa 1.51TB checkpoint tungo sa humigit-kumulang 217-239GB, na patatakbuhin sa iisang high-memory workstation sa pamamagitan ng Unsloth Studio. Inaalis niyon ang hadlang ng multi-GPU cluster, kaya nagiging praktikal na kapalit ang self-host ng frontier-class na Chinese weights para sa pagtawag sa isang hosted China coding API.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Unsloth''s Dynamic GGUF quantization shrinks Z.ai''s open-weight GLM-5.2, a 744B-parameter MoE benchmarking near the closed frontier, from a 1.51TB checkpoint to roughly 217-239GB, runnable on a single high-memory workstation via Unsloth Studio. That removes the multi-GPU-cluster barrier, making self-hosting frontier-class Chinese weights a practical substitute for calling a hosted China coding API.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.91d8bd6fc7858847','source.b223b54796d63f54','2026-06-23','prediction.caadd5e48e1d9489','Open-weight coding model tops 85 on Terminal-Bench 2.1 by Q4 2026','Open-weight coding model tops 85 on Terminal-Bench 2.1 by Q4 2026','Open-weight coding model tops 85 on Terminal-Bench 2.1 by Q4 2026','Open-weight coding model tops 85 on Terminal-Bench 2.1 by Q4 2026','2026-06-18','Today''s GLM-5.2 release bears on the open-weight-coding-capability thesis. Z.ai''s newly open-weighted GLM-5.2 is a 744-billion-parameter mixture-of-experts model that Unsloth positions as benchmarking near the closed frontier on coding and reasoning, now made locally runnable via Dynamic GGUF quantization. A frontier-class open-weight model claiming near-frontier coding performance is the kind of release that keeps the open tier on the trajectory toward topping a high coding-agent benchmark bar, which is the capability ceiling this prediction tracks. The match is on direction and capability framing, not the falsifiable measurement: the coding-strength claim is Unsloth''s and Z.ai''s own positioning, not an independently reproduced score, and there is no published Terminal-Bench 2.1 result for GLM-5.2 -- and aggressive 1-2 bit quantization trades measurable accuracy, so a self-hosted build may not even retain the unquantized model''s coding ceiling.','[{"url": "https://aitoolly.com/ai-news/article/2026-06-23-unsloth-enables-local-execution-of-glm-52-a-744b-parameter-open-model-with-1m-context-window", "title": "AIToolly - Unsloth enables local execution of GLM-5.2, a 744B-parameter open model with a 1M context window"}]',3,'Z.ai''s newly open-weighted GLM-5.2, a 744B-parameter MoE Unsloth positions as benchmarking near the closed frontier on coding and reasoning and now locally runnable via Dynamic GGUF quantization, is the kind of frontier-class open-weight release that keeps the open tier on trajectory toward topping a high coding-agent benchmark bar.','Z.ai が新たにオープンウェイト化した GLM-5.2 は、Unsloth がコーディングと推論でクローズドなフロンティアに迫るベンチマーク水準と位置づけ、Dynamic GGUF 量子化でいまやローカルで動かせる 7,440 億パラメータ MoE だ。これは、オープン層をコーディングエージェント向けの高いベンチマークの基準を超える軌道に乗せ続ける類の、フロンティア級オープンウェイトの公開だ。','El recién liberado GLM-5.2 de Z.ai, un MoE de 744.000 millones de parámetros que Unsloth posiciona como cercano a la frontera cerrada en codificación y razonamiento y ahora ejecutable en local mediante cuantización Dynamic GGUF, es el tipo de lanzamiento de pesos abiertos de clase frontera que mantiene al nivel abierto en la trayectoria hacia superar un listón alto en un benchmark de agentes de codificación.','Ang bagong open-weight na GLM-5.2 ng Z.ai, isang 744B-parameter MoE na inilalarawan ng Unsloth na halos kasinghusay ng saradong frontier sa coding at reasoning at patatakbuhin na ngayon nang lokal sa pamamagitan ng Dynamic GGUF quantization, ay ang uri ng frontier-class open-weight release na nagpapanatili sa open tier sa landas tungo sa pananaig sa isang mataas na coding-agent benchmark.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Z.ai''s newly open-weighted GLM-5.2, a 744B-parameter MoE Unsloth positions as benchmarking near the closed frontier on coding and reasoning and now locally runnable via Dynamic GGUF quantization, is the kind of frontier-class open-weight release that keeps the open tier on trajectory toward topping a high coding-agent benchmark bar.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.8d3908390de7fdce','source.b223b54796d63f54','2026-06-23','prediction.c2b0ba20d4477cec','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','2026-06-21','Two of today''s threads touch the prove-the-finding-by-running-it thesis. The events calendar lists AI Tinkerers San Francisco hosting an Offensive Security Demo Night on June 25 with live autonomous-pentesting-agent demos sponsored by XBOW, ahead of Black Hat USA''s AI Summit and DEF CON''s AI Village in August -- agents that chain reconnaissance, build a working exploit, and execute it to demonstrate reachability, which is Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation move generalized to a vendor field. In parallel, StakeBench ran 3,168 adversarial trials and found indirect prompt-injection success of 41.67-68.16% and direct attacks above 79% across every tested configuration, the kind of run-the-attack empirical validation that pushes the industry toward proof-of-exploit gates over static flagging. The relevance is on momentum and adjacency, not the landing: a demo night is conference-stage validation and StakeBench is an academic benchmark, neither is the defensive exploit-validation pipeline becoming an industry baseline across named code-security vendors, and the demo-night framing points at offensive attacker tooling rather than the defensive proof-of-exploit gate the prediction names.','[{"url": "https://xbow.com/offensive-ai-in-practice-workshop", "title": "XBOW - Offensive AI in Practice (sponsor of the AI Tinkerers SF Offensive Security Demo Night, June 25)"}, {"url": "https://www.csoonline.com/article/4184455/prompt-injection-breaks-todays-ai-agents-study-warns.html", "title": "CSO Online - Prompt injection breaks today''s AI agents, study warns (StakeBench)"}]',3,'Today''s signals push toward proof-of-exploit gating: the June 25 XBOW-sponsored Offensive Security Demo Night runs agents that chain recon, build a working exploit, and execute it to prove reachability, while StakeBench''s 3,168 adversarial trials supply the run-the-attack empiricism that erodes static flagging. Both are momentum and adjacency, not yet the defensive validation pipeline becoming baseline.','本日のシグナルは攻撃実証ゲートへと押しやる。6 月 25 日の XBOW 提供 Offensive Security Demo Night では、偵察を連鎖させ、動く攻撃コードを組み立て、それを実行して到達可能性を証明するエージェントが走る。一方で StakeBench の 3,168 件の敵対的試行は、攻撃を実際に走らせる実証を供給し、静的なフラグ付けを掘り崩す。いずれも勢いと隣接性であって、防御側の検証パイプラインが業界標準になったわけではまだない。','Las señales de hoy empujan hacia barreras de prueba de exploit: la Offensive Security Demo Night del 25 de junio patrocinada por XBOW ejecuta agentes que encadenan reconocimiento, construyen un exploit funcional y lo ejecutan para demostrar la accesibilidad, mientras que las 3.168 pruebas adversarias de StakeBench aportan la base empírica de ejecutar el ataque que erosiona el marcado estático. Ambos son impulso y cercanía, todavía no el flujo de validación defensiva convertido en estándar.','Nagtutulak ang mga senyales ngayon tungo sa proof-of-exploit gating. Ang Offensive Security Demo Night sa June 25 na ino-sponsor ng XBOW ay nagpapatakbo ng mga agent na nagkakadena ng recon, gumagawa ng gumaganang exploit, at isinasagawa ito para patunayan ang reachability, habang ang 3,168 adversarial trial ng StakeBench ang nagbibigay ng patakbuhin-ang-atake na empirismo na sumisira sa static flagging. Pareho itong momentum at kalapitan, hindi pa ang defensive validation pipeline na nagiging baseline.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Today''s signals push toward proof-of-exploit gating: the June 25 XBOW-sponsored Offensive Security Demo Night runs agents that chain recon, build a working exploit, and execute it to prove reachability, while StakeBench''s 3,168 adversarial trials supply the run-the-attack empiricism that erodes static flagging. Both are momentum and adjacency, not yet the defensive validation pipeline becoming baseline.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.dd9de784401e0969','source.b223b54796d63f54','2026-06-23','prediction.1d6d876dda44ddca','"Agent-in-the-Loop Secret Exfiltration" tops CIS / OWASP risk lists','"Agent-in-the-Loop Secret Exfiltration" tops CIS / OWASP risk lists','"Agent-in-the-Loop Secret Exfiltration" tops CIS / OWASP risk lists','"Agent-in-the-Loop Secret Exfiltration" tops CIS / OWASP risk lists','2026-04-20','[REVIVED] Layer 1 keyword hit (OWASP, indirect prompt injection, Claude Code, secret leakage, CI agents) and Layer 2 semantic match against today''s agentic-security headlines. OWASP''s State of Agentic AI Security and Governance v2.01 now ties nearly every risk category to concrete CVEs, vendor advisories, and breach reports, ranks the repositories carrying the most advisories with Claude Code at 22, and maps prompt injection to six of its ten Top 10 categories for agentic applications -- the connective attack vector across most incidents. StakeBench''s finding that no tested configuration resists prompt injection, plus Microsoft''s disclosure that injection in frameworks like Semantic Kernel can escalate to host-level RCE, frames credential and secret exposure through agent tool-calling as a documented, list-topping category. Nous Research''s Hermes Agent responding with MCP credential filtering, credential redaction, and SSRF protection shows the secret-exfiltration risk is now first-class enough to drive harness defaults. The gap to the dormant prediction''s exact bar: OWASP ranks prompt injection as the dominant category but does not name ''Agent-in-the-Loop Secret Exfiltration'' as a standalone top-ranked CIS/OWASP risk-list entry; the match is on the secret-leakage-via-agent threat being top-tier, not the specific label.','[{"url": "https://www.csoonline.com/article/4184455/prompt-injection-breaks-todays-ai-agents-study-warns.html", "title": "CSO Online - Prompt injection breaks today''s AI agents, study warns (StakeBench)"}, {"url": "https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/05/07/prompts-become-shells-rce-vulnerabilities-ai-agent-frameworks/", "title": "Microsoft Security - When prompts become shells: RCE vulnerabilities in AI agent frameworks"}]',4,'OWASP''s Agentic AI Security v2.01 ties risk categories to concrete CVEs and advisories, ranks Claude Code at 22 advisories, and maps prompt injection to six of its ten Top 10 categories; StakeBench finds no configuration resists injection and Microsoft shows injection escalating to host-level RCE. Hermes Agent''s MCP credential filtering shows secret-exfiltration is now first-class enough to set harness defaults.','OWASP の Agentic AI Security v2.01 は、リスク区分を具体的な CVE と勧告に結び付け、Claude Code を 22 件の勧告で順位付けし、プロンプト注入を Top 10 区分のうち 6 つに対応付ける。StakeBench はどの構成も注入に耐えないと見いだし、Microsoft は注入がホストレベルの RCE にまで拡大することを示す。Hermes Agent の MCP 認証情報フィルタリングは、機密情報の持ち出しが、いまやハーネスの既定を定めるほど一級の扱いになったことを示す。','El Agentic AI Security v2.01 de OWASP vincula las categorías de riesgo con CVE y avisos concretos, clasifica a Claude Code con 22 avisos y asigna la inyección de instrucciones a seis de sus diez categorías Top 10; StakeBench halla que ninguna configuración resiste la inyección y Microsoft muestra la inyección escalando a RCE a nivel de host. El filtrado de credenciales MCP del Hermes Agent muestra que la exfiltración de secretos es ya lo bastante prioritaria como para fijar los valores por defecto de los entornos.','Iniuugnay ng Agentic AI Security v2.01 ng OWASP ang mga risk category sa mga konkretong CVE at advisory, inuuri ang Claude Code sa 22 advisory, at iniuugnay ang prompt injection sa anim sa sampung Top 10 categories nito. Natuklasan ng StakeBench na walang configuration ang lumalaban sa injection at ipinakita ng Microsoft na tumataas ang injection tungo sa host-level RCE. Ang MCP credential filtering ng Hermes Agent ay nagpapakita na mahalaga na ngayon ang secret-exfiltration upang humubog ng mga default ng harness.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'OWASP''s Agentic AI Security v2.01 ties risk categories to concrete CVEs and advisories, ranks Claude Code at 22 advisories, and maps prompt injection to six of its ten Top 10 categories; StakeBench finds no configuration resists injection and Microsoft shows injection escalating to host-level RCE. Hermes Agent''s MCP credential filtering shows secret-exfiltration is now first-class enough to set harness defaults.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.8c30c77ff808c924','source.8f122e0ebede6822','2026-06-24','prediction.a2d6a1d80d9edd87','Orchestration benchmarks add a latency-disclosure column by Q1 2027','Orchestration benchmarks add a latency-disclosure column by Q1 2027','Orchestration benchmarks add a latency-disclosure column by Q1 2027','Orchestration benchmarks add a latency-disclosure column by Q1 2027','2026-06-24','Today''s lead is the direct origin signal for this thesis. Sakana AI''s Fugu, launched June 22 as a single OpenAI-compatible endpoint, is itself a language model trained to route, delegate, verify, and synthesize across a swappable pool of frontier LLMs with recursive calls to itself, built on the ICLR 2026 TRINITY and Conductor papers, and its Fugu Ultra tier is pitched at Anthropic Fable 5 and Mythos parity on Sakana''s own coding, scientific, and reasoning tables. The fresh development is the first independent pushback within 48 hours: Wharton''s Ethan Mollick ran Fugu Ultra on his standard shader and interactive-scene coding tests and reported it ''incredibly slow,'' with runs near 30 minutes rather than minutes and output that was ''fine'' but did not match Fable in practice -- so the published parity scores stay unreproduced. That is exactly the structural gap the prediction names: a router-as-a-model buys quality with wall-clock time that accuracy-only leaderboards never surface, and the reporting itself frames latency as the axis the benchmark tables hide. The gap to the falsifiable bar: this is one evaluator''s anecdote on a standard test, not yet a widely-cited benchmark or evaluator formalizing a latency/cost-per-task column for multi-model orchestration, nor an orchestration vendor publishing wall-clock SLAs.','[{"url": "https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/06/22/sakana-ai-launches-sakana-fugu-an-orchestration-model-that-routes-tasks-across-a-swappable-pool-of-frontier-llms/", "title": "MarkTechPost - Sakana AI launches Sakana Fugu, an orchestration model that routes tasks across a swappable pool of frontier LLMs"}, {"url": "https://www.techtimes.com/articles/318968/20260624/ai-orchestrator-sakana-fugu-claims-fable-5-parity-real-world-tests-reveal-30-minute-waits.htm", "title": "Tech Times - AI orchestrator Sakana Fugu claims Fable 5 parity; real-world tests reveal 30-minute waits"}]',5,'Sakana Fugu shipped as a router-model claiming Fable 5 parity, but within 48 hours Mollick ran it on standard coding tests and clocked roughly 30-minute waits with output that merely matched, leaving the scores unreproduced. That is the named mechanism: orchestration buys quality with wall-clock time accuracy-only leaderboards never surface, and the reporting itself frames latency as the hidden axis.','Sakana Fugu は Fable 5 並みをうたうルーター型モデルとして出荷された。だが48時間以内に Mollick が標準的なコーディングテストで走らせ、出力はかろうじて並ぶ程度なのに約30分の待ち時間を計測し、スコアは再現されないままに終わった。これが名指しされた仕組みである。オーケストレーションは、精度のみのリーダーボードには決して表れない実時間と引き換えに品質を買っており、報道自体が遅延を隠れた軸として取り上げている。','Sakana Fugu salió como un modelo enrutador que afirmaba estar a la par de Fable 5, pero en menos de 48 horas Mollick lo ejecutó en pruebas estándar de programación y midió esperas de unos 30 minutos con resultados que apenas igualaban, dejando las puntuaciones sin reproducir. Ese es el mecanismo señalado: la orquestación compra calidad a cambio de tiempo de reloj que las clasificaciones centradas solo en la precisión nunca muestran, y la propia cobertura plantea la latencia como el eje oculto.','Inilunsad ang Sakana Fugu bilang router-model na umaangkin ng parity sa Fable 5, pero sa loob ng 48 oras ay pinatakbo ito ni Mollick sa standard na coding tests at sinukat ang halos 30 minutong paghihintay, na may output na katumbas lamang, kaya nanatiling hindi pa nauulit ang mga score. Iyan ang pinangalanang mekanismo: ang orchestration ay bumibili ng kalidad gamit ang wall-clock time na hindi kailanman ipinapakita ng mga leaderboard na puro accuracy lang, at ang pag-uulat mismo ay binabalangkas ang latency bilang ang itinatagong aksis.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Sakana Fugu shipped as a router-model claiming Fable 5 parity, but within 48 hours Mollick ran it on standard coding tests and clocked roughly 30-minute waits with output that merely matched, leaving the scores unreproduced. That is the named mechanism: orchestration buys quality with wall-clock time accuracy-only leaderboards never surface, and the reporting itself frames latency as the hidden axis.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.d94c824222178480','source.8f122e0ebede6822','2026-06-24','prediction.b0ee98f79df6fe54','OpenAI locks equity-coupled HBM allocation with a memory maker by Q4 2026','OpenAI locks equity-coupled HBM allocation with a memory maker by Q4 2026','OpenAI locks equity-coupled HBM allocation with a memory maker by Q4 2026','OpenAI locks equity-coupled HBM allocation with a memory maker by Q4 2026','2026-06-24','Today''s business lead is the precipitating event for this thesis. Micron and Anthropic announced a June 22 strategic partnership bundling memory-and-storage co-design, a multi-year supply allocation across HBM, DRAM, and SSDs, an internal Claude rollout, and a strategic equity investment by Micron in Anthropic''s Series H. The $65 billion round at a roughly $965 billion post-money closed May 28, but the new fact is Micron''s entry, which leaves Anthropic the only frontier lab financially coupled to all three global HBM suppliers (Micron, Samsung, SK Hynix) -- a coupling no other lab holds. The prediction reads this as the trigger for a rival, most plausibly OpenAI, to secure its own equity-plus-multi-year-allocation deal with at least one of the three, converting the supply chain from purchasing into a contested ownership stake ahead of expected Q4 2026 memory-vendor listings. The signal to watch is a disclosed strategic-investment-plus-allocation deal between a non-Anthropic lab and an HBM maker. The gap: the news establishes the competitive pressure and the template, but no rival lab has yet been reported securing an equity-coupled HBM allocation, and Micron''s investment size was undisclosed.','[{"url": "https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/micron-anthropic-strategic-infrastructure-agreement-2026", "title": "Digital Applied - Micron and Anthropic strike a strategic AI infrastructure deal"}]',5,'Micron''s June 22 equity-plus-multi-year-allocation deal with Anthropic leaves one lab coupled to all three HBM suppliers, and that asymmetry is precisely the competitive force the thesis names. It hands rivals a proven template and a sharp incentive to convert memory purchasing into a contested ownership stake before the expected Q4 2026 vendor listings.','6月22日の Micron による Anthropic との出資＋複数年供給枠の取り決めにより、一つの研究所が HBM 三大供給元すべてと結びつく状態が生まれた。この非対称性こそ、この見立てが名指しする競争上の力そのものである。これはライバルに対し、実証済みの雛形と、Q4 2026 に見込まれるベンダー上場を前にメモリ購買を争奪される所有権益へ転換する鋭い動機を与える。','El acuerdo del 22 de junio de Micron con Anthropic, de capital más asignación plurianual, deja a un laboratorio vinculado a los tres proveedores de HBM, y esa asimetría es precisamente la fuerza competitiva que señala la tesis. Entrega a los rivales una plantilla probada y un fuerte incentivo para convertir la compra de memoria en una participación de propiedad en disputa antes de las cotizaciones de proveedores previstas para el cuarto trimestre de 2026.','Ang June 22 equity-plus-multi-year-allocation na kasunduan ng Micron sa Anthropic ay nag-iiwan sa isang lab na nakaugnay sa lahat ng tatlong HBM supplier, at ang asimetriyang iyon mismo ang competitive na puwersang pinangalanan ng tesis. Nag-aabot ito sa mga karibal ng isang napatunayang template at isang matalas na insentibo para baguhin ang pagbili ng memory tungo sa isang pinag-aagawang ownership stake bago ang inaasahang Q4 2026 na pag-list ng mga vendor.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Micron''s June 22 equity-plus-multi-year-allocation deal with Anthropic leaves one lab coupled to all three HBM suppliers, and that asymmetry is precisely the competitive force the thesis names. It hands rivals a proven template and a sharp incentive to convert memory purchasing into a contested ownership stake before the expected Q4 2026 vendor listings.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.076be1e20acde811','source.8f122e0ebede6822','2026-06-24','prediction.568eecc474844ffb','General-purpose mobile cobots cross 100K production-operation hours by H1 2027','General-purpose mobile cobots cross 100K production-operation hours by H1 2027','General-purpose mobile cobots cross 100K production-operation hours by H1 2027','General-purpose mobile cobots cross 100K production-operation hours by H1 2027','2026-06-24','Today''s physical-AI lead is the source signal for this thesis. Collaborative Robotics unveiled its second-generation Proxie on June 22 at Automate 2026 as a general-purpose mobile collaborative robot that identifies the work and does it with zero software integration and no human dispatcher, moving task inference fully on-robot with no cloud dependency for core execution via a ScoutSense sensor stack, moving carts up to 1,500 pounds, lifting up to 200 pounds, at $5,000 per month. Cobot anchored the launch on a first-generation production record: 12,627 hours logged in real operations, over 40 million pounds moved, and more than 17 million human steps saved across hospitals, manufacturing, and logistics on 16-hour shifts. That is exactly the pivot the prediction names -- physical-AI vendors competing on audited hours-in-operation and dollars-of-material-moved instead of show-floor clips, with monthly-subscription pricing turning operating hours into the underwriting unit. The gap to the bar: 12,627 first-generation hours is a single-platform figure roughly an order of magnitude below the six-figure cumulative cross-customer fleet record the prediction requires, and no vendor has yet framed a 100,000-plus-hour fleet number as a deployment metric.','[{"url": "https://www.roboticstomorrow.com/news/2026/06/22/cobot-announces-second-generation-proxie-bringing-production-tested-physical-ai-to-real-operations/26756/", "title": "Robotics Tomorrow - Cobot announces second-generation Proxie, bringing production-tested physical AI to real operations"}, {"url": "https://www.packworld.com/leaders-new/machinery/robotics/article/22969383/physical-ai-dominates-automate-2026s-opening-day-while-humanoids-steal-the-show-floor", "title": "Packaging World - Physical AI dominates Automate 2026''s opening day while humanoids steal the show floor"}]',5,'Cobot''s second-generation Proxie launch validates the mechanism: it anchored the reveal on a quantified production record -- 12,627 operating hours, 40 million pounds moved, 17 million steps saved -- and priced at $5,000 per month, so subscription billing makes audited hours-in-operation the unit vendors compete and underwrite on, exactly the pivot from show-floor clips this thesis names.','Cobot の第二世代 Proxie の発表は、この仕組みを裏付ける。発表は定量的な本番実績を拠り所とした。12,627時間の稼働、4,000万ポンドの運搬、1,700万歩の節約であり、価格は月額5,000ドルだ。サブスク課金により、監査済みの稼働時間がベンダーの競争と引き受けの単位となる。これこそ、この見立てが名指しする、展示会場の映像からの転換そのものである。','El lanzamiento del Proxie de segunda generación de Cobot valida el mecanismo: ancló la presentación en un historial de producción cuantificado (12.627 horas de operación, 40 millones de libras movidas, 17 millones de pasos ahorrados) y con un precio de 5.000 dólares al mes, de modo que la facturación por suscripción convierte las horas de operación auditadas en la unidad con la que los proveedores compiten y fijan su tarificación, exactamente el giro desde los clips de feria que señala esta tesis.','Pinatutunayan ng paglulunsad ng ikalawang henerasyong Proxie ng Cobot ang mekanismo: iniangkla nito ang reveal sa isang sinukat na production record -- 12,627 oras ng operasyon, 40 milyong libra ang naihakot, 17 milyong steps ang naitipid -- at pinresyuhan sa $5,000 kada buwan, kaya ginagawa ng subscription billing na ang audited na oras-sa-operasyon ang unit na pinagkukumpitensyahan at ini-underwrite ng mga vendor, na siyang mismong pagbabago mula sa mga clip sa show floor na pinangalanan ng tesis na ito.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Cobot''s second-generation Proxie launch validates the mechanism: it anchored the reveal on a quantified production record -- 12,627 operating hours, 40 million pounds moved, 17 million steps saved -- and priced at $5,000 per month, so subscription billing makes audited hours-in-operation the unit vendors compete and underwrite on, exactly the pivot from show-floor clips this thesis names.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.4611ba73b8aceb49','source.8f122e0ebede6822','2026-06-24','prediction.1ce328e19c9e6685','Captive in-house fleets will lead paid humanoid deployment by H1 2028','Captive in-house fleets will lead paid humanoid deployment by H1 2028','Captive in-house fleets will lead paid humanoid deployment by H1 2028','Captive in-house fleets will lead paid humanoid deployment by H1 2028','2026-06-22','Today''s Cobot Gen 2 launch and the Automate 2026 floor bear on the captive-fleet-leads-paid-deployment thesis. Collaborative Robotics'' second-generation Proxie ships on-robot inference with a quantified Gen 1 operating record (12,627 hours, 40 million pounds moved, 17 million human steps saved across hospitals, manufacturing, and logistics) at $5,000-per-month subscription -- a productized deployment whose proof points come from real operational sites rather than pilots. The launch sits inside Automate 2026 (June 22-25, McCormick Place), whose dominant theme is physical AI and whose first-time NVIDIA-sponsored Humanoid Robot Pavilion hosts more than 20 humanoid platforms, framed as the industry''s shift from humanoid research to commercial deployment. That is the demand-and-supply backdrop in which captive operators converting their own sites into paid, audited deployments stay ahead of merchant humanoid sales. The gap: a mobile cobot subscription and a humanoid show pavilion are adjacency, not the falsifiable bar -- no captive in-house humanoid fleet has been shown leading paid humanoid deployment, and Proxie is a wheeled cobot, not a humanoid.','[{"url": "https://www.packworld.com/leaders-new/machinery/robotics/article/22969383/physical-ai-dominates-automate-2026s-opening-day-while-humanoids-steal-the-show-floor", "title": "Packaging World - Physical AI dominates Automate 2026''s opening day while humanoids steal the show floor"}, {"url": "https://www.automateshow.com/education-networking/humanoid-robot-pavilion", "title": "Automate - Humanoid Robot Pavilion sponsored by NVIDIA (June 22-25, 2026)"}]',4,'Cobot''s second-gen Proxie ships subscription-priced, its proof points audited operating hours from real customer sites rather than pilots, launched inside an Automate floor whose dominant theme is humanoids moving from research to commercial deployment. That is the operator-led, real-site backdrop in which captive fleets converting their own operations into paid deployment stay ahead of merchant humanoid sales.','Cobot の第二世代 Proxie はサブスク料金で提供され、その実証点は試験運用ではなく実際の顧客サイトでの監査済み稼働時間だ。主たるテーマがヒューマノイドの研究から商用展開への移行である Automate の会場の内側で発表された。これが、自社の運用を有償展開へ転換する保有機体群が、商用ヒューマノイド販売の先を行く、事業者主導かつ実サイトに基づく背景である。','El Proxie de segunda generación de Cobot llega con precio de suscripción, y sus pruebas son horas de operación auditadas de sitios reales de clientes en lugar de pilotos, lanzado dentro de un recinto de Automate cuyo tema dominante son los humanoides pasando de la investigación al despliegue comercial. Ese es el telón de fondo liderado por operadores y basado en sitios reales en el que las flotas cautivas que convierten sus propias operaciones en despliegue de pago se adelantan a la venta de humanoides comerciales.','Ang ikalawang henerasyong Proxie ng Cobot ay inihahatid nang may subscription na presyo, ang mga patunay nito ay audited na oras ng operasyon mula sa tunay na customer sites sa halip na mga pilot, at inilunsad sa loob ng isang Automate floor na ang nangingibabaw na tema ay ang paglipat ng mga humanoid mula sa research patungo sa commercial deployment. Iyon ang operator-led at tunay-na-site na backdrop kung saan ang mga captive fleet na nagbabago ng sariling operasyon tungo sa bayad na deployment ay nananatiling nangunguna sa merchant humanoid sales.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Cobot''s second-gen Proxie ships subscription-priced, its proof points audited operating hours from real customer sites rather than pilots, launched inside an Automate floor whose dominant theme is humanoids moving from research to commercial deployment. That is the operator-led, real-site backdrop in which captive fleets converting their own operations into paid deployment stay ahead of merchant humanoid sales.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.05521b636b1a59d1','source.8f122e0ebede6822','2026-06-24','prediction.0f3d7e1692918892','Rival humanoid maker lands $500M-plus chip-and-cloud strategic round by Q4 2026','Rival humanoid maker lands $500M-plus chip-and-cloud strategic round by Q4 2026','Rival humanoid maker lands $500M-plus chip-and-cloud strategic round by Q4 2026','Rival humanoid maker lands $500M-plus chip-and-cloud strategic round by Q4 2026','2026-06-18','Today''s Automate 2026 coverage supports the humanoid-capital thesis on momentum, not on a financing event. The show''s first-time NVIDIA-sponsored Humanoid Robot Pavilion hosts more than 20 humanoid platforms and the floor narrative is the industry''s shift from humanoid research to commercial deployment, with NVIDIA explicitly sponsoring the marquee humanoid venue -- the chip-and-cloud backer the prediction expects to anchor a strategic round. A dense field of humanoid entrants competing for the same compute-and-capital partners is the structural pressure that pulls a rival maker toward a $500M-plus chip-and-cloud strategic round. The gap is large: a sponsored pavilion is conference visibility and vendor-ecosystem signaling, not a disclosed strategic financing; no humanoid maker has been reported closing a $500M-plus chip-and-cloud round, and NVIDIA''s sponsorship is event marketing rather than an equity commitment.','[{"url": "https://www.automateshow.com/education-networking/humanoid-robot-pavilion", "title": "Automate - Humanoid Robot Pavilion sponsored by NVIDIA (June 22-25, 2026)"}, {"url": "https://www.packworld.com/leaders-new/machinery/robotics/article/22969383/physical-ai-dominates-automate-2026s-opening-day-while-humanoids-steal-the-show-floor", "title": "Packaging World - Physical AI dominates Automate 2026''s opening day while humanoids steal the show floor"}]',3,'Automate 2026''s first-time NVIDIA-sponsored Humanoid Pavilion packs over twenty platforms into one venue, with the chip-and-cloud backer staking the marquee floor. A field that dense competing for the same compute partners is precisely the structural pressure that pulls a rival maker toward a large strategic round, even though sponsorship is visibility, not capital.','Automate 2026 で初めて NVIDIA がスポンサーを務める Humanoid Pavilion は、20を超えるプラットフォームを一つの場に詰め込み、チップ・クラウドの後ろ盾が看板の会場に名乗りを上げている。これほど密集した一団が同じ計算パートナーを奪い合う状況は、まさにライバルメーカーを大型の戦略ラウンドへ引き寄せる構造的圧力だ。もっとも、スポンサーは可視性であって資本ではない。','El Humanoid Pavilion de Automate 2026, patrocinado por primera vez por NVIDIA, reúne más de veinte plataformas en un solo espacio, con el respaldo de chips y nube apostando por el recinto estrella. Un campo tan denso compitiendo por los mismos socios de cómputo es precisamente la presión estructural que empuja a un fabricante rival hacia una gran ronda estratégica, aunque el patrocinio sea visibilidad, no capital.','Ang unang-beses na NVIDIA-sponsored na Humanoid Pavilion ng Automate 2026 ay nagsisiksik ng mahigit dalawampung platform sa iisang venue, kung saan inaangkin ng chip-and-cloud na tagasuporta ang pangunahing floor. Ang ganoon kasiksik na hanay na nagkukumpitensya para sa parehong compute partner ang mismong structural na presyon na humihila sa isang karibal na gumawa patungo sa isang malaking strategic round, kahit na ang sponsorship ay visibility, hindi kapital.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Automate 2026''s first-time NVIDIA-sponsored Humanoid Pavilion packs over twenty platforms into one venue, with the chip-and-cloud backer staking the marquee floor. A field that dense competing for the same compute partners is precisely the structural pressure that pulls a rival maker toward a large strategic round, even though sponsorship is visibility, not capital.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.7ca398543b18a973','source.8f122e0ebede6822','2026-06-24','prediction.197bc00f1714ad4b','Automaker-built humanoid programs add a second high-volume entrant by Q2 2027','Automaker-built humanoid programs add a second high-volume entrant by Q2 2027','Automaker-built humanoid programs add a second high-volume entrant by Q2 2027','Automaker-built humanoid programs add a second high-volume entrant by Q2 2027','2026-06-07','[REVIVED] Layer 2 semantic match against today''s Automate 2026 physical-AI floor coverage (Signals: humanoid-robot field, additional high-volume automaker by Q2 2027, working prototype, integrated cohort). The first-time NVIDIA-sponsored Humanoid Robot Pavilion hosts more than 20 humanoid platforms and the dominant theme is the industry''s shift from humanoid research to commercial deployment, the kind of dense vertically-integrated entrant field in which a second high-volume automaker-built humanoid program would surface. The relevance is on ecosystem breadth, not the falsifiable bar: the pavilion''s 20-plus platforms are not identified by maker in today''s reporting, so there is no named second automaker disclosing a humanoid program with a working prototype and production cost-down target, and a show pavilion is exhibition presence rather than an on-record program commitment.','[{"url": "https://www.packworld.com/leaders-new/machinery/robotics/article/22969383/physical-ai-dominates-automate-2026s-opening-day-while-humanoids-steal-the-show-floor", "title": "Packaging World - Physical AI dominates Automate 2026''s opening day while humanoids steal the show floor"}, {"url": "https://www.automateshow.com/education-networking/humanoid-robot-pavilion", "title": "Automate - Humanoid Robot Pavilion sponsored by NVIDIA (June 22-25, 2026)"}]',3,'Automate 2026''s first-time NVIDIA-sponsored Humanoid Robot Pavilion gathers more than twenty platforms under a banner of moving from humanoid research to commercial deployment. That dense, vertically-integrated entrant field is the structural pressure that pulls a second high-volume automaker toward its own humanoid program. The breadth is real; the specific second maker is not yet visible.','Automate 2026 で初めて NVIDIA がスポンサーを務める Humanoid Robot Pavilion は、ヒューマノイド研究から商用展開へ移るという旗印のもと、20を超えるプラットフォームを集める。この密集した垂直統合の参入企業の一団は、二社目の大量生産型自動車メーカーを自前のヒューマノイド計画へ引き寄せる構造的圧力だ。広がりは本物だが、特定の二社目のメーカーはまだ見えていない。','El Humanoid Robot Pavilion de Automate 2026, patrocinado por primera vez por NVIDIA, reúne más de veinte plataformas bajo el lema del paso de la investigación humanoide al despliegue comercial. Ese campo denso de aspirantes integrados verticalmente es la presión estructural que empuja a un segundo fabricante de automóviles de alto volumen hacia su propio programa humanoide. La amplitud es real; el segundo fabricante concreto aún no es visible.','Ang unang-beses na NVIDIA-sponsored na Humanoid Robot Pavilion ng Automate 2026 ay nagtitipon ng mahigit dalawampung platform sa ilalim ng banner ng paglipat mula sa humanoid research patungo sa commercial deployment. Ang siksik at vertically-integrated na hanay ng entrant na iyon ang structural na presyon na humihila sa isang ikalawang high-volume na automaker tungo sa sarili nitong humanoid program. Tunay ang lawak; ang tiyak na ikalawang maker ay hindi pa nakikita.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Automate 2026''s first-time NVIDIA-sponsored Humanoid Robot Pavilion gathers more than twenty platforms under a banner of moving from humanoid research to commercial deployment. That dense, vertically-integrated entrant field is the structural pressure that pulls a second high-volume automaker toward its own humanoid program. The breadth is real; the specific second maker is not yet visible.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.b2493ffc3aa5097e','source.8f122e0ebede6822','2026-06-24','prediction.a943725fb4046b01','An autonomous-pentest vendor lands a named enterprise/gov deal by Q1 2027','An autonomous-pentest vendor lands a named enterprise/gov deal by Q1 2027','An autonomous-pentest vendor lands a named enterprise/gov deal by Q1 2027','An autonomous-pentest vendor lands a named enterprise/gov deal by Q1 2027','2026-06-22','Today''s events calendar supports the autonomous-pentest-vendor thesis on visibility, not on a contract. AI Tinkerers San Francisco hosts an Offensive Security Demo Night on June 25 with live autonomous-pentesting-agent demos backed by sponsor XBOW, ahead of Black Hat USA''s AI Summit (August 1-6) and DEF CON''s AI Village in August -- with XBOW, a named autonomous-pentest vendor, putting its agents on a public stage as it builds the commercial profile that precedes enterprise and government deals. The forward security calendar (SecurityWeek AI Risk Summit, OWASP Global AppSec USA, Zenity''s series on the watch list) keeps the buyer-side attention on agentic offensive tooling. The gap to the bar: a sponsored demo night is conference-stage marketing, not a disclosed named enterprise or government contract; no autonomous-pentest vendor has been reported landing such a deal in today''s news.','[{"url": "https://www.ai.engineer/worldsfair/schedule", "title": "AI Engineer World''s Fair 2026 schedule (June 29-July 2, Moscone West)"}]',3,'XBOW, a named autonomous-pentest vendor, puts its agents on a public stage at the June 25 Offensive Security Demo Night, ahead of Black Hat''s AI Summit and DEF CON''s AI Village. That visible commercial profile-building is the buyer-facing groundwork that typically precedes the kind of enterprise or government contract the thesis expects.','名の通った自律型ペンテスト・ベンダーである XBOW は、Black Hat の AI Summit と DEF CON の AI Village に先立つ6月25日の Offensive Security Demo Night で、自社エージェントを公の舞台に乗せる。こうした目に見える商用の存在感づくりは、この見立てが見込む企業・政府契約に通常先立つ、買い手に向けた下地である。','XBOW, un proveedor de pentesting autónomo nombrado, pone sus agentes en un escenario público en la Offensive Security Demo Night del 25 de junio, antes del AI Summit de Black Hat y el AI Village de DEF CON. Esa construcción visible de perfil comercial es el trabajo de cara al comprador que suele preceder al tipo de contrato empresarial o gubernamental que la tesis espera.','Ang XBOW, isang pinangalanang autonomous-pentest vendor, ay inilalagay ang mga agent nito sa isang pampublikong entablado sa June 25 Offensive Security Demo Night, bago ang AI Summit ng Black Hat at ang AI Village ng DEF CON. Ang nakikitang pagbuo ng commercial na profile na iyon ang buyer-facing na paghahanda na karaniwang nauuna sa uri ng kontrata sa enterprise o gobyerno na inaasahan ng tesis.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'XBOW, a named autonomous-pentest vendor, puts its agents on a public stage at the June 25 Offensive Security Demo Night, ahead of Black Hat''s AI Summit and DEF CON''s AI Village. That visible commercial profile-building is the buyer-facing groundwork that typically precedes the kind of enterprise or government contract the thesis expects.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.516f25862a1cb426','source.8f122e0ebede6822','2026-06-24','prediction.c2b0ba20d4477cec','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','2026-06-21','Today''s events calendar touches the prove-the-finding-by-running-it thesis. AI Tinkerers San Francisco hosts an Offensive Security Demo Night on June 25 with live autonomous-pentesting-agent demos backed by sponsor XBOW, ahead of Black Hat USA''s AI Summit and DEF CON''s AI Village in August -- agents that chain reconnaissance, build a working exploit, and execute it to demonstrate reachability, which is Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation move generalized to the offensive vendor field. The forward security calendar keeps proof-of-exploit tooling in front of buyers and conference audiences. The relevance is on momentum and adjacency, not the landing: a demo night is conference-stage offensive validation, not the defensive exploit-validation pipeline becoming an industry baseline across named code-security vendors, and the demo-night framing points at offensive attacker tooling rather than the defensive proof-of-exploit gate the prediction names.','[{"url": "https://www.ai.engineer/worldsfair/schedule", "title": "AI Engineer World''s Fair 2026 schedule (June 29-July 2, Moscone West)"}]',3,'June 25''s XBOW-backed Offensive Security Demo Night, with agents that chain recon, build a working exploit, and execute it to prove reachability, supplies exactly the machine-built proof-of-exploit substrate that makes validation-by-construction credible to replicate across vendors, and the August Black Hat and DEF CON calendar keeps that tooling in front of buyers.','6月25日の XBOW が後ろ盾となる Offensive Security Demo Night では、偵察を連鎖させ、動作するエクスプロイトを構築し、それを実行して到達可能性を証明するエージェントが、ベンダー横断で再現するに足る、機械が組み立てたエクスプロイト実証の基盤を、まさに供給する。これにより構築による検証が信頼に値するものとなり、8月の Black Hat と DEF CON のカレンダーがそのツールを買い手の前に置き続ける。','La Offensive Security Demo Night del 25 de junio respaldada por XBOW, con agentes que encadenan reconocimiento, construyen un exploit funcional y lo ejecutan para demostrar accesibilidad, aporta exactamente el sustrato de prueba de exploit construido por máquina que hace creíble replicar la validación por construcción entre proveedores, y el calendario de Black Hat y DEF CON de agosto mantiene esas herramientas frente a los compradores.','Ang XBOW-backed na Offensive Security Demo Night ng June 25, na may mga agent na nagkakadena ng recon, bumubuo ng gumaganang exploit, at isinasagawa ito upang patunayan ang reachability, ay naghahatid ng mismong machine-built na proof-of-exploit na substrate na nagpapaniwala sa validation-by-construction na maaaring ulitin sa mga vendor, at ang kalendaryo ng Black Hat at DEF CON sa Agosto ay pinananatili ang tooling na iyon sa harap ng mga buyer.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'June 25''s XBOW-backed Offensive Security Demo Night, with agents that chain recon, build a working exploit, and execute it to prove reachability, supplies exactly the machine-built proof-of-exploit substrate that makes validation-by-construction credible to replicate across vendors, and the August Black Hat and DEF CON calendar keeps that tooling in front of buyers.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.6e305197f973041b','source.8f122e0ebede6822','2026-06-24','prediction.68471e3864b2aa7e','Corsair-class inference silicon books a named hyperscaler deployment by Q3 2027','Corsair-class inference silicon books a named hyperscaler deployment by Q3 2027','Corsair-class inference silicon books a named hyperscaler deployment by Q3 2027','Corsair-class inference silicon books a named hyperscaler deployment by Q3 2027','2026-06-17','Today''s AI-chip calendar bears weakly on the inference-silicon deployment thesis by supplying the venue cadence where such bookings surface. The hardware track runs near-continuous from Automate 2026 (June 22-25, McCormick Place) through AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23 at Moscone, Instinct MI400-series focus expected, keynote July 23), Hot Chips 2026 (August 23-25 at Stanford), and the AI Infra Summit (September 15-17, Santa Clara) -- the stacked accelerator-venue calendar where a Corsair-class inference-silicon vendor would stage a named hyperscaler deployment announcement. The relevance is purely on calendar context: a list of upcoming chip conferences is scheduling, not a booking; no inference-silicon vendor has been reported securing a named hyperscaler deployment in today''s news, and the AMD focus named is MI400-series accelerators, not a Corsair-class inference part.','[{"url": "https://www.automateshow.com/education-networking/humanoid-robot-pavilion", "title": "Automate - Humanoid Robot Pavilion sponsored by NVIDIA (June 22-25, 2026)"}]',2,'Today''s stacked accelerator-venue calendar -- Automate, AMD''s Advancing AI in July, Hot Chips in August, the AI Infra Summit in September -- is the near-continuous stage where a named hyperscaler inference-silicon booking would surface, supplying the timing backdrop the thesis assumes. But it is only scheduling: no such deployment was announced, and AMD''s named focus is MI400-series accelerators.','本日の積み重なったアクセラレータ会場のカレンダー、すなわち Automate、7月の AMD の Advancing AI、8月の Hot Chips、9月の AI Infra Summit は、名指しのハイパースケーラー向け推論シリコン受注が現れるであろうほぼ途切れない舞台であり、この見立てが前提とするタイミングの背景を供給する。だがそれは予定に過ぎない。そうした展開は発表されておらず、AMD の名指しされた重点は MI400 シリーズのアクセラレータだ。','El calendario apilado de eventos de aceleradores de hoy (Automate, Advancing AI de AMD en julio, Hot Chips en agosto, el AI Infra Summit en septiembre) es el escenario casi continuo donde surgiría la reserva de silicio de inferencia para un hyperscaler nombrado, aportando el trasfondo de cronograma que supone la tesis. Pero es solo planificación: no se anunció tal despliegue, y el foco nombrado de AMD es la serie de aceleradores MI400.','Ang nakasalansang kalendaryo ng accelerator-venue ngayon -- Automate, Advancing AI ng AMD sa Hulyo, Hot Chips sa Agosto, ang AI Infra Summit sa Setyembre -- ang halos tuluy-tuloy na entablado kung saan lilitaw ang isang pinangalanang hyperscaler inference-silicon booking, na nagbibigay ng timing backdrop na ipinapalagay ng tesis. Ngunit scheduling lamang ito: walang ganoong deployment na inanunsyo, at ang pinangalanang pokus ng AMD ay mga MI400-series accelerator.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Today''s stacked accelerator-venue calendar -- Automate, AMD''s Advancing AI in July, Hot Chips in August, the AI Infra Summit in September -- is the near-continuous stage where a named hyperscaler inference-silicon booking would surface, supplying the timing backdrop the thesis assumes. But it is only scheduling: no such deployment was announced, and AMD''s named focus is MI400-series accelerators.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.f3844dea127313a6','source.4d2f87c264f2ac42','2026-06-25','prediction.225d77f109a86780','Inference-ASIC cohort gains a fourth named buyer-designed chip by H1 2027','Inference-ASIC cohort gains a fourth named buyer-designed chip by H1 2027','Inference-ASIC cohort gains a fourth named buyer-designed chip by H1 2027','Inference-ASIC cohort gains a fourth named buyer-designed chip by H1 2027','2026-06-25','OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno unveil (June 24) is the precipitating origin signal for this thesis. OpenAI and Broadcom debuted Jalapeno, OpenAI''s first custom inference accelerator and the first chip from a multi-year co-design effort, framed as an ''Intelligence Processor'' architected around LLM inference rather than training. Engineering samples are already running machine-learning workloads in the lab at production target frequency and power, OpenAI claims performance per watt ''substantially better than current state-of-the-art,'' and initial data-center deployment is targeted by end of 2026 at gigawatt scale. The platform is rack-scale: Broadcom''s Tomahawk fabric (up to 1.6 terabits per second) wires the accelerators together and Celestia is co-designing the server rack. The structural read in today''s reporting is exactly the prediction''s premise -- the largest frontier-model buyer is now following the hyperscaler playbook of designing its own inference ASIC to escape merchant-GPU economics, placing a named OpenAI-Broadcom part alongside the Google-Broadcom TPU and Amazon Trainium lineage. The gap to the falsifiable bar: the cohort''s fourth member is not yet here. No additional frontier-model buyer (Anthropic, Meta, xAI, or Microsoft) has publicly committed to or unveiled its own rack-scale inference accelerator, and the falsifiable core requires a named part or firm public commitment -- not a ''exploring custom silicon'' rumor, and not an extension of an existing TPU or Trainium line.','[{"url": "https://siliconangle.com/2026/06/24/openai-broadcom-debut-custom-jalapeno-chip-llm-inference/", "title": "SiliconANGLE - OpenAI, Broadcom debut custom Jalapeno chip for AI inference"}, {"url": "https://www.neowin.net/news/openai-and-broadcom-unveil-jalapeo-a-new-ai-chip-built-for-llm-inference/", "title": "Neowin - OpenAI and Broadcom unveil Jalapeno, a new AI chip built for LLM inference"}, {"url": "https://www.constellationr.com/insights/news/openai-broadcom-unveil-first-ai-inference-chip", "title": "Constellation Research - OpenAI, Broadcom unveil first AI inference chip"}]',5,'Today''s OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno unveil is the precondition the Inference-ASIC cohort gains a fourth named buyer-designed chip by H1 2027 (2026-06-25) thesis rests on: the largest frontier-model buyer ships a named, co-designed inference accelerator with partner fabric and an end-2026 deployment target, confirming the escape-hatch template peers now face pressure to copy.','本日のOpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno発表は、「推論ASICを設計する企業群が2027年上半期までに4社目の自社設計チップを得る」という見立て(2026-06-25)が前提とする条件そのものだ。最大手のフロンティアモデル購入者が、パートナーのファブリックを伴い2026年末展開を目標とする、名前のある共同設計の推論アクセラレータを世に出す。これは、同業他社がいまや模倣を迫られる「脱出口」のテンプレートを裏づけている。','La presentación del Jalapeno de OpenAI-Broadcom hoy es la precondición sobre la que descansa la tesis Inference-ASIC cohort gains a fourth named buyer-designed chip by H1 2027 (2026-06-25): el mayor comprador de modelos de frontera lanza un acelerador de inferencia nombrado y codiseñado, con tejido del socio y un objetivo de despliegue para finales de 2026, confirmando la plantilla de escape que los rivales ahora sienten presión por copiar.','Ang pag-unveil ng OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno ngayon ang precondition na pinaghahawakan ng thesis na Inference-ASIC cohort gains a fourth named buyer-designed chip by H1 2027 (2026-06-25): naglulunsad ang pinakamalaking buyer ng frontier-model ng isang pinangalanan at co-designed na inference accelerator na may partner fabric at target na deployment sa katapusan ng 2026. Pinatutunayan nito ang template ng escape-hatch na nararamdaman na ngayon ng mga kapantay na kailangang kopyahin.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Today''s OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno unveil is the precondition the Inference-ASIC cohort gains a fourth named buyer-designed chip by H1 2027 (2026-06-25) thesis rests on: the largest frontier-model buyer ships a named, co-designed inference accelerator with partner fabric and an end-2026 deployment target, confirming the escape-hatch template peers now face pressure to copy.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.1094fa24ff6c7b24','source.4d2f87c264f2ac42','2026-06-25','prediction.3a5fa9315f58608d','Agentic coding platforms ship token budgets and caps as default by Q2 2027','Agentic coding platforms ship token budgets and caps as default by Q2 2027','Agentic coding platforms ship token budgets and caps as default by Q2 2027','Agentic coding platforms ship token budgets and caps as default by Q2 2027','2026-06-25','Gartner agentic-coding token-economics note (June 24) is the origin signal and reads as the product spec for this thesis. Gartner predicts that by 2028 the cost of AI coding will surpass the average developer''s salary, driven by rising LLM token consumption and the shift to consumption-based pricing for agentic coding tools. The quotable thresholds are the news: 23 percent of technology leaders already spend $200-$500 per developer per month on tokens, and 6 percent of organizations pay more than $2,000 per developer per month. Gartner pins the steepest cost escalation on ungoverned autonomy in agent-driven workflows, bloated context windows, and the absence of structured feedback to optimize usage, naming the autonomous-developer-loop tools (the Cursor / Claude Code / Codex CLI class of agentic IDEs) as the per-seat cost center, and reframes the productivity narrative as a governance problem requiring a governed engineering operating model before scaled agent deployment outruns the gains. That diagnosis is the spec for the predicted default feature set: per-seat and per-team token budgets, hard and soft caps, real-time usage dashboards, and policy guardrails on autonomy depth and context-window size. The gap to the bar: this is an analyst projection, not a shipped product. No major agentic-coding platform has yet shipped admin-side consumption-governance controls as on-by-default features; the prediction needs vendors to make the spend-governance layer table stakes by Q2 2027.','[{"url": "https://www.gartner.com/en/newsroom/press-releases/2026-06-24-gartner-predicts-ai-coding-costs-will-surpass-average-developer-salary-by-2028-as-token-consumption-surges", "title": "Gartner - AI coding costs will surpass the average developer''s salary by 2028 as token consumption surges"}]',5,'Gartner''s June 24 note is the structural force behind Agentic coding platforms ship token budgets and caps as default by Q2 2027 (2026-06-25): with 23 percent of leaders spending $200-$500 per developer monthly and steepest escalation pinned on ungoverned autonomy and bloated context, the per-seat cost squeeze pushes vendors to make consumption-governance table stakes.','Gartnerの6月24日のノートは、「エージェント型コーディングプラットフォームが2027年第2四半期までにトークン予算と上限をデフォルトで搭載する」(2026-06-25)という見立ての背後にある構造的な力だ。リーダーの23パーセントが開発者1人あたり月200〜500ドルを費やし、コスト上昇が最も急峻になる要因が統制なき自律性と肥大化したコンテキストにあると指摘される中で、席単位のコスト圧迫がベンダーに消費統制を当然の前提とさせる方向へ押し進める。','La nota de Gartner del 24 de junio es la fuerza estructural detrás de Agentic coding platforms ship token budgets and caps as default by Q2 2027 (2026-06-25): con el 23 por ciento de los líderes gastando entre 200 y 500 dólares por desarrollador al mes y la escalada más pronunciada atribuida a la autonomía sin gobernanza y al contexto sobredimensionado, la presión de coste por puesto empuja a los proveedores a convertir la gobernanza del consumo en requisito básico.','Ang note ng Gartner noong June 24 ang istruktural na puwersa sa likod ng Agentic coding platforms ship token budgets and caps as default by Q2 2027 (2026-06-25): sa 23 porsiyento ng mga leader na gumagastos ng $200-$500 kada developer kada buwan at sa pinakamatarik na pagtaas na nakatutok sa hindi napamamahalaang awtonomiya at lumolobong context, itinutulak ng pagipit sa gastos kada upuan ang mga vendor na gawing table stakes ang consumption-governance.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Gartner''s June 24 note is the structural force behind Agentic coding platforms ship token budgets and caps as default by Q2 2027 (2026-06-25): with 23 percent of leaders spending $200-$500 per developer monthly and steepest escalation pinned on ungoverned autonomy and bloated context, the per-seat cost squeeze pushes vendors to make consumption-governance table stakes.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.48d87ba2781fe636','source.4d2f87c264f2ac42','2026-06-25','prediction.47a4eb0e8d95b76d','Autonomous pentest agents ship as named managed tier by Q4 2026','Autonomous pentest agents ship as named managed tier by Q4 2026','Autonomous pentest agents ship as named managed tier by Q4 2026','Autonomous pentest agents ship as named managed tier by Q4 2026','2026-06-25','Autonomous-pentest agents managed-tier signal (June 24-25) is the origin evidence for this thesis. Today''s reporting has XBOW''s autonomous platform -- which maps application environments, probes for vulnerabilities, and chains multi-step exploitation paths at machine speed -- taking a strategic Accenture Ventures investment plus a partnership to run continuous offensive testing for clients, on top of a $35M Series C extension whose backers include NVIDIA NVentures, Samsung Ventures, and SentinelOne S Ventures. That financing-and-partnership shape is the procurement signal that incumbents are wiring autonomous pentesting into delivery stacks rather than treating it as research. The forward AI-security calendar reinforces the timing: the AI Tinkerers SF Offensive Security Demo Night surfaced these agents this week, and Black Hat USA''s AI Summit (August 1-6) alongside DEF CON''s AI Village give the category its first marquee enterprise-buyer stage before the fall procurement window. The gap to the bar: by Q4 2026 the prediction requires at least one major services or security-platform vendor to market an autonomous-pentesting agent as a named, continuously-running managed tier with its own SKU and pricing. Today shows an investment-plus-partnership and a conference cadence, not yet a named, self-serve managed product; liability and scoping concerns could keep these agents gated behind human-supervised pilots and push the launch past the window.','[{"url": "https://www.tweaktown.com/news/110826/amd-announces-advancing-ai-2026-event-for-july/index.html", "title": "TweakTown - AMD announces Advancing AI 2026 event for July (July 22-23, San Francisco)"}, {"url": "https://mlq.ai/news/v2/amd-sets-july-date-for-advancing-ai-2026-flagship-event-in-san-francisco/", "title": "MLQ - AMD sets July date for Advancing AI 2026 flagship event in San Francisco"}]',5,'Today''s signals move Autonomous pentest agents ship as named managed tier by Q4 2026 (2026-06-25) toward its window: XBOW''s strategic Accenture Ventures investment plus a continuous-offensive-testing partnership, atop a $35M Series C, shows incumbents wiring autonomous pentesting into delivery stacks, with Black Hat and DEF CON staging enterprise buyers before the fall procurement window.','本日の兆候は、「自律型ペンテストエージェントが2026年第4四半期までに名前のあるマネージドティアとして出荷される」(2026-06-25)を期限に向けて前進させる。XBOWはAccenture Venturesからの戦略投資と継続的な攻撃側テストのパートナーシップを、3,500万ドルのシリーズCの上に獲得し、既存大手が自律型ペンテストをデリバリースタックに組み込みつつあることを示した。Black HatとDEF CONが、秋の調達時期を前に企業バイヤーを舞台に上げる。','Las señales de hoy acercan Autonomous pentest agents ship as named managed tier by Q4 2026 (2026-06-25) a su ventana: la inversión estratégica de Accenture Ventures en XBOW más una alianza de pruebas ofensivas continuas, sobre una Serie C de 35 millones de dólares, muestra a los incumbentes integrando el pentesting autónomo en sus cadenas de entrega, con Black Hat y DEF CON dando escenario a los compradores empresariales antes de la ventana de adquisiciones del otoño.','Inilalapit ng mga senyales ngayon ang Autonomous pentest agents ship as named managed tier by Q4 2026 (2026-06-25) sa window nito: ang estratehikong pamumuhunan ng Accenture Ventures sa XBOW kasama ang isang partnership para sa tuloy-tuloy na offensive testing, na nakapatong sa isang $35M Series C, ay nagpapakita na iniuugma na ng mga incumbent ang autonomous pentesting sa delivery stacks. Inihahanda ng Black Hat at DEF CON ang mga enterprise buyer bago ang procurement window sa taglagas.','landing',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Today''s signals move Autonomous pentest agents ship as named managed tier by Q4 2026 (2026-06-25) toward its window: XBOW''s strategic Accenture Ventures investment plus a continuous-offensive-testing partnership, atop a $35M Series C, shows incumbents wiring autonomous pentesting into delivery stacks, with Black Hat and DEF CON staging enterprise buyers before the fall procurement window.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.44673dcea6c68fa0','source.4d2f87c264f2ac42','2026-06-25','prediction.68471e3864b2aa7e','Corsair-class inference silicon books a named hyperscaler deployment by Q3 2027','Corsair-class inference silicon books a named hyperscaler deployment by Q3 2027','Corsair-class inference silicon books a named hyperscaler deployment by Q3 2027','Corsair-class inference silicon books a named hyperscaler deployment by Q3 2027','2026-06-17','OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno unveil (June 24) strongly supports the named-inference-silicon-deployment thesis, though through a buyer-designed part rather than a merchant Corsair-class vendor. Jalapeno is a custom inference accelerator with a concrete deployment commitment -- initial data-center deployment targeted by end of 2026 at gigawatt scale -- wired together by Broadcom''s Tomahawk fabric (up to 1.6 terabits per second) with Celestia co-designing the rack, and OpenAI is the named buyer. That is precisely the shape the prediction anticipates: dedicated inference silicon landing a named, dated large-scale deployment rather than a generic merchant-GPU buy. The forward AI-chip calendar (AMD Advancing AI 2026 July 22-23 with an Instinct MI400-series focus, Hot Chips 2026 August 23-25 at Stanford, AI Infra Summit September 15-17 Santa Clara) supplies the venue cadence where further inference-silicon bookings would surface. The gap: Jalapeno is OpenAI''s own co-designed ASIC announced as a future deployment, not a merchant Corsair-class inference-silicon vendor booking a named hyperscaler customer; the prediction''s falsifiable target is a Corsair-class part with a named hyperscaler deployment, which today''s news does not yet provide.','[{"url": "https://siliconangle.com/2026/06/24/openai-broadcom-debut-custom-jalapeno-chip-llm-inference/", "title": "SiliconANGLE - OpenAI, Broadcom debut custom Jalapeno chip for AI inference"}, {"url": "https://www.constellationr.com/insights/news/openai-broadcom-unveil-first-ai-inference-chip", "title": "Constellation Research - OpenAI, Broadcom unveil first AI inference chip"}]',4,'Today''s OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno unveil shows exactly the consequence the Corsair-class deployment prediction (June 17) anticipates: dedicated inference silicon booking a named, dated large-scale landing -- OpenAI''s gigawatt-scale deployment targeted by end of 2026 over Broadcom''s Tomahawk fabric -- rather than a generic merchant-GPU buy, even though Jalapeno is a buyer-designed ASIC, not a merchant vendor part.','本日のOpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno発表は、Corsair級展開の予測(6月17日)が想定する帰結そのものを示す。専用の推論シリコンが、汎用GPUの一般的な購入ではなく、名前付き・日付付きの大規模展開を獲得する形だ。OpenAIのギガワット級展開はBroadcomのTomahawkファブリック上で2026年末までを目標としている。もっとも、Jalapenoは購入者が設計したASICであって、汎用ベンダーの部品ではない。','La presentación del Jalapeno de OpenAI-Broadcom hoy muestra exactamente la consecuencia que anticipa la predicción de despliegue de clase Corsair (17 de junio): silicio de inferencia dedicado que cierra un aterrizaje a gran escala nombrado y fechado -- el despliegue a escala de gigavatios de OpenAI previsto para finales de 2026 sobre el tejido Tomahawk de Broadcom -- en lugar de una compra genérica de GPU comerciales, aunque Jalapeno sea un ASIC diseñado por el comprador y no una pieza de proveedor comercial.','Ipinapakita ng pag-unveil ng OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno ngayon ang eksaktong bunga na inaasahan ng Corsair-class deployment prediction (June 17): dedikadong inference silicon na nakakakuha ng pinangalanan at may petsang malakihang landing, ang gigawatt-scale na deployment ng OpenAI na nakatakda sa katapusan ng 2026 sa ibabaw ng Tomahawk fabric ng Broadcom, sa halip na isang karaniwang pagbili ng merchant-GPU. Ito ay totoo kahit na ang Jalapeno ay isang buyer-designed na ASIC, hindi isang bahagi ng merchant na vendor.','so_that',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Today''s OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno unveil shows exactly the consequence the Corsair-class deployment prediction (June 17) anticipates: dedicated inference silicon booking a named, dated large-scale landing -- OpenAI''s gigawatt-scale deployment targeted by end of 2026 over Broadcom''s Tomahawk fabric -- rather than a generic merchant-GPU buy, even though Jalapeno is a buyer-designed ASIC, not a merchant vendor part.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.fbc14ace0c75bc59','source.4d2f87c264f2ac42','2026-06-25','prediction.c1dfc2d4c03a7007','Hyperscaler custom AI silicon splits into training vs inference SKUs by H1 2027','Hyperscaler custom AI silicon splits into training vs inference SKUs by H1 2027','Hyperscaler custom AI silicon splits into training vs inference SKUs by H1 2027','Hyperscaler custom AI silicon splits into training vs inference SKUs by H1 2027','2026-04-22','[REVIVED] Layer 1 keyword + Layer 2 semantic match against today''s Jalapeno reporting (Signals: training-vs-inference SKU split, Trainium, Inferentia, dual-track silicon, hyperscaler in-house silicon). OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno unveil (June 24) is a named accelerator that OpenAI frames explicitly as an ''Intelligence Processor'' architected around LLM inference rather than training -- a dedicated inference part, placed alongside the Google-Broadcom TPU and Amazon Trainium lineage, with Jalapeno itself described as the first step in a multi-generation compute platform. That inference-specific-versus-training framing is exactly the dual-track custom-silicon split the prediction names: a buyer escaping merchant-GPU economics by designing a purpose-built inference SKU separate from training silicon. The gap to the bar: Jalapeno is a single inference part from a frontier-model buyer, not yet a hyperscaler publicly delineating a two-SKU training-versus-inference custom-silicon line; the prediction needs a named dual-track split, and today''s signal establishes the inference-SKU half of that split without the explicit paired training-SKU disclosure.','[{"url": "https://siliconangle.com/2026/06/24/openai-broadcom-debut-custom-jalapeno-chip-llm-inference/", "title": "SiliconANGLE - OpenAI, Broadcom debut custom Jalapeno chip for AI inference"}, {"url": "https://www.constellationr.com/insights/news/openai-broadcom-unveil-first-ai-inference-chip", "title": "Constellation Research - OpenAI, Broadcom unveil first AI inference chip"}]',4,'Revived from the dormant pool, the training-versus-inference SKU split prediction (Apr 22) gains structural reinforcement from today''s Jalapeno unveil: OpenAI frames it as an ''Intelligence Processor'' purpose-built for inference rather than training, placed alongside the Google TPU and Amazon Trainium lineage -- the dual-track custom-silicon force the prediction names, a buyer designing a dedicated inference SKU separate from training silicon.','休眠プールから復活したトレーニング対推論のSKU分化の予測(4月22日)は、本日のJalapeno発表から構造的な裏づけを得る。OpenAIはこれをトレーニングではなく推論に目的特化した「Intelligence Processor」と位置づけ、Google TPUやAmazon Trainiumの系譜と並べた。これは予測が指す二系統の独自シリコンの力であり、購入者がトレーニング用シリコンとは別に専用の推論SKUを設計する動きだ。','Revivida desde el grupo latente, la predicción de la división de SKU de entrenamiento frente a inferencia (22 de abril) gana refuerzo estructural con la presentación de Jalapeno de hoy: OpenAI lo presenta como un ''Intelligence Processor'' hecho a propósito para inferencia en lugar de entrenamiento, situado junto al linaje del TPU de Google y el Trainium de Amazon -- la fuerza de silicio personalizado de doble vía que la predicción nombra, un comprador que diseña un SKU de inferencia dedicado y separado del silicio de entrenamiento.','Muling binuhay mula sa dormant pool, ang training-versus-inference SKU split prediction (Apr 22) ay nakakakuha ng istruktural na pampatibay mula sa pag-unveil ng Jalapeno ngayon: ibinabalangkas ito ng OpenAI bilang isang ''Intelligence Processor'' na idinisenyo para sa inference at hindi sa training, inilagay katabi ng lipi ng Google TPU at Amazon Trainium. Ito ang dual-track na puwersa ng custom-silicon na pinangalanan ng prediksyon, isang buyer na nagdidisenyo ng dedikadong inference SKU na hiwalay sa training silicon.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Revived from the dormant pool, the training-versus-inference SKU split prediction (Apr 22) gains structural reinforcement from today''s Jalapeno unveil: OpenAI frames it as an ''Intelligence Processor'' purpose-built for inference rather than training, placed alongside the Google TPU and Amazon Trainium lineage -- the dual-track custom-silicon force the prediction names, a buyer designing a dedicated inference SKU separate from training silicon.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.5ef58290bbf0883d','source.4d2f87c264f2ac42','2026-06-25','prediction.a943725fb4046b01','An autonomous-pentest vendor lands a named enterprise/gov deal by Q1 2027','An autonomous-pentest vendor lands a named enterprise/gov deal by Q1 2027','An autonomous-pentest vendor lands a named enterprise/gov deal by Q1 2027','An autonomous-pentest vendor lands a named enterprise/gov deal by Q1 2027','2026-06-22','Autonomous-pentest agents managed-tier signal (June 24-25) directly supports this thesis. Today''s reporting has XBOW -- a named autonomous-pentest vendor whose platform maps environments, probes for vulnerabilities, and chains multi-step exploitation at machine speed -- taking a strategic Accenture Ventures investment plus a partnership to run continuous offensive testing for clients, on top of a $35M Series C extension backed by NVIDIA NVentures, Samsung Ventures, and SentinelOne S Ventures. An Accenture partnership to deliver continuous offensive testing is close to the named-enterprise-engagement shape the prediction anticipates, and the forward security calendar (Black Hat USA''s AI Summit August 1-6, DEF CON''s AI Village) keeps buyer-side attention on agentic offensive tooling. The gap to the bar: an Accenture Ventures investment plus a delivery partnership is a vendor-channel relationship and a strategic round, not yet a disclosed named enterprise or government customer contract; the prediction''s falsifiable target is a named enterprise or government deal, which today''s financing-and-partnership news approaches but does not yet confirm.','[{"url": "https://www.tweaktown.com/news/110826/amd-announces-advancing-ai-2026-event-for-july/index.html", "title": "TweakTown - AMD announces Advancing AI 2026 event for July (July 22-23, San Francisco)"}, {"url": "https://mlq.ai/news/v2/amd-sets-july-date-for-advancing-ai-2026-flagship-event-in-san-francisco/", "title": "MLQ - AMD sets July date for Advancing AI 2026 flagship event in San Francisco"}]',4,'Today''s XBOW news advances the named-enterprise-deal prediction (June 22) on timing and actor: XBOW, a named autonomous-pentest vendor, takes a strategic Accenture Ventures investment plus a partnership to run continuous offensive testing for clients, atop a $35M Series C from NVIDIA, Samsung, and SentinelOne -- close to the named-engagement shape, with Black Hat''s AI Summit keeping buyer attention live.','本日のXBOWのニュースは、名前のある企業契約の予測(6月22日)をタイミングと主体の両面で前進させる。名前のある自律型ペンテストベンダーであるXBOWが、Accenture Venturesからの戦略投資と、顧客向けに継続的な攻撃側テストを実施するパートナーシップを、NVIDIA、Samsung、SentinelOneによる3,500万ドルのシリーズCの上に獲得した。名前のある契約の形に近く、Black HatのAI Summitがバイヤーの関心を引き留めている。','La noticia de XBOW hoy hace avanzar la predicción del acuerdo empresarial nombrado (22 de junio) en tiempo y actor: XBOW, un proveedor nombrado de pentest autónomo, recibe una inversión estratégica de Accenture Ventures más una alianza para ejecutar pruebas ofensivas continuas para clientes, sobre una Serie C de 35 millones de dólares de NVIDIA, Samsung y SentinelOne -- cerca de la forma de contrato nombrado, con el AI Summit de Black Hat manteniendo viva la atención del comprador.','Isinusulong ng balita ng XBOW ngayon ang named-enterprise-deal prediction (June 22) sa timing at aktor: ang XBOW, isang pinangalanang autonomous-pentest vendor, ay kumuha ng estratehikong pamumuhunan mula sa Accenture Ventures kasama ang isang partnership para magpatakbo ng tuloy-tuloy na offensive testing para sa mga kliyente, na nakapatong sa isang $35M Series C mula sa NVIDIA, Samsung, at SentinelOne. Malapit na ito sa hugis ng pinangalanang engagement, at pinananatili ng AI Summit ng Black Hat na buhay ang atensyon ng buyer.','landing',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Today''s XBOW news advances the named-enterprise-deal prediction (June 22) on timing and actor: XBOW, a named autonomous-pentest vendor, takes a strategic Accenture Ventures investment plus a partnership to run continuous offensive testing for clients, atop a $35M Series C from NVIDIA, Samsung, and SentinelOne -- close to the named-engagement shape, with Black Hat''s AI Summit keeping buyer attention live.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.3fff4f92c8bc0782','source.4d2f87c264f2ac42','2026-06-25','prediction.9262c2692ab05c8d','Intel Foundry lands a second external AI-chip customer on 18A by Q2 2027','Intel Foundry lands a second external AI-chip customer on 18A by Q2 2027','Intel Foundry lands a second external AI-chip customer on 18A by Q2 2027','Intel Foundry lands a second external AI-chip customer on 18A by Q2 2027','2026-06-11','OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno unveil (June 24) bears weakly on the Intel-Foundry-second-customer thesis by reinforcing the custom-AI-silicon demand backdrop without touching the foundry-customer claim. Jalapeno is another instance of a hyperscale-class buyer commissioning a custom inference ASIC co-designed with a merchant partner (Broadcom) plus networking fabric -- exactly the fabless-AI-chip-designer pattern that feeds external foundry capacity demand. But the prediction is specifically about Intel Foundry signing a second external AI-chip customer on the 18A node, and today''s news names Broadcom as the design partner with no disclosure of which foundry fabricates Jalapeno; there is no Intel Foundry signal in today''s reporting. The gap is large: today supplies thematic demand-side context for custom AI silicon, not a signed Intel Foundry 18A customer agreement or tape-out disclosure, which is the prediction''s falsifiable core.','[{"url": "https://siliconangle.com/2026/06/24/openai-broadcom-debut-custom-jalapeno-chip-llm-inference/", "title": "SiliconANGLE - OpenAI, Broadcom debut custom Jalapeno chip for AI inference"}]',2,'Today''s OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno unveil reinforces the custom-AI-silicon demand backdrop behind the Intel Foundry second external AI-chip customer on 18A prediction (Jun 11), but names Broadcom as design partner with no disclosure of which foundry fabricates the part. No Intel Foundry 18A customer signal appears today.','本日のOpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno発表は、Intel Foundryが18Aで2社目の外部AIチップ顧客を獲得するという予測(6月11日)の背後にある独自AIシリコン需要の背景を補強する。だが設計パートナーとしてBroadcomの名を挙げるのみで、どのファウンドリが部品を製造するかは開示していない。本日、Intel Foundryの18A顧客の兆候は現れていない。','La presentación del Jalapeno de OpenAI-Broadcom hoy refuerza el trasfondo de demanda de silicio de IA personalizado detrás de la predicción del segundo cliente externo de chips de IA de Intel Foundry en 18A (11 de junio), pero nombra a Broadcom como socio de diseño sin divulgar qué fundición fabrica la pieza. Hoy no aparece ninguna señal de cliente 18A de Intel Foundry.','Pinatitibay ng pag-unveil ng OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno ngayon ang backdrop ng demand para sa custom-AI-silicon sa likod ng Intel Foundry second external AI-chip customer on 18A prediction (Jun 11), ngunit pinangalanan nito ang Broadcom bilang design partner nang walang paglalahad kung aling foundry ang gumagawa ng bahagi. Walang lumitaw na senyales ng customer ng Intel Foundry 18A ngayon.','none',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Today''s OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno unveil reinforces the custom-AI-silicon demand backdrop behind the Intel Foundry second external AI-chip customer on 18A prediction (Jun 11), but names Broadcom as design partner with no disclosure of which foundry fabricates the part. No Intel Foundry 18A customer signal appears today.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.9c1778e1ca60ecc9','source.4d2f87c264f2ac42','2026-06-25','prediction.c2b0ba20d4477cec','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','AWS Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation goes industry baseline by H1 2027','2026-06-21','Autonomous-pentest agents managed-tier signal (June 24-25) touches the prove-the-finding-by-running-it thesis on adjacency, not on the landing. XBOW''s autonomous platform chains multi-step exploitation paths at machine speed -- building and executing working exploits to demonstrate reachability -- which is Continuum''s sandbox exploit-validation move generalized to the offensive-vendor field, and the forward security calendar (Black Hat USA''s AI Summit August 1-6, DEF CON''s AI Village) keeps proof-of-exploit tooling in front of buyers. The relevance is on momentum and offensive-side adjacency, not the defensive landing: today''s signal is an offensive autonomous-pentest vendor''s financing and partnership, not the defensive exploit-validation pipeline becoming an industry baseline across named code-security vendors. The gap to the bar: the prediction names a defensive sandbox proof-of-exploit gate going industry baseline, and today''s offensive-attacker-tooling framing does not advance that defensive-baseline claim.','[{"url": "https://www.tweaktown.com/news/110826/amd-announces-advancing-ai-2026-event-for-july/index.html", "title": "TweakTown - AMD announces Advancing AI 2026 event for July (July 22-23, San Francisco)"}]',2,'XBOW''s autonomous platform chaining working exploits at machine speed echoes the prove-by-running move behind the AWS Continuum sandbox exploit-validation industry-baseline prediction (Jun 21), but only on offensive-side adjacency. Today''s financing-and-partnership signal is offensive-vendor momentum, not the defensive exploit-validation gate becoming baseline across named code-security vendors.','XBOWの自律プラットフォームが機能する悪用コードを機械の速度で連鎖させることは、AWS Continuumのサンドボックス悪用検証が業界標準になるという予測(6月21日)の背後にある「実行して裏づける」手法と響き合う。ただし攻撃側の隣接にとどまる。本日の資金調達とパートナーシップの兆候は攻撃側ベンダーの勢いであって、防御側の悪用検証ゲートが名前のあるコードセキュリティベンダー各社で標準になることではない。','La plataforma autónoma de XBOW encadenando exploits funcionales a velocidad de máquina hace eco de la maniobra de probar-ejecutando detrás de la predicción del estándar de industria de validación de exploits en sandbox de AWS Continuum (21 de junio), pero solo por adyacencia del lado ofensivo. La señal de financiación y alianza de hoy es impulso de un proveedor ofensivo, no la puerta defensiva de validación de exploits volviéndose estándar entre proveedores nombrados de seguridad de código.','Ang pagdurugtong ng XBOW ng gumaganang exploits sa bilis ng makina ay umaalingawngaw sa galaw na patunay-sa-pagpapatakbo sa likod ng AWS Continuum sandbox exploit-validation industry-baseline prediction (Jun 21), ngunit sa kanugnay lamang sa offensive-side. Ang senyales na financing-at-partnership ngayon ay momentum ng offensive-vendor, hindi ang depensibong exploit-validation gate na nagiging baseline sa mga pinangalanang code-security na vendor.','none',NULL,NULL,NULL,'XBOW''s autonomous platform chaining working exploits at machine speed echoes the prove-by-running move behind the AWS Continuum sandbox exploit-validation industry-baseline prediction (Jun 21), but only on offensive-side adjacency. Today''s financing-and-partnership signal is offensive-vendor momentum, not the defensive exploit-validation gate becoming baseline across named code-security vendors.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.767ad71c819b18cf','source.4d2f87c264f2ac42','2026-06-25','prediction.51f5b6474322e7f3','Nvidia mean Street price target clears $300 on data-center GPU demand by Q4 2026','Nvidia mean Street price target clears $300 on data-center GPU demand by Q4 2026','Nvidia mean Street price target clears $300 on data-center GPU demand by Q4 2026','Nvidia mean Street price target clears $300 on data-center GPU demand by Q4 2026','2026-06-06','[REVIVED] Layer 2 semantic match against today''s Jalapeno reporting (Signals: inference fragments custom silicon Groq-style LPU, gross-margin step-down pricing pressure, soft-landing AI-accelerator demand). OpenAI-Broadcom Jalapeno unveil (June 24) is the merchant-GPU-economics-escape story the prediction''s reasoning names as a counterweight to the bull case: the largest frontier-model buyer is designing its own inference ASIC specifically to escape merchant-GPU economics at gigawatt scale, the canonical example of inference demand fragmenting away from merchant GPUs toward custom silicon. That cuts against the data-center-GPU-demand thesis underpinning a $300-plus Nvidia mean target, since a major inference buyer building bespoke silicon erodes the merchant-GPU inference share the bull case assumes. The relevance is on the bearish counter-mechanism, not on a price-target print: today''s news carries no Nvidia analyst-target revision, no mean-target figure, and no sell-side action. The gap to the bar: the prediction is checked by a sell-side consensus mean target clearing $300, which today''s reporting does not address; Jalapeno only sharpens the inference-fragmentation risk to that thesis.','[{"url": "https://siliconangle.com/2026/06/24/openai-broadcom-debut-custom-jalapeno-chip-llm-inference/", "title": "SiliconANGLE - OpenAI, Broadcom debut custom Jalapeno chip for AI inference"}]',2,'Revived from the dormant pool, the Nvidia mean Street price target clears $300 prediction (Jun 06) is touched only by the bearish counter-mechanism: today''s Jalapeno unveil shows the largest inference buyer building bespoke silicon to escape merchant-GPU economics, eroding the data-center-GPU-demand share the $300 bull case assumes. No analyst-target revision or mean-target figure appears today.','休眠プールから復活したNvidiaの平均目標株価300ドル超の予測(6月6日)に触れるのは、弱気側の対抗メカニズムのみだ。本日のJalapeno発表は、最大手の推論購入者が汎用GPUの経済性から脱するために専用シリコンを構築する様子を示し、300ドルの強気論が前提とするデータセンターGPU需要のシェアを浸食する。本日、アナリスト目標の改定や平均目標値の数値は現れていない。','Revivida desde el grupo latente, la predicción de que el objetivo medio de precio de Wall Street para Nvidia supera los 300 dólares (6 de junio) queda tocada solo por el contramecanismo bajista: la presentación de Jalapeno de hoy muestra al mayor comprador de inferencia construyendo silicio a medida para escapar de la economía de las GPU comerciales, erosionando la cuota de demanda de GPU de centros de datos que asume el caso alcista de los 300 dólares. Hoy no aparece ninguna revisión de objetivo de analistas ni cifra de objetivo medio.','Muling binuhay mula sa dormant pool, ang Nvidia mean Street price target clears $300 prediction (Jun 06) ay nahahawakan lamang ng bearish na counter-mechanism: ipinapakita ng pag-unveil ng Jalapeno ngayon na ang pinakamalaking inference buyer ay bumubuo ng sariling silicon upang umalpas sa ekonomiya ng merchant-GPU, na binabawasan ang data-center-GPU-demand share na ipinapalagay ng $300 bull case. Walang lumitaw na analyst-target revision o mean-target na pigura ngayon.','none',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Revived from the dormant pool, the Nvidia mean Street price target clears $300 prediction (Jun 06) is touched only by the bearish counter-mechanism: today''s Jalapeno unveil shows the largest inference buyer building bespoke silicon to escape merchant-GPU economics, eroding the data-center-GPU-demand share the $300 bull case assumes. No analyst-target revision or mean-target figure appears today.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:03');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.bd5e7ae8cfca3a36','source.d82226aa54db3638','2026-06-26','prediction.625a7234dd6e9ed1','ML registry servers log a second max-severity deserialization RCE by Q1 2027','ML registry servers log a second max-severity deserialization RCE by Q1 2027','ML registry servers log a second max-severity deserialization RCE by Q1 2027','ML registry servers log a second max-severity deserialization RCE by Q1 2027','2026-06-26','The June 24 Feast CVE-2026-56121 RCE is the precipitating origin signal for this thesis. A critical, unauthenticated remote-code-execution flaw in Feast, the open-source machine-learning feature store, was published June 24 as CVE-2026-56121, rated CVSS 9.3 (v4.0) and fixed in Feast 0.63.0. When the registry server processes a gRPC request, it base64-decodes the user_defined_function.body field of an OnDemandFeatureView spec and passes it straight to dill.loads() before any authorization check, so an attacker can submit a crafted serialized Python object with an arbitrary __reduce__ method and execute OS commands as the Feast service account with no credentials. The structural read in today''s reporting is exactly the prediction''s premise: the ML attack surface has dropped one layer below the model and inference engine into the data-and-metadata plumbing -- a registry that ingests serialized transformation logic over the network is an unauthenticated code-execution endpoint unless deserialization is gated, and the same primitive recurs wherever ML infra trusts serialized objects on the wire. The gap to the falsifiable bar: the prediction requires a second, NAMED, distinct project (not Feast, not a re-score or backport of CVE-2026-56121) to receive its own CVE/GHSA at CVSS >= 9.0 whose root cause is unsafe deserialization of a network-supplied object on an ML registry, feature-store, or metadata endpoint. Today supplies the first instance and the structural trigger; the recurrence that would confirm the class is real has not yet landed.','[{"url": "https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-q63x-9pfm-mjx4", "title": "GitHub Advisory Database - Feast unsafe deserialization allows unauthenticated RCE (CVE-2026-56121)"}, {"url": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-56121", "title": "NVD - CVE-2026-56121 Detail (Feast before 0.63.0, gRPC registry deserialization RCE)"}]',5,'Feast''s CVE-2026-56121 is the precipitating first instance: a CVSS 9.3 unauthenticated RCE where the gRPC registry hands a base64-decoded feature-view body to dill.loads() before any auth check. That confirms the thesis premise that the ML attack surface has dropped into the data-and-metadata plane, where any registry trusting serialized objects on the wire is a code-execution endpoint.','FeastのCVE-2026-56121は、起点となる最初の事例だ。CVSS 9.3の認証不要なRCEであり、gRPCレジストリがbase64デコードした特徴量ビューのbodyを、認可チェックを経ずにdill.loads()へ渡す。これは、機械学習の攻撃対象領域がデータとメタデータの層まで降りてきたという前提を裏づける。通信上のシリアライズ済みオブジェクトを信頼するレジストリは、どれもコード実行エンドポイントになりうる。','El CVE-2026-56121 de Feast es la primera instancia que lo precipita: un RCE sin autenticación con CVSS 9.3 en el que el registro gRPC entrega un cuerpo de feature-view decodificado en base64 a dill.loads() antes de cualquier comprobación de autenticación. Eso confirma la premisa de la tesis de que la superficie de ataque de ML ha descendido al plano de datos y metadatos, donde cualquier registro que confíe en objetos serializados que llegan por la red es un endpoint de ejecución de código.','Ang CVE-2026-56121 ng Feast ang nagpasimuno na unang pagkakataon: isang CVSS 9.3 na unauthenticated RCE kung saan ibinibigay ng gRPC registry ang isang base64-decoded na feature-view body sa dill.loads() bago ang anumang auth check. Pinatutunayan nito ang premise ng thesis na bumaba na ang ML attack surface papunta sa data-and-metadata na antas, kung saan ang anumang registry na nagtitiwala sa serialized na object sa network ay isang code-execution endpoint.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Feast''s CVE-2026-56121 is the precipitating first instance: a CVSS 9.3 unauthenticated RCE where the gRPC registry hands a base64-decoded feature-view body to dill.loads() before any auth check. That confirms the thesis premise that the ML attack surface has dropped into the data-and-metadata plane, where any registry trusting serialized objects on the wire is a code-execution endpoint.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.a9f5015c20ba8ea7','source.d82226aa54db3638','2026-06-26','prediction.7b31cbaef01800e6','Security vendor ships ML deserialization scanning as a named tier by Q1 2027','Security vendor ships ML deserialization scanning as a named tier by Q1 2027','Security vendor ships ML deserialization scanning as a named tier by Q1 2027','Security vendor ships ML deserialization scanning as a named tier by Q1 2027','2026-06-26','The June 24 Feast CVE-2026-56121 RCE is the structural trigger this thesis rests on. The maximum-severity (CVSS 9.3 v4.0) unauthenticated RCE -- in which the Feast registry server base64-decodes a user-supplied feature-view function body and hands it straight to dill.loads() before any authorization check -- proves the attack surface has moved one layer below the model and inference engine into the ML plumbing that ingests serialized logic over the network. That is the same unsafe-deserialization primitive (pickle/dill/joblib payloads, model checkpoints, feature-store transformation bodies) that the prediction expects a named application-security or supply-chain-security platform (the Snyk / Endor Labs / JFrog / Protect AI / HiddenLayer class) to productize as a first-class scanner tier. Once a bug class has both a documented exploit trail and a network-reachable, weaponizable shape, vendors tend to productize a dedicated detection surface rather than leave it to generic dependency scanning. The gap to the bar: the falsifiable core is a NAMED, marketed product tier, module, or SKU whose stated scope explicitly covers ML serialized-artifact, deserialization, or model-supply-chain scanning -- announced in vendor docs, a release, or a launch. Today is the triggering CVE, not a shipped product; a generic SCA tool merely ingesting the Feast CVE, a one-off blog post, or a prompt-injection guardrail product does not count.','[{"url": "https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-q63x-9pfm-mjx4", "title": "GitHub Advisory Database - Feast unsafe deserialization allows unauthenticated RCE (CVE-2026-56121)"}, {"url": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-56121", "title": "NVD - CVE-2026-56121 Detail (Feast before 0.63.0, gRPC registry deserialization RCE)"}]',5,'Feast''s maximum-severity unauthenticated RCE gives the unsafe-deserialization bug class a documented exploit trail and a network-reachable, weaponizable shape. That is the structural market driver: once a primitive is both exploitable and recurring across pickle, dill, joblib and model artifacts, application-security and supply-chain vendors tend to productize a dedicated detection surface rather than leave it to generic dependency scanning.','Feastの深刻度最大で認証不要なRCEは、安全でないデシリアライズの脆弱性クラスに、実証済みの悪用経路と、ネットワークから到達可能で武器化しやすい形を与える。これが構造的な市場の駆動力だ。ある仕組みが悪用可能であり、しかもpickle・dill・joblib・モデル成果物にまたがって繰り返し現れるようになると、アプリケーションセキュリティやサプライチェーンのベンダーは、汎用の依存関係スキャンに任せず専用の検出機能を製品化する傾向がある。','El RCE sin autenticación de severidad máxima de Feast dota a la clase de fallo de deserialización insegura de un rastro de explotación documentado y de una forma alcanzable por la red y armable. Ese es el motor estructural del mercado: una vez que una primitiva es a la vez explotable y recurrente en pickle, dill, joblib y artefactos de modelos, los proveedores de seguridad de aplicaciones y de cadena de suministro tienden a productizar una detección dedicada en lugar de dejarla en manos del escaneo genérico de dependencias.','Ang maximum-severity na unauthenticated RCE ng Feast ay nagbibigay sa klase ng unsafe-deserialization na bug ng isang dokumentadong exploit trail at isang network-reachable at maaaring gamiting sandata na hugis. Iyan ang istruktural na drayber ng merkado: sa sandaling ang isang primitive ay parehong maaaring i-exploit at paulit-ulit sa pickle, dill, joblib at model artifact, kadalasang ginagawang produkto ng application-security at supply-chain na mga vendor ang isang dedikadong detection na kakayahan sa halip na ipaubaya ito sa pangkalahatang dependency scanning.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Feast''s maximum-severity unauthenticated RCE gives the unsafe-deserialization bug class a documented exploit trail and a network-reachable, weaponizable shape. That is the structural market driver: once a primitive is both exploitable and recurring across pickle, dill, joblib and model artifacts, application-security and supply-chain vendors tend to productize a dedicated detection surface rather than leave it to generic dependency scanning.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.541848d403429f2c','source.d82226aa54db3638','2026-06-26','prediction.079ca77d11decc5f','AI accelerator ships confidential-inference tier with attestation by H1 2027','AI accelerator ships confidential-inference tier with attestation by H1 2027','AI accelerator ships confidential-inference tier with attestation by H1 2027','AI accelerator ships confidential-inference tier with attestation by H1 2027','2026-06-26','Today''s reporting supplies both the structural trigger and the disclosure venues this thesis turns on. The June 24 Feast CVE-2026-56121 RCE sharpens the model-supply-chain-integrity case the prediction names: the agentic-AI security cycle keeps tying risk to poisoned checkpoints and unauthenticated registries, and signed-model attestation is the hardware-rooted answer to ''prove the weights I am querying are the weights I approved.'' On the venue side, the forward AI-chip and AI-security calendar names exactly the stages where a confidential-inference part would surface -- AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23 at Moscone, with the in-person keynote and Instinct MI400-series focus on July 23) and Black Hat USA 2026 (August 1-6 at Mandalay Bay, AI Summit August 4) are the prediction''s own likely disclosure venues. The prediction expects a purpose-built AI inference accelerator to ship or be unveiled with confidential computing as a named, load-bearing feature -- on-die root-of-trust, TEE-I/O keeping weights and activations encrypted in use across the CPU-accelerator boundary, and signed-model attestation -- marketed as a named confidential-inference SKU or managed tier. The gap to the bar: today gives the trigger and the calendar, not a shipping part. A generic confidential-computing line on a GPU spec sheet, a research paper, or a confidential-VM offering without TEE-I/O or model attestation does not count; the named confidential-inference tier has not yet been disclosed.','[{"url": "https://www.amd.com/en/corporate/events/advancing-ai.html", "title": "AMD - Advancing AI 2026 (San Francisco, July 22-23)"}, {"url": "https://blackhat.com/us-26/", "title": "Black Hat - USA 2026 (August 1-6, Mandalay Bay, Las Vegas)"}]',5,'Feast''s registry RCE sharpens the model-supply-chain-integrity case, making hardware-rooted signed-model attestation the answer to proving the weights being queried are the weights approved. Given that threat framing plus a forward calendar that names the likely disclosure stages, AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23) and Black Hat USA 2026 (August 1-6), a confidential-inference part would plausibly surface within the window.','Feastのレジストリの脆弱性(RCE)は、モデルサプライチェーンの完全性という論点を鋭くし、問い合わせている重みが承認した重みであると立証するうえで、ハードウェアに根ざした署名付きモデルの証明を答えにする。この脅威の枠組みに加え、有力な開示の段階を名指しする今後のカレンダー、すなわちAMDのAdvancing AI 2026(7月22-23日)とBlack Hat USA 2026(8月1-6日)を踏まえると、秘匿推論向けの部品はこの期間内に現れる可能性が十分にある。','El RCE del registro de Feast afina el argumento de integridad de la cadena de suministro de modelos, lo que convierte la atestación de modelos firmados enraizada en hardware en la respuesta para demostrar que los pesos consultados son los pesos aprobados. Dado ese encuadre de la amenaza más un calendario futuro que nombra las etapas de divulgación probables, Advancing AI 2026 de AMD (22-23 de julio) y Black Hat USA 2026 (1-6 de agosto), una pieza de inferencia confidencial podría aparecer de forma plausible dentro de la ventana.','Pinatatalas ng registry RCE ng Feast ang kaso ng model-supply-chain-integrity, na ginagawang sagot ang hardware-rooted na signed-model attestation sa pagpapatunay na ang weights na tinatanong ay ang weights na inaprubahan. Dahil sa pagbabalangkas na ito ng banta kasama ang isang paparating na kalendaryo na pinapangalanan ang malamang na mga yugto ng disclosure, ang Advancing AI 2026 ng AMD (July 22-23) at ang Black Hat USA 2026 (August 1-6), malamang na lilitaw ang isang confidential-inference na bahagi sa loob ng panahong ito.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Feast''s registry RCE sharpens the model-supply-chain-integrity case, making hardware-rooted signed-model attestation the answer to proving the weights being queried are the weights approved. Given that threat framing plus a forward calendar that names the likely disclosure stages, AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23) and Black Hat USA 2026 (August 1-6), a confidential-inference part would plausibly surface within the window.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.fec3fd937fa1ce8c','source.d82226aa54db3638','2026-06-26','prediction.57ffda60c7453d2f','Managed model-serving platforms default to safe artifact handling by H1 2027','Managed model-serving platforms default to safe artifact handling by H1 2027','Managed model-serving platforms default to safe artifact handling by H1 2027','Managed model-serving platforms default to safe artifact handling by H1 2027','2026-06-17','The June 24 Feast CVE-2026-56121 RCE is the strongest single confirmation of the threat this defensive prediction is built around. Feast''s registry server base64-decodes a user-supplied feature-view function body and passes it straight to dill.loads() before any authorization check, yielding an unauthenticated CVSS 9.3 RCE as the service account -- a textbook case of unsafe artifact handling on the ML data-and-metadata plane that managed model-serving and feature-store platforms host. The prediction holds that managed serving platforms will move safe artifact handling -- gated or sandboxed deserialization, signed/provenance-checked artifacts, safe-by-default formats -- from an opt-in flag to the platform default. Today''s advisory is the kind of maximum-severity, trivially weaponizable incident that historically forces that default-shipment: operators are told to treat any pre-0.63.0 network-reachable gRPC registry as exposed, which is precisely the pressure that pushes managed platforms to stop trusting serialized objects on the wire by default. The gap to the bar: the prediction is checked by a named managed model-serving platform making safe artifact handling its shipped default, and today supplies the motivating vulnerability in an open-source component rather than a managed-platform default-handling change. The defensive landing -- a platform flipping safe handling on by default -- has not yet been disclosed.','[{"url": "https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-q63x-9pfm-mjx4", "title": "GitHub Advisory Database - Feast unsafe deserialization allows unauthenticated RCE (CVE-2026-56121)"}, {"url": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-56121", "title": "NVD - CVE-2026-56121 Detail (Feast before 0.63.0, gRPC registry deserialization RCE)"}]',5,'Feast''s CVE-2026-56121 is the textbook unsafe-artifact-handling incident this defensive thesis anticipated: a feature-view body deserialized via dill.loads() before any auth check, yielding unauthenticated RCE on the ML data-and-metadata plane that managed serving and feature-store platforms host. A maximum-severity, trivially weaponizable advisory is precisely the pressure that historically pushes platforms to stop trusting serialized objects on the wire by default.','FeastのCVE-2026-56121は、この防御的な見立てが見越していた、安全でない成果物の取り扱いの典型的な事案だ。特徴量ビューのbodyが、いかなる認可チェックも経ずにdill.loads()でデシリアライズされ、マネージドの配信や特徴量ストアがホストする機械学習のデータとメタデータの層で、認証不要のRCEを生む。深刻度最大で容易に武器化できる勧告こそ、プラットフォームに通信上のシリアライズ済みオブジェクトを既定では信頼しないよう仕向けてきた、歴史的な圧力にほかならない。','El CVE-2026-56121 de Feast es el incidente de manual de manejo inseguro de artefactos que esta tesis defensiva anticipaba: un cuerpo de feature-view deserializado mediante dill.loads() antes de cualquier comprobación de autenticación, que produce un RCE sin autenticación en el plano de datos y metadatos de ML que alojan las plataformas gestionadas de servido y de feature stores. Un aviso de severidad máxima y trivialmente armable es precisamente la presión que históricamente empuja a las plataformas a dejar de confiar por defecto en objetos serializados que llegan por la red.','Ang CVE-2026-56121 ng Feast ang halimbawa mula sa aklat ng unsafe-artifact-handling na insidente na inaasahan ng depensibong thesis na ito: isang feature-view body na na-deserialize sa pamamagitan ng dill.loads() bago ang anumang auth check, na nagbubunga ng unauthenticated RCE sa data-and-metadata na antas ng ML na hino-host ng mga managed serving at feature-store na platform. Ang isang maximum-severity at madaling gamiting sandata na advisory ang siya mismong presyur na sa kasaysayan ay nagtutulak sa mga platform na huminto na sa pagtitiwala sa serialized na object sa network bilang default.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Feast''s CVE-2026-56121 is the textbook unsafe-artifact-handling incident this defensive thesis anticipated: a feature-view body deserialized via dill.loads() before any auth check, yielding unauthenticated RCE on the ML data-and-metadata plane that managed serving and feature-store platforms host. A maximum-severity, trivially weaponizable advisory is precisely the pressure that historically pushes platforms to stop trusting serialized objects on the wire by default.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.c1e9ab0fe60a6ee5','source.d82226aa54db3638','2026-06-26','prediction.3d03e9edeb3b854c','Hyperscaler ships TEE-I/O confidential frontier-model inference by Q1 2027','Hyperscaler ships TEE-I/O confidential frontier-model inference by Q1 2027','Hyperscaler ships TEE-I/O confidential frontier-model inference by Q1 2027','Hyperscaler ships TEE-I/O confidential frontier-model inference by Q1 2027','2026-06-22','Today''s news reinforces this thesis from both the threat and the venue sides. The June 24 Feast CVE-2026-56121 RCE keeps the agentic-AI security cycle tied to model-supply-chain integrity -- unauthenticated registries handing serialized objects to a deserializer -- which is the same class of risk that confidential inference and attestation are meant to contain by keeping weights and activations encrypted in use and verifying which model is running. The forward calendar names the venues where a TEE-I/O confidential-inference offering would plausibly surface: AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23 at Moscone, Instinct MI400-series keynote July 23) and Black Hat USA 2026 (August 1-6, AI Summit August 4) sit directly in this prediction''s window. The prediction''s falsifiable target is a hyperscaler shipping confidential frontier-model inference with TEE-I/O -- encrypted-in-use weights and activations across the CPU-accelerator boundary -- as a usable offering. The gap to the bar: today supplies the threat backdrop and the upcoming-venue cadence, not a hyperscaler confidential-inference launch; no named cloud has disclosed a TEE-I/O confidential frontier-model inference tier in today''s reporting.','[{"url": "https://www.amd.com/en/corporate/events/advancing-ai.html", "title": "AMD - Advancing AI 2026 (San Francisco, July 22-23)"}, {"url": "https://blackhat.com/us-26/", "title": "Black Hat - USA 2026 (August 1-6, Mandalay Bay, Las Vegas)"}]',4,'The Feast registry deserialization RCE keeps the agentic-AI cycle tied to model-supply-chain integrity, the same risk class confidential inference and attestation contain by keeping weights and activations encrypted in use. AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23) and Black Hat USA (August 1-6) sit squarely in this window as plausible disclosure venues, supplying threat rationale and timing rather than a launch.','Feastのレジストリのデシリアライズの脆弱性(RCE)は、エージェント型AIの流れをモデルサプライチェーンの完全性に結びつけ続ける。これは、重みとアクティベーションを使用中も暗号化したまま保つことで秘匿推論と証明が封じ込める、まさに同じクラスのリスクだ。AMDのAdvancing AI 2026(7月22-23日)とBlack Hat USA(8月1-6日)はこの期間内に確かに位置し、有力な開示の舞台となる。これらはローンチではなく、脅威の論拠とタイミングを提供する。','El RCE de deserialización del registro de Feast mantiene la ronda de IA agéntica vinculada a la integridad de la cadena de suministro de modelos, la misma clase de riesgo que la inferencia confidencial y la atestación contienen al mantener pesos y activaciones cifrados en uso. Advancing AI 2026 de AMD (22-23 de julio) y Black Hat USA (1-6 de agosto) se sitúan de lleno en esta ventana como foros de divulgación plausibles, aportando justificación de amenaza y temporización más que un lanzamiento.','Patuloy na iniuugnay ng Feast registry deserialization RCE ang agentic-AI cycle sa model-supply-chain integrity, ang parehong klase ng panganib na pinipigilan ng confidential inference at attestation sa pamamagitan ng pagpapanatiling naka-encrypt ang weights at activations habang ginagamit. Ang Advancing AI 2026 ng AMD (July 22-23) at ang Black Hat USA (August 1-6) ay nasa loob mismo ng panahong ito bilang malamang na mga lugar ng disclosure, na nagbibigay ng katwiran ng banta at ng tiyempo sa halip na isang paglulunsad.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Feast registry deserialization RCE keeps the agentic-AI cycle tied to model-supply-chain integrity, the same risk class confidential inference and attestation contain by keeping weights and activations encrypted in use. AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23) and Black Hat USA (August 1-6) sit squarely in this window as plausible disclosure venues, supplying threat rationale and timing rather than a launch.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.c8cf76762112415c','source.d82226aa54db3638','2026-06-26','prediction.6d9743241187213d','Confidential-GPU attestation lands as a cloud-AI contract term by Q2 2027','Confidential-GPU attestation lands as a cloud-AI contract term by Q2 2027','Confidential-GPU attestation lands as a cloud-AI contract term by Q2 2027','Confidential-GPU attestation lands as a cloud-AI contract term by Q2 2027','2026-06-14','Today''s news touches this thesis on the same confidential-compute and attestation thread that today''s fresh confidential-inference prediction develops. The June 24 Feast CVE-2026-56121 RCE -- an unauthenticated registry deserialization RCE on the ML plumbing -- is exactly the model-supply-chain-integrity pressure that makes hardware-rooted attestation (''prove the weights and the node are genuine and untampered'') a contract-grade requirement rather than a developer-preview flag. The forward calendar reinforces the timing: AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23) and Black Hat USA 2026 (August 1-6, AI Summit August 4) are venues where confidential-GPU attestation and TEE-I/O capabilities are routinely disclosed and productized. The prediction''s falsifiable target is confidential-GPU attestation appearing as a contracted, auditable cloud-AI procurement term -- not a marketing line. The gap to the bar: today supplies the threat rationale and the venue cadence, not a disclosed contract term; no cloud-AI agreement naming confidential-GPU attestation as a procurement clause appears in today''s reporting.','[{"url": "https://www.amd.com/en/corporate/events/advancing-ai.html", "title": "AMD - Advancing AI 2026 (San Francisco, July 22-23)"}, {"url": "https://blackhat.com/us-26/", "title": "Black Hat - USA 2026 (August 1-6, Mandalay Bay, Las Vegas)"}]',4,'An unauthenticated registry deserialization RCE on the ML plumbing is exactly the model-supply-chain pressure that pushes hardware-rooted attestation from a developer-preview flag toward a contract-grade requirement. AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23) and Black Hat USA (August 1-6) are venues where confidential-GPU attestation and TEE-I/O capabilities get disclosed and productized, reinforcing the timing for this thesis.','機械学習の配管における認証不要のレジストリのデシリアライズの脆弱性(RCE)は、まさにモデルサプライチェーンへの圧力であり、ハードウェアに根ざした証明を、開発者プレビューの設定から契約水準の要件へと押し上げる。AMDのAdvancing AI 2026(7月22-23日)とBlack Hat USA(8月1-6日)は、秘匿GPUの証明やTEE-I/Oの機能が開示・製品化される会場であり、この見立てのタイミングを補強する。','Un RCE de deserialización en un registro sin autenticación sobre la plomería de ML es exactamente la presión de cadena de suministro de modelos que empuja la atestación enraizada en hardware desde una opción de vista previa para desarrolladores hacia un requisito de grado contractual. Advancing AI 2026 de AMD (22-23 de julio) y Black Hat USA (1-6 de agosto) son foros donde la atestación de GPU confidencial y las capacidades TEE-I/O se divulgan y productizan, lo que refuerza la temporización de esta tesis.','Ang isang unauthenticated na registry deserialization RCE sa imprastruktura ng ML ang siya mismong presyur ng model-supply-chain na nagtutulak sa hardware-rooted na attestation mula sa isang developer-preview na flag papunta sa isang kinakailangan na antas ng kontrata. Ang Advancing AI 2026 ng AMD (July 22-23) at ang Black Hat USA (August 1-6) ay mga lugar kung saan inilalantad at ginagawang produkto ang confidential-GPU attestation at mga kakayahan ng TEE-I/O, na pinatitibay ang tiyempo para sa thesis na ito.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'An unauthenticated registry deserialization RCE on the ML plumbing is exactly the model-supply-chain pressure that pushes hardware-rooted attestation from a developer-preview flag toward a contract-grade requirement. AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23) and Black Hat USA (August 1-6) are venues where confidential-GPU attestation and TEE-I/O capabilities get disclosed and productized, reinforcing the timing for this thesis.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.a3adf809ef84f5b5','source.d82226aa54db3638','2026-06-26','prediction.a943725fb4046b01','An autonomous-pentest vendor lands a named enterprise/gov deal by Q1 2027','An autonomous-pentest vendor lands a named enterprise/gov deal by Q1 2027','An autonomous-pentest vendor lands a named enterprise/gov deal by Q1 2027','An autonomous-pentest vendor lands a named enterprise/gov deal by Q1 2027','2026-06-22','Today''s news touches this thesis only on calendar context, not on a fresh deal signal. The forward AI-security calendar keeps autonomous offensive tooling staged in front of enterprise and government buyers: Black Hat USA 2026 (August 1-6 at Mandalay Bay, with the AI Summit on Summit Day August 4 and Briefings August 5-6), DEF CON 34 and its AI Village (August 6-9), and SecurityWeek''s AI Risk Summit (August 11-12, Half Moon Bay) are the marquee stages where autonomous-pentest vendors court buyers ahead of the fall procurement window. But that is venue cadence, not a transaction. The prediction''s falsifiable target is a named enterprise or government customer deal for an autonomous-pentest vendor, and today''s reporting carries no such contract -- no named buyer, no disclosed engagement. The gap to the bar is the whole deal: today supplies only the conference calendar that frames when such a deal might be announced.','[{"url": "https://blackhat.com/us-26/", "title": "Black Hat - USA 2026 (August 1-6, Mandalay Bay, Las Vegas)"}, {"url": "https://www.securityweek.com/securityweek-to-host-ai-risk-summit-august-11-12-at-the-ritz-carlton-half-moon-bay/", "title": "SecurityWeek - AI Risk Summit, August 11-12, Half Moon Bay"}]',2,'Today''s reporting offers only calendar adjacency, not a deal signal. Black Hat USA (August 1-6, AI Summit August 4), DEF CON 34''s AI Village (August 6-9), and SecurityWeek''s AI Risk Summit (August 11-12) are the marquee stages where autonomous-pentest vendors court enterprise and government buyers ahead of the fall procurement window. That is venue cadence, not a transaction.','本日の報道が示すのはカレンダー上の近接のみで、成約の兆候ではない。Black Hat USA(8月1-6日、AI Summitは8月4日)、DEF CON 34のAI Village(8月6-9日)、SecurityWeekのAI Risk Summit(8月11-12日)は、自律ペンテストのベンダーが秋の調達期を前に企業や政府の購入者に売り込む花形の舞台だ。これは会場のリズムであって、取引ではない。','La información de hoy ofrece solo cercanía de calendario, no una señal de acuerdo. Black Hat USA (1-6 de agosto, AI Summit el 4 de agosto), el AI Village de DEF CON 34 (6-9 de agosto) y el AI Risk Summit de SecurityWeek (11-12 de agosto) son los escenarios estelares donde los proveedores de pentest autónomo cortejan a compradores empresariales y gubernamentales antes de la ventana de aprovisionamiento de otoño. Eso es ritmo de foros, no una transacción.','Nagbibigay lamang ang ulat ngayon ng pagkakatabi sa kalendaryo, hindi ng isang senyales ng kasunduan. Ang Black Hat USA (August 1-6, AI Summit noong August 4), ang AI Village ng DEF CON 34 (August 6-9), at ang AI Risk Summit ng SecurityWeek (August 11-12) ay ang mga pangunahing yugto kung saan nililigawan ng mga autonomous-pentest na vendor ang mga mamimili sa enterprise at gobyerno bago ang panahon ng procurement sa taglagas. Iyan ay ritmo ng mga lugar, hindi isang transaksyon.','none',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Today''s reporting offers only calendar adjacency, not a deal signal. Black Hat USA (August 1-6, AI Summit August 4), DEF CON 34''s AI Village (August 6-9), and SecurityWeek''s AI Risk Summit (August 11-12) are the marquee stages where autonomous-pentest vendors court enterprise and government buyers ahead of the fall procurement window. That is venue cadence, not a transaction.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.6f1eab21796099e8','source.d82226aa54db3638','2026-06-26','prediction.47a4eb0e8d95b76d','Autonomous pentest agents ship as named managed tier by Q4 2026','Autonomous pentest agents ship as named managed tier by Q4 2026','Autonomous pentest agents ship as named managed tier by Q4 2026','Autonomous pentest agents ship as named managed tier by Q4 2026','2026-06-25','Today''s news bears on this thesis only through the AI-security event calendar, not through a product launch. Black Hat USA 2026 (August 1-6, with the AI Summit on Summit Day August 4) and DEF CON 34''s AI Village (August 6-9) give autonomous offensive-security agents their first marquee enterprise-buyer stages of the year before the fall procurement window, and SecurityWeek''s AI Risk Summit (August 11-12, Half Moon Bay) keeps the category in front of risk-side buyers. That cadence frames when a named managed tier could be marketed, but it is not the tier itself. The prediction''s falsifiable target is at least one major services or security-platform vendor marketing an autonomous-pentesting agent as a named, continuously-running managed tier with its own SKU and pricing by Q4 2026. The gap to the bar: today shows only a conference calendar, not a named, self-serve managed product; liability and scoping concerns could keep these agents gated behind human-supervised pilots and push any launch past the window.','[{"url": "https://blackhat.com/us-26/", "title": "Black Hat - USA 2026 (August 1-6, Mandalay Bay, Las Vegas)"}, {"url": "https://www.securityweek.com/securityweek-to-host-ai-risk-summit-august-11-12-at-the-ritz-carlton-half-moon-bay/", "title": "SecurityWeek - AI Risk Summit, August 11-12, Half Moon Bay"}]',2,'Today''s reporting does not materially advance this thesis. The only contact is venue cadence: Black Hat USA''s AI Summit (Aug 4) and DEF CON 34''s AI Village (Aug 6-9) stage autonomous offensive-security agents before fall buyers. That frames when a named managed tier might be marketed, but no vendor shipped or priced a continuously-running autonomous-pentest SKU today.','本日の報道は、この見立てを実質的に前進させない。唯一の接点は会場のリズムだ。Black Hat USAのAI Summit(8月4日)とDEF CON 34のAI Village(8月6-9日)が、自律的な攻撃用セキュリティのエージェントを秋の購入者の前に並べる。これは名前のあるマネージド階層がいつ市場投入されうるかを枠づけるが、本日、継続的に稼働する自律ペンテストのSKUを出荷ないし値付けしたベンダーはなかった。','La información de hoy no hace avanzar materialmente esta tesis. El único contacto es el ritmo de los foros: el AI Summit de Black Hat USA (4 de agosto) y el AI Village de DEF CON 34 (6-9 de agosto) ponen en escena agentes autónomos de seguridad ofensiva ante los compradores de otoño. Eso enmarca cuándo podría comercializarse un nivel gestionado nombrado, pero ningún proveedor entregó ni puso precio hoy a un SKU de pentest autónomo de ejecución continua.','Hindi makabuluhang isinusulong ng ulat ngayon ang thesis na ito. Ang tanging ugnayan ay ritmo ng mga lugar: ang AI Summit ng Black Hat USA (Aug 4) at ang AI Village ng DEF CON 34 (Aug 6-9) ay naglalatag ng autonomous offensive-security na mga ahente sa harap ng mga mamimili sa taglagas. Binabalangkas niyan kung kailan maaaring imarketing ang isang pinangalanang managed tier, ngunit walang vendor na naglabas o nagpresyo ng isang tuloy-tuloy na tumatakbong autonomous-pentest na SKU ngayon.','none',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Today''s reporting does not materially advance this thesis. The only contact is venue cadence: Black Hat USA''s AI Summit (Aug 4) and DEF CON 34''s AI Village (Aug 6-9) stage autonomous offensive-security agents before fall buyers. That frames when a named managed tier might be marketed, but no vendor shipped or priced a continuously-running autonomous-pentest SKU today.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.b4a7f34bcbda74be','source.d82226aa54db3638','2026-06-26','prediction.3e6e8b6ae1e7c76e','AI-agent procurement adds a numeric prompt-injection-resistance bar by Q2 2027','AI-agent procurement adds a numeric prompt-injection-resistance bar by Q2 2027','AI-agent procurement adds a numeric prompt-injection-resistance bar by Q2 2027','AI-agent procurement adds a numeric prompt-injection-resistance bar by Q2 2027','2026-06-23','Today''s news touches this thesis on adjacency and venue, not on a procurement-spec change. The June 24 Feast CVE-2026-56121 RCE keeps the broader agentic-AI attack-surface drumbeat alive -- an unauthenticated code-execution path on ML plumbing -- which is the kind of incident that feeds buyer-side demand for measurable security bars in AI procurement, though it is a deserialization flaw rather than a prompt-injection one. The forward calendar names the application-security forum where such procurement norms get debated and codified: OWASP Global AppSec USA (November 5-6 in San Francisco) sits squarely in the prediction''s window, alongside the broader AI-security track at Black Hat and DEF CON. The prediction''s falsifiable target is AI-agent procurement adding a numeric prompt-injection-resistance bar -- a quantified threshold in a buying requirement. The gap to the bar is essentially the whole claim: today supplies thematic security pressure and the relevant standards venue, not a procurement document specifying a numeric prompt-injection-resistance threshold.','[{"url": "https://blackhat.com/us-26/", "title": "Black Hat - USA 2026 (August 1-6, Mandalay Bay, Las Vegas)"}]',2,'Today''s news does not materially advance this thesis. The Feast deserialization RCE keeps the agentic-AI attack-surface drumbeat alive and feeds buyer demand for measurable security bars, but it is not a prompt-injection flaw, and OWASP Global AppSec USA (Nov 5-6) is venue context only. No procurement document specifying a numeric prompt-injection-resistance threshold appeared.','本日のニュースは、この見立てを実質的に前進させない。Feastのデシリアライズの脆弱性(RCE)は、エージェント型AIの攻撃対象領域をめぐる鼓動を保ち、計測可能なセキュリティ基準への購入者の需要を後押しする。だがこれはプロンプトインジェクションの欠陥ではなく、OWASP Global AppSec USA(11月5-6日)は会場の文脈にすぎない。数値で示すプロンプトインジェクション耐性の閾値を規定する調達文書は現れなかった。','Las noticias de hoy no hacen avanzar materialmente esta tesis. El RCE de deserialización de Feast mantiene vivo el redoble sobre la superficie de ataque de la IA agéntica y alimenta la demanda de listones de seguridad medibles por parte de los compradores, pero no es una vulnerabilidad de inyección de prompts, y OWASP Global AppSec USA (5-6 de noviembre) es solo contexto de foro. No apareció ningún documento de aprovisionamiento que especifique un umbral numérico de resistencia a la inyección de prompts.','Hindi makabuluhang isinusulong ng balita ngayon ang thesis na ito. Pinananatiling buhay ng Feast deserialization RCE ang pamamarka ng agentic-AI attack-surface at nagpapalakas sa pangangailangan ng mamimili para sa masusukat na mga bar ng seguridad, ngunit ito ay hindi isang prompt-injection na depekto, at ang OWASP Global AppSec USA (Nov 5-6) ay konteksto lamang ng lugar. Walang dokumento ng procurement na tumutukoy sa isang numeric na threshold ng prompt-injection-resistance ang lumitaw.','none',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Today''s news does not materially advance this thesis. The Feast deserialization RCE keeps the agentic-AI attack-surface drumbeat alive and feeds buyer demand for measurable security bars, but it is not a prompt-injection flaw, and OWASP Global AppSec USA (Nov 5-6) is venue context only. No procurement document specifying a numeric prompt-injection-resistance threshold appeared.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.7d7b2854be9cb302','source.d82226aa54db3638','2026-06-26','prediction.67f059f9cf2cf506','Inline MCP-channel policy enforcement ships as a platform default by Q1 2027','Inline MCP-channel policy enforcement ships as a platform default by Q1 2027','Inline MCP-channel policy enforcement ships as a platform default by Q1 2027','Inline MCP-channel policy enforcement ships as a platform default by Q1 2027','2026-06-16','Today''s news only faintly touches this agentic-security-hardening thesis. The June 24 Feast CVE-2026-56121 RCE sits in the same broad family of unauthenticated, network-reachable code-execution surfaces on AI infrastructure that motivates inline policy enforcement on agent and tool channels, but it is a deserialization flaw on an ML feature-store registry, not an MCP-channel issue, and it says nothing about MCP policy-enforcement defaults. There is no MCP-specific signal in today''s reporting -- no platform enabling inline MCP-channel policy enforcement, and no vendor change to channel defaults. The prediction''s falsifiable target is a platform shipping inline MCP-channel policy enforcement on by default, which today''s news does not address; the relevance is limited to general thematic adjacency on AI-infrastructure attack surface.','[]',1,'Today''s news does not advance this thesis. The Feast RCE sits in the same broad family of unauthenticated, network-reachable code-execution surfaces on AI infrastructure, but it is a feature-store deserialization flaw, not an MCP-channel issue, and says nothing about MCP policy-enforcement defaults. No platform enabled inline MCP-channel policy enforcement and no vendor changed channel defaults.','本日のニュースは、この見立てを前進させない。Feastの脆弱性(RCE)は、AI基盤における認証不要でネットワークから到達可能なコード実行の領域という同じ広い系統に属するが、これは特徴量ストアのデシリアライズの欠陥であって、MCPチャネルの問題ではなく、MCPのポリシー適用の既定について何も語っていない。インラインのMCPチャネルのポリシー適用を有効にしたプラットフォームもなく、チャネルの既定を変更したベンダーもない。','Las noticias de hoy no hacen avanzar esta tesis. El RCE de Feast se sitúa en la misma familia amplia de superficies de ejecución de código sin autenticación y alcanzables por la red sobre la infraestructura de IA, pero es una vulnerabilidad de deserialización en un feature store, no un problema de canal MCP, y no dice nada sobre los valores por defecto de aplicación de políticas de MCP. Ninguna plataforma activó la aplicación de políticas en línea sobre el canal MCP y ningún proveedor cambió los valores por defecto del canal.','Hindi isinusulong ng balita ngayon ang thesis na ito. Ang Feast RCE ay nasa parehong malawak na pamilya ng unauthenticated at network-reachable na mga kakayahan ng code-execution sa imprastruktura ng AI, ngunit ito ay isang feature-store deserialization na depekto, hindi isang isyu ng MCP-channel, at walang sinasabi tungkol sa mga default ng MCP policy-enforcement. Walang platform na nag-enable ng inline MCP-channel policy enforcement at walang vendor na nagbago ng mga default ng channel.','none',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Today''s news does not advance this thesis. The Feast RCE sits in the same broad family of unauthenticated, network-reachable code-execution surfaces on AI infrastructure, but it is a feature-store deserialization flaw, not an MCP-channel issue, and says nothing about MCP policy-enforcement defaults. No platform enabled inline MCP-channel policy enforcement and no vendor changed channel defaults.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.d5d494dc449de128','source.7b7cc2df80db0f54','2026-06-27','prediction.f52aeb7468446ca2','Multi-tenant agent builders draw a 9.0+ cross-tenant authz CVE by Q1 2027','Multi-tenant agent builders draw a 9.0+ cross-tenant authz CVE by Q1 2027','Multi-tenant agent builders draw a 9.0+ cross-tenant authz CVE by Q1 2027','Multi-tenant agent builders draw a 9.0+ cross-tenant authz CVE by Q1 2027','2026-06-27','Today''s lead is the precipitating origin signal and the class signature this thesis rests on. The Langflow cross-tenant IDOR fired in the wild is CVE-2026-55255, a CVSS 9.9 insecure-direct-object-reference (CWE-639) on a flow-execution endpoint: the get_flow_by_id_or_endpoint_name helper resolves a flow by UUID with no owner check, so any authenticated user can run another tenant''s flow via /api/v1/responses. Sysdig''s June 25 report is the first known in-the-wild exploitation, and the telemetry shows an operator harvesting flow IDs from GET /api/v1/flows/ then replaying them ~20 seconds later on POST /api/v1/responses with input ''leak api keys,'' on an instance also running the KEV-listed RCE CVE-2026-33017. The structural read in today''s reporting is exactly the prediction''s premise: the soft underbelly of multi-tenant agent platforms is the orchestration and authorization plane -- opaque, harvestable flow/run/workspace IDs, a shared execution endpoint, and owner checks deferred to the UI rather than enforced server-side per object -- and the same architectural pattern recurs across the n8n / Flowise / Dify / LangGraph Platform / CrewAI peer class. The gap to the falsifiable bar: the prediction requires a SECOND, distinct named platform in this category (not Langflow) to receive a CVSS >= 9.0 advisory whose root cause is cross-tenant authorization, broken-object-level access, or IDOR, ideally with in-the-wild or CISA-KEV evidence. Today supplies the first instance and the structural trigger; the recurrence that would confirm the class has not yet landed.','[{"url": "https://webflow.sysdig.com/blog/understanding-langflow-cve-2026-55255-and-why-higher-cvss-vulnerabilities-arent-always-the-most-exploited", "title": "Sysdig - Understanding Langflow CVE-2026-55255, and why higher-CVSS vulnerabilities aren''t always the most exploited"}, {"url": "https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-qrpv-q767-xqq2", "title": "GitHub Advisory Database - Langflow IDOR in /api/v1/responses lets authenticated attackers run another user''s flow (CVE-2026-55255)"}, {"url": "https://advisories.gitlab.com/pypi/langflow/CVE-2026-55255/", "title": "GitLab Advisory Database - CVE-2026-55255 Langflow IDOR (CVSS 9.9, fixed in 1.9.1)"}]',5,'The Langflow cross-tenant IDOR (CVE-2026-55255, CVSS 9.9) firing in the wild June 25 is the precipitating origin signal: a flow resolved by opaque UUID with owner checks deferred to the UI on a shared execution endpoint. That is precisely the orchestration-plane underbelly the Multi-tenant agent builders authz-CVE thesis (Jun 27) rests on, and the pattern recurs across n8n/Flowise/Dify.','6月25日に実環境で発火したLangflowのテナント横断IDOR(CVE-2026-55255、CVSS 9.9)が、起点となる兆候だ。共有された実行エンドポイント上で、所有者チェックを画面側に委ねたまま、中身の見えないUUIDでフローを解決する。これはまさに、マルチテナントのエージェントビルダーの認可CVEの見立て(6月27日)が土台とする、オーケストレーション層の急所だ。同じ型はn8n / Flowise / Difyにわたって繰り返し現れる。','El IDOR entre inquilinos de Langflow (CVE-2026-55255, CVSS 9.9) disparado de forma activa el 25 de junio es la señal de origen que precipita: un flujo resuelto por UUID opaco con comprobaciones de propietario diferidas a la interfaz sobre un endpoint de ejecución compartido. Ese es justamente el punto débil del plano de orquestación sobre el que descansa la tesis del CVE de autorización en los builders de agentes multi-inquilino (27 jun), y el patrón se repite en n8n/Flowise/Dify.','Ang Langflow cross-tenant IDOR (CVE-2026-55255, CVSS 9.9) na lumitaw sa totoong mundo noong June 25 ang nagpasimuno na origin signal: isang flow na nireresolba sa malabong UUID na may mga owner check na ipinapaubaya sa UI sa isang ibinabahaging execution endpoint. Iyan mismo ang mahinang bahagi ng orchestration plane na pinagbabatayan ng thesis ng Multi-tenant agent builders na authz-CVE (Jun 27), at paulit-ulit na lumilitaw ang pattern sa buong n8n/Flowise/Dify.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Langflow cross-tenant IDOR (CVE-2026-55255, CVSS 9.9) firing in the wild June 25 is the precipitating origin signal: a flow resolved by opaque UUID with owner checks deferred to the UI on a shared execution endpoint. That is precisely the orchestration-plane underbelly the Multi-tenant agent builders authz-CVE thesis (Jun 27) rests on, and the pattern recurs across n8n/Flowise/Dify.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.b15771170cded802','source.7b7cc2df80db0f54','2026-06-27','prediction.1e6f56222db35798','Major AI-agent platform ships zero-trust controls as default-on by Q2 2027','Major AI-agent platform ships zero-trust controls as default-on by Q2 2027','Major AI-agent platform ships zero-trust controls as default-on by Q2 2027','Major AI-agent platform ships zero-trust controls as default-on by Q2 2027','2026-06-27','Today''s two security advisories are the structural forcing function this defensive thesis is built around. The Langflow cross-tenant IDOR (CVE-2026-55255, CVSS 9.9) with first in-the-wild exploitation reported by Sysdig on June 25 proves the orchestration plane ships without deny-by-default per-tenant authorization: get_flow_by_id_or_endpoint_name resolved a flow by UUID with no owner check. The AutoGPT SSRF-protection bypass (CVE-2026-56663, CVSS 8.5, fixed in 0.6.52, published June 26) proves the execution plane ships without SSRF-hardened tool-call and egress defaults: the SendWebRequestBlock that agents use for outbound HTTP calls mishandles IPv4-mapped IPv6 addresses, re-opening the internal-IP filter so an agent can reach cloud metadata, internal admin panels, and databases. Together they make the prediction''s exact case -- a fetch-arbitrary-URL block is by construction an SSRF surface, and a flow resolved by opaque ID is by construction a cross-tenant surface, unless authorization and egress are gated by default. The prediction''s falsifiable target is at least one major AI-agent platform, orchestration vendor, or agentic IDE shipping zero-trust controls as default-on in a named release: deny-by-default per-tenant object-level authorization and/or default outbound-egress allowlisting with SSRF-hardened blocks. The gap to the bar: a blog post, an opt-in toggle, a one-off CVE patch, or a roadmap promise does not count -- and today supplies only the motivating CVEs, not a default-posture release.','[{"url": "https://webflow.sysdig.com/blog/understanding-langflow-cve-2026-55255-and-why-higher-cvss-vulnerabilities-arent-always-the-most-exploited", "title": "Sysdig - Understanding Langflow CVE-2026-55255, and why higher-CVSS vulnerabilities aren''t always the most exploited"}, {"url": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-56663", "title": "NVD - CVE-2026-56663 Detail (AutoGPT SSRF-protection bypass via IPv4-mapped IPv6 addresses, fixed in 0.6.52)"}]',5,'Two same-week advisories are the forcing function behind the zero-trust-default-on thesis (Jun 27): Langflow''s IDOR (CVSS 9.9) proves the orchestration plane ships without deny-by-default per-tenant authorization, and AutoGPT''s SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663, CVSS 8.5) proves the execution plane ships without egress-hardened tool calls. A fetch-arbitrary-URL block and an opaque-ID flow are SSRF and cross-tenant surfaces unless gated by default.','同じ週の2件の勧告が、ゼロトラストを初期状態で有効にするという見立て(6月27日)を後押しする。LangflowのIDOR(CVSS 9.9)は、オーケストレーション層がテナントごとの拒否を既定とする認可なしで出荷されることを立証し、AutoGPTのSSRFバイパス(CVE-2026-56663、CVSS 8.5)は、実行層がエグレスを固めたツール呼び出しなしで出荷されることを立証する。任意URLを取得するブロックと、中身の見えないIDのフローは、既定で制御されない限りSSRFとテナント横断の攻撃対象領域だ。','Dos avisos de la misma semana son el imperativo detrás de la tesis del zero-trust activado por defecto (27 jun): el IDOR de Langflow (CVSS 9.9) prueba que el plano de orquestación se entrega sin autorización por inquilino que deniegue por defecto, y el bypass SSRF de AutoGPT (CVE-2026-56663, CVSS 8.5) prueba que el plano de ejecución se entrega sin llamadas a herramientas con egreso endurecido. Un bloque que recupera una URL arbitraria y un flujo de ID opaco son superficies SSRF y entre inquilinos a menos que estén controlados por defecto.','Ang dalawang advisory ng iisang linggo ang hindi maiiwasang puwersa sa likod ng thesis na zero-trust-default-on (Jun 27): pinatutunayan ng IDOR ng Langflow (CVSS 9.9) na umaalis ang orchestration plane nang walang deny-by-default na per-tenant authorization, at pinatutunayan ng SSRF bypass ng AutoGPT (CVE-2026-56663, CVSS 8.5) na umaalis ang execution plane nang walang egress-hardened na tool call. Ang isang fetch-arbitrary-URL block at isang flow na may malabong ID ay mga SSRF at cross-tenant surface maliban kung naka-gate bilang default.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Two same-week advisories are the forcing function behind the zero-trust-default-on thesis (Jun 27): Langflow''s IDOR (CVSS 9.9) proves the orchestration plane ships without deny-by-default per-tenant authorization, and AutoGPT''s SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663, CVSS 8.5) proves the execution plane ships without egress-hardened tool calls. A fetch-arbitrary-URL block and an opaque-ID flow are SSRF and cross-tenant surfaces unless gated by default.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.1b4dec2ecd9606a5','source.7b7cc2df80db0f54','2026-06-27','prediction.9bc46d8a918d51a2','AMD Instinct MI400 launches with a named ship, memory, or rack spec by Q3 2026','AMD Instinct MI400 launches with a named ship, memory, or rack spec by Q3 2026','AMD Instinct MI400 launches with a named ship, memory, or rack spec by Q3 2026','AMD Instinct MI400 launches with a named ship, memory, or rack spec by Q3 2026','2026-06-27','Today''s events calendar supplies the dated, named catalyst this thesis turns on. AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 is confirmed for July 22-23 at Moscone in San Francisco, with the keynote and Instinct MI400-series focus scheduled for July 23 -- a launch venue purpose-built to put a merchant-accelerator roadmap on the record against Nvidia. The prediction''s falsifiable target is that at the event AMD formally launches and details the MI400 datacenter-accelerator series with at least one NAMED, checkable commitment, not a teaser: a stated general-availability or volume-ship window, a named high-bandwidth-memory capacity or bandwidth figure, a named rack-scale platform (a Helios-class rack system), and/or a named hyperscaler or frontier-lab deployment commitment. This tracks the standing thesis that large-scale training and inference stay on hyperscaler-class merchant accelerators, so the competitive leg that moves the cloud is the merchant-accelerator roadmap plus its memory and rack specs and named-customer commitments. The gap to the bar: today gives the dated venue, not the on-stage spec. A spec-free teaser slide, a roadmap chart with no GA window, a re-announcement of the prior-generation MI355X / MI350 line, or an unconfirmed leak does not count -- the qualifying named commitment will only be checkable after the July 23 keynote.','[{"url": "https://www.amd.com/en/corporate/events/advancing-ai.html", "title": "AMD - Advancing AI 2026 (San Francisco, July 22-23)"}, {"url": "https://www.ai.engineer/worldsfair/2026", "title": "AI Engineer - World''s Fair 2026 (hackathon June 27-28; main program June 29 - July 2, Moscone West, San Francisco)"}]',5,'The dated catalyst for the AMD Instinct MI400 launch thesis (Jun 27) is on the record: Advancing AI 2026 is confirmed July 22-23 at Moscone, with the MI400-series keynote July 23 -- a venue built to put a merchant-accelerator roadmap against Nvidia, inside the Q3 2026 window. The setup for a named ship, memory, or rack commitment is in place.','AMD Instinct MI400の発表の見立て(6月27日)について、日付と名前のある契機が記録に残った。Advancing AI 2026はMosconeで7月22-23日の開催が確定し、MI400シリーズの基調講演は7月23日だ。Nvidiaに対してマーチャント・アクセラレータのロードマップを示すために用意された会場で、2026年第3四半期の窓に収まる。名前のある出荷・メモリ・ラックの約束に向けたお膳立ては整っている。','El catalizador fechado para la tesis del lanzamiento del AMD Instinct MI400 (27 jun) está sobre la mesa: Advancing AI 2026 está confirmado para el 22-23 de julio en Moscone, con la keynote de la serie MI400 el 23 de julio -- un foro construido para enfrentar una hoja de ruta de aceleradores comerciales a Nvidia, dentro de la ventana del Q3 2026. El terreno para un compromiso nombrado de envío, memoria o rack está preparado.','Ang may-petsang katalista para sa thesis ng paglulunsad ng AMD Instinct MI400 (Jun 27) ay nasa rekord na: kumpirmado ang Advancing AI 2026 sa July 22-23 sa Moscone, na may keynote ng MI400-series sa July 23 -- isang lugar na ginawa para ilagay ang isang merchant-accelerator roadmap laban sa Nvidia, sa loob ng window ng Q3 2026. Nakahanda na ang setup para sa isang pinangalanang ship, memory, o rack na commitment.','landing',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The dated catalyst for the AMD Instinct MI400 launch thesis (Jun 27) is on the record: Advancing AI 2026 is confirmed July 22-23 at Moscone, with the MI400-series keynote July 23 -- a venue built to put a merchant-accelerator roadmap against Nvidia, inside the Q3 2026 window. The setup for a named ship, memory, or rack commitment is in place.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.cc1f19cd0f5f69f1','source.7b7cc2df80db0f54','2026-06-27','prediction.2593e0dadb6a21a3','Coding-agent harnesses adopt default-deny toolset gating as standard by H1 2027','Coding-agent harnesses adopt default-deny toolset gating as standard by H1 2027','Coding-agent harnesses adopt default-deny toolset gating as standard by H1 2027','Coding-agent harnesses adopt default-deny toolset gating as standard by H1 2027','2026-06-20','Today''s two advisories are direct, in-the-wild evidence for the threat this default-deny thesis answers. The Langflow cross-tenant IDOR (CVE-2026-55255, CVSS 9.9) fired in the wild per Sysdig''s June 25 report shows an agent-execution endpoint running another tenant''s flow with no owner check, and the AutoGPT SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663, CVSS 8.5, fixed in 0.6.52) shows a general-purpose web-request block wired into agent workflows reaching internal services the agent was never meant to touch. Both are exactly the open-permission failure mode the prediction expects harnesses to close: a fetch-arbitrary-URL primitive and a broadly-scoped execution endpoint are dangerous precisely because the toolset and egress are allowed by default rather than gated. The prediction holds that coding-agent harnesses will make default-deny toolset gating the standard posture -- tools and network egress off until explicitly enabled per task. The gap to the bar: today supplies the motivating CVEs in agent platforms, not a harness shipping default-deny toolset gating as its standard. AutoGPT''s own remediation is a one-off SSRF patch plus an operator instruction to constrain outbound egress, which is the manual version of the default the prediction expects to become standard -- not the default itself.','[{"url": "https://webflow.sysdig.com/blog/understanding-langflow-cve-2026-55255-and-why-higher-cvss-vulnerabilities-arent-always-the-most-exploited", "title": "Sysdig - Understanding Langflow CVE-2026-55255, and why higher-CVSS vulnerabilities aren''t always the most exploited"}, {"url": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-56663", "title": "NVD - CVE-2026-56663 Detail (AutoGPT SSRF-protection bypass via IPv4-mapped IPv6 addresses, fixed in 0.6.52)"}]',4,'Both advisories evidence the threat the default-deny toolset-gating thesis (Jun 20) answers: Langflow''s IDOR runs another tenant''s flow on a broad endpoint, and AutoGPT''s SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663) lets a fetch-arbitrary-URL block reach internal services -- both dangerous because tools and egress are allowed by default rather than gated per task. AutoGPT''s patch-plus-egress-advice fix is the manual version of that default.','両方の勧告が、拒否を既定とするツールセット制御の見立て(6月20日)が答えとする脅威を裏づける。LangflowのIDORは広い権限のエンドポイントで別テナントのフローを実行し、AutoGPTのSSRFバイパス(CVE-2026-56663)は任意URLを取得するブロックを内部サービスに到達させる。どちらも、ツールとエグレスがタスクごとに制御されず既定で許可されているために危険だ。AutoGPTのパッチとエグレス制限の助言は、その既定の手作業による版だ。','Ambos avisos evidencian la amenaza a la que responde la tesis de la denegación por defecto del conjunto de herramientas (20 jun): el IDOR de Langflow ejecuta el flujo de otro inquilino sobre un endpoint amplio, y el bypass SSRF de AutoGPT (CVE-2026-56663) permite que un bloque que recupera una URL arbitraria alcance servicios internos -- ambos peligrosos porque las herramientas y el egreso están permitidos por defecto en lugar de controlados por tarea. La corrección de parche más consejo de egreso de AutoGPT es la versión manual de ese valor por defecto.','Pinapatunayan ng dalawang advisory ang banta na sinasagot ng thesis ng default-deny toolset-gating (Jun 20): nagpapatakbo ang IDOR ng Langflow ng flow ng ibang tenant sa isang malawak na endpoint, at hinahayaan ng SSRF bypass ng AutoGPT (CVE-2026-56663) ang isang fetch-arbitrary-URL block na umabot sa mga internal service -- pareho silang delikado dahil ang mga tool at egress ay pinapayagan bilang default sa halip na naka-gate kada gawain. Ang ayos ng AutoGPT na patch-kasama-payo-sa-egress ay ang manual na bersyon ng default na iyon.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Both advisories evidence the threat the default-deny toolset-gating thesis (Jun 20) answers: Langflow''s IDOR runs another tenant''s flow on a broad endpoint, and AutoGPT''s SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663) lets a fetch-arbitrary-URL block reach internal services -- both dangerous because tools and egress are allowed by default rather than gated per task. AutoGPT''s patch-plus-egress-advice fix is the manual version of that default.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.88d892b89489158c','source.7b7cc2df80db0f54','2026-06-27','prediction.f3f7e18b691f1c39','OpenClaw ships default-deny tool and network gating out-of-box by Q4 2026','OpenClaw ships default-deny tool and network gating out-of-box by Q4 2026','OpenClaw ships default-deny tool and network gating out-of-box by Q4 2026','OpenClaw ships default-deny tool and network gating out-of-box by Q4 2026','2026-06-23','Today''s AutoGPT advisory is squarely on-thesis for the network-gating half of this prediction. CVE-2026-56663 (CVSS 8.5, fixed in 0.6.52) is a bypass of AutoGPT''s SSRF protections: the SendWebRequestBlock mishandles IPv4-mapped IPv6 addresses and fails to validate certain IP ranges, so an authenticated user can defeat the internal-IP filter and reach private-network services -- cloud metadata, internal admin panels, databases. The fix advice -- upgrade and constrain outbound egress from the agent runner -- is precisely the default-deny network posture the prediction expects an agent harness to ship out-of-box rather than leave to operators. The Langflow cross-tenant IDOR fired in the wild reinforces the same broader pressure on agent platforms to gate by default at the object and execution boundary. The prediction''s falsifiable target is OpenClaw specifically shipping default-deny tool and network gating out-of-box. The gap to the bar: today supplies the threat case in peer projects (AutoGPT, Langflow), not an OpenClaw release; no OpenClaw default-deny shipment appears in today''s reporting.','[{"url": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-56663", "title": "NVD - CVE-2026-56663 Detail (AutoGPT SSRF-protection bypass via IPv4-mapped IPv6 addresses, fixed in 0.6.52)"}, {"url": "https://webflow.sysdig.com/blog/understanding-langflow-cve-2026-55255-and-why-higher-cvss-vulnerabilities-arent-always-the-most-exploited", "title": "Sysdig - Understanding Langflow CVE-2026-55255, and why higher-CVSS vulnerabilities aren''t always the most exploited"}]',3,'The June 26 AutoGPT SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663) feeds the network-gating half of the OpenClaw default-deny prediction (Jun 23): a fetch primitive reaching cloud metadata and internal services is exactly the egress that should be off out-of-box, and the fix''s advice to constrain outbound egress is the manual version of the expected default. The in-the-wild Langflow IDOR reinforces the same object-and-execution gating pressure.','6月26日のAutoGPTのSSRFバイパス(CVE-2026-56663)は、OpenClawの拒否を既定とする予測(6月23日)のネットワーク制御の半分を裏づける。クラウドのメタデータや内部サービスに到達する取得用の原始的機能は、まさに初期状態で無効であるべきエグレスだ。外向きエグレスを制限せよという是正策の助言は、その期待される既定の手作業による版だ。実環境で発火したLangflowのIDORは、同じオブジェクトと実行の制御圧力を補強する。','El bypass SSRF de AutoGPT del 26 de junio (CVE-2026-56663) alimenta la mitad de control de red de la predicción de denegación por defecto de OpenClaw (23 jun): una primitiva de recuperación que alcanza metadatos de la nube y servicios internos es justo el egreso que debería estar apagado de fábrica, y el consejo de la corrección de restringir el egreso saliente es la versión manual del valor por defecto esperado. El IDOR de Langflow disparado de forma activa refuerza la misma presión de control de objeto y de ejecución.','Ang AutoGPT SSRF bypass noong June 26 (CVE-2026-56663) ay nagpapakain sa kalahating network-gating ng prediksyon ng OpenClaw default-deny (Jun 23): ang isang fetch primitive na umaabot sa cloud metadata at mga internal service ay siya mismong egress na dapat naka-off out-of-box, at ang payo ng ayos na hadlangan ang papalabas na egress ay ang manual na bersyon ng inaasahang default. Pinapatibay ng Langflow IDOR sa totoong mundo ang parehong presyur sa pag-gate ng object at execution.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The June 26 AutoGPT SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663) feeds the network-gating half of the OpenClaw default-deny prediction (Jun 23): a fetch primitive reaching cloud metadata and internal services is exactly the egress that should be off out-of-box, and the fix''s advice to constrain outbound egress is the manual version of the expected default. The in-the-wild Langflow IDOR reinforces the same object-and-execution gating pressure.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.865251ca9aaf8e3c','source.7b7cc2df80db0f54','2026-06-27','prediction.079ca77d11decc5f','AI accelerator ships confidential-inference tier with attestation by H1 2027','AI accelerator ships confidential-inference tier with attestation by H1 2027','AI accelerator ships confidential-inference tier with attestation by H1 2027','AI accelerator ships confidential-inference tier with attestation by H1 2027','2026-06-26','Today''s news touches this thesis mainly through the AI-chip venue calendar, with a faint threat-side reinforcement. AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23 at Moscone, with the keynote and Instinct MI400-series focus July 23) is exactly the kind of stage where a confidential-inference part with attestation would surface, and it sits in this prediction''s window. On the threat side, the in-the-wild Langflow IDOR and the AutoGPT SSRF bypass keep the agentic-AI security cycle tied to the integrity and isolation of what runs on AI infrastructure, the broad concern that hardware-rooted confidential inference and signed-model attestation address -- though neither CVE is itself an accelerator or attestation story. The prediction expects a purpose-built AI inference accelerator to ship or be unveiled with confidential computing as a named, load-bearing feature: on-die root-of-trust, TEE-I/O keeping weights and activations encrypted in use across the CPU-accelerator boundary, and signed-model attestation, marketed as a named confidential-inference SKU or tier. The gap to the bar: today gives only the upcoming AMD venue and ambient threat backdrop, not a shipping part. A generic confidential-computing line on a GPU spec sheet, a research paper, or a confidential-VM offering without TEE-I/O or model attestation does not count; the named confidential-inference tier has not been disclosed.','[{"url": "https://www.amd.com/en/corporate/events/advancing-ai.html", "title": "AMD - Advancing AI 2026 (San Francisco, July 22-23)"}]',2,'AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23, Moscone, MI400-series keynote July 23) sits inside the window for the confidential-inference-tier prediction (Jun 26) and is exactly the kind of stage where a part with on-die root-of-trust, TEE-I/O, and signed-model attestation would surface. The in-the-wild Langflow IDOR and AutoGPT SSRF keep integrity-of-what-runs concerns loud, though neither is an accelerator or attestation story.','AMDのAdvancing AI 2026(7月22-23日、Moscone、MI400シリーズの基調講演は7月23日)は、秘匿推論の階層の予測(6月26日)の窓に収まり、まさにダイ上のルートオブトラスト、TEE-I/O、署名付きモデルの証明を備えた部品が現れそうな舞台だ。実環境で発火したLangflowのIDORとAutoGPTのSSRFは、何が動いているかの完全性という関心事を大きく保つが、いずれもアクセラレータや証明の話ではない。','El Advancing AI 2026 de AMD (22-23 de julio, Moscone, keynote de la serie MI400 el 23 de julio) se sitúa dentro de la ventana de la predicción del nivel de inferencia confidencial (26 jun) y es exactamente el tipo de escenario donde aparecería una pieza con raíz de confianza en el chip, TEE-I/O y atestación de modelos firmados. El IDOR de Langflow disparado de forma activa y el SSRF de AutoGPT mantienen sonoras las preocupaciones por la integridad de lo que se ejecuta, aunque ninguno es una historia de aceleradores ni de atestación.','Ang Advancing AI 2026 ng AMD (July 22-23, Moscone, keynote ng MI400-series sa July 23) ay nasa loob ng window para sa prediksyon ng confidential-inference-tier (Jun 26) at siya mismong uri ng entablado kung saan lilitaw ang isang bahagi na may on-die root-of-trust, TEE-I/O, at signed-model attestation. Pinananatiling malakas ng Langflow IDOR sa totoong mundo at ng AutoGPT SSRF ang mga alalahanin sa integridad ng anumang tumatakbo, bagama''t walang isa man dito ang isang accelerator o attestation na kuwento.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23, Moscone, MI400-series keynote July 23) sits inside the window for the confidential-inference-tier prediction (Jun 26) and is exactly the kind of stage where a part with on-die root-of-trust, TEE-I/O, and signed-model attestation would surface. The in-the-wild Langflow IDOR and AutoGPT SSRF keep integrity-of-what-runs concerns loud, though neither is an accelerator or attestation story.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.a0147f9f8234ab21','source.7b7cc2df80db0f54','2026-06-27','prediction.57ffda60c7453d2f','Managed model-serving platforms default to safe artifact handling by H1 2027','Managed model-serving platforms default to safe artifact handling by H1 2027','Managed model-serving platforms default to safe artifact handling by H1 2027','Managed model-serving platforms default to safe artifact handling by H1 2027','2026-06-17','Today''s news bears on this thesis on theme rather than on a default-handling change. The Langflow cross-tenant IDOR fired in the wild and the AutoGPT SSRF bypass both show that the agent-platform plumbing -- execution endpoints, fetch primitives -- ships unsafe-by-default and only hardens after a maximum-severity incident, which is the same default-shipment pressure this prediction expects to reach managed model-serving platforms. But today''s CVEs are an authorization-bypass IDOR and an SSRF bypass, not the unsafe-artifact-deserialization class (pickle/dill, model checkpoints, feature-store bodies) that defines this prediction''s bar, so the contact is thematic rather than direct. The prediction holds that managed serving platforms will move safe artifact handling -- gated or sandboxed deserialization, signed/provenance-checked artifacts, safe-by-default formats -- from an opt-in flag to the platform default. The gap to the bar: today supplies neither a deserialization incident nor a managed-platform default-handling change; the defensive landing -- a named platform flipping safe artifact handling on by default -- has not been disclosed.','[{"url": "https://webflow.sysdig.com/blog/understanding-langflow-cve-2026-55255-and-why-higher-cvss-vulnerabilities-arent-always-the-most-exploited", "title": "Sysdig - Understanding Langflow CVE-2026-55255, and why higher-CVSS vulnerabilities aren''t always the most exploited"}]',2,'The in-the-wild Langflow IDOR and AutoGPT SSRF show agent-platform plumbing shipping unsafe-by-default and hardening only after a maximum-severity incident, the same default-shipment pressure the safe-artifact-handling prediction (Jun 17) expects to reach managed model-serving platforms. But both are authorization-bypass and request-forgery flaws, not the unsafe-deserialization class (pickle, dill, model checkpoints) that defines this bar, so the contact stays thematic.','実環境で発火したLangflowのIDORとAutoGPTのSSRFは、エージェントプラットフォームの配管が初期状態で安全でない形で出荷され、深刻度最大の事案が起きて初めて固められることを示す。これは、安全な成果物の取り扱いの予測(6月17日)がマネージドのモデル配信プラットフォームに及ぶと見込む、同じ既定出荷の圧力だ。だが両者は認可バイパスとリクエスト偽造の欠陥であって、この基準を定める安全でないデシリアライズの脆弱性クラス(pickle、dill、モデルのチェックポイント)ではないため、接点はテーマ上にとどまる。','El IDOR de Langflow disparado de forma activa y el SSRF de AutoGPT muestran que la fontanería de las plataformas de agentes se entrega insegura por defecto y solo se endurece tras un incidente de severidad máxima, la misma presión de entrega por defecto que la predicción del manejo seguro de artefactos (17 jun) espera que alcance a las plataformas gestionadas de servido de modelos. Pero ambos son fallos de bypass de autorización y de falsificación de petición, no la clase de deserialización insegura (pickle, dill, checkpoints de modelos) que define este listón, de modo que el contacto sigue siendo temático.','Ipinapakita ng Langflow IDOR sa totoong mundo at ng AutoGPT SSRF na ang plumbing ng agent platform ay umaalis na unsafe-by-default at tumitigas lamang pagkatapos ng isang maximum-severity na insidente, ang parehong presyur ng default-shipment na inaasahan ng prediksyon ng safe-artifact-handling (Jun 17) na aabot sa mga managed model-serving platform. Ngunit parehong authorization-bypass at request-forgery na depekto ang mga ito, hindi ang unsafe-deserialization na klase (pickle, dill, model checkpoint) na bumubuo sa bar na ito, kaya nananatiling pang-tema lamang ang ugnayan.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The in-the-wild Langflow IDOR and AutoGPT SSRF show agent-platform plumbing shipping unsafe-by-default and hardening only after a maximum-severity incident, the same default-shipment pressure the safe-artifact-handling prediction (Jun 17) expects to reach managed model-serving platforms. But both are authorization-bypass and request-forgery flaws, not the unsafe-deserialization class (pickle, dill, model checkpoints) that defines this bar, so the contact stays thematic.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.8363b666da3d948f','source.7b7cc2df80db0f54','2026-06-27','prediction.3e6e8b6ae1e7c76e','AI-agent procurement adds a numeric prompt-injection-resistance bar by Q2 2027','AI-agent procurement adds a numeric prompt-injection-resistance bar by Q2 2027','AI-agent procurement adds a numeric prompt-injection-resistance bar by Q2 2027','AI-agent procurement adds a numeric prompt-injection-resistance bar by Q2 2027','2026-06-23','Today''s news touches this thesis on adjacency and venue, not on a procurement-spec change. The Langflow IDOR fired in the wild and the AutoGPT SSRF bypass keep the agentic-AI attack-surface drumbeat loud -- unauthenticated cross-tenant flow execution and an agent fetch primitive reaching internal services -- which is the kind of incident stream that feeds buyer-side demand for measurable security bars in AI-agent procurement. The relevant standards forum is on the forward calendar: OWASP Global AppSec USA (November 5-6 in San Francisco) sits in the prediction''s window, alongside Black Hat''s and DEF CON''s AI-security tracks. But these are authorization and request-forgery flaws rather than prompt-injection ones, so the contact with this prediction''s specific bar is oblique. The prediction''s falsifiable target is AI-agent procurement adding a numeric prompt-injection-resistance bar -- a quantified threshold in a buying requirement. The gap to the bar is essentially the whole claim: today supplies thematic security pressure and the relevant standards venue, not a procurement document specifying a numeric prompt-injection-resistance threshold.','[{"url": "https://webflow.sysdig.com/blog/understanding-langflow-cve-2026-55255-and-why-higher-cvss-vulnerabilities-arent-always-the-most-exploited", "title": "Sysdig - Understanding Langflow CVE-2026-55255, and why higher-CVSS vulnerabilities aren''t always the most exploited"}]',2,'The June 25 in-the-wild Langflow IDOR and the AutoGPT SSRF bypass keep the agentic attack-surface drumbeat loud, the buyer-side pressure feeding demand for measurable security bars. OWASP Global AppSec USA (Nov 5-6, SF) sits in the window. But these are authorization and request-forgery flaws, not prompt-injection ones, so contact with the numeric-resistance bar is oblique.','6月25日に実環境で発火したLangflowのIDORとAutoGPTのSSRFバイパスは、エージェント型の攻撃対象領域を巡る連打を大きく保ち、計測可能なセキュリティ基準への需要を生む買い手側の圧力となる。OWASP Global AppSec USA(11月5-6日、SF)は窓に収まる。だがこれらは認可とリクエスト偽造の欠陥であって、プロンプトインジェクションの欠陥ではないため、数値耐性の基準との接点は間接的だ。','El IDOR de Langflow disparado de forma activa el 25 de junio y el bypass SSRF de AutoGPT mantienen sonoro el redoble de la superficie de ataque agéntica, la presión del lado comprador que alimenta la demanda de listones de seguridad medibles. OWASP Global AppSec USA (5-6 nov, SF) se sitúa en la ventana. Pero son fallos de autorización y de falsificación de petición, no de inyección de prompts, de modo que el contacto con el listón numérico de resistencia es oblicuo.','Pinananatiling malakas ng Langflow IDOR sa totoong mundo noong June 25 at ng AutoGPT SSRF bypass ang tibok ng agentic attack surface, ang presyur mula sa panig ng mamimili na nagpapakain sa hinihinging masusukat na mga security bar. Nasa loob ng window ang OWASP Global AppSec USA (Nov 5-6, SF). Ngunit ang mga ito ay mga authorization at request-forgery na depekto, hindi prompt-injection, kaya pahilis ang ugnayan sa numeric-resistance na bar.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The June 25 in-the-wild Langflow IDOR and the AutoGPT SSRF bypass keep the agentic attack-surface drumbeat loud, the buyer-side pressure feeding demand for measurable security bars. OWASP Global AppSec USA (Nov 5-6, SF) sits in the window. But these are authorization and request-forgery flaws, not prompt-injection ones, so contact with the numeric-resistance bar is oblique.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.3e2eee302e67cce1','source.7b7cc2df80db0f54','2026-06-27','prediction.65d822d45accbf85','AI inference proxies gain named CISA KEV-timeline governance by Q2 2027','AI inference proxies gain named CISA KEV-timeline governance by Q2 2027','AI inference proxies gain named CISA KEV-timeline governance by Q2 2027','AI inference proxies gain named CISA KEV-timeline governance by Q2 2027','2026-06-10','[REVIVED] Layer-1 keyword match on this dormant row''s signals -- SSRF, MCP-server, AI inference proxies / LLM gateways as a named software class, KEV-timeline remediation -- against today''s news. The AutoGPT SSRF-protection bypass (CVE-2026-56663, CVSS 8.5, fixed in 0.6.52) is the same SSRF-on-an-agent-gateway primitive this prediction tracks: a general-purpose web-request block reaching internal services through an IPv4-mapped-IPv6 parsing gap, with the remediation being to constrain outbound egress -- the exact internet-exposure-restriction posture the prediction expects to be codified as named governance. The Langflow cross-tenant IDOR fired in the wild (CVE-2026-55255, CVSS 9.9), chained on the same instance with the already-CISA-KEV-listed RCE CVE-2026-33017, reinforces the KEV-timeline thread directly: the agent-orchestration/proxy layer is generating maximum-severity, actively-exploited CVEs of the kind that draw CISA-KEV listings and operational directives. The prediction''s falsifiable target is AI inference proxies / LLM gateways / MCP servers getting named software-class governance on a CISA-KEV-style remediation timeline -- ideally a joint CISA-NSA publication or binding operational directive. The gap to the bar: today supplies fresh CVEs in this exact class (one chained with a KEV-listed RCE), not a named governance instrument designating the software class.','[{"url": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-56663", "title": "NVD - CVE-2026-56663 Detail (AutoGPT SSRF-protection bypass via IPv4-mapped IPv6 addresses, fixed in 0.6.52)"}, {"url": "https://webflow.sysdig.com/blog/understanding-langflow-cve-2026-55255-and-why-higher-cvss-vulnerabilities-arent-always-the-most-exploited", "title": "Sysdig - Understanding Langflow CVE-2026-55255, and why higher-CVSS vulnerabilities aren''t always the most exploited"}]',4,'The AutoGPT SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663, fixed in 0.6.52) is the same SSRF-on-an-agent-gateway primitive this June 10 thesis tracks, remediated by constraining outbound egress. The Langflow cross-tenant IDOR fired in the wild (CVE-2026-55255, CVSS 9.9), chained on-instance with KEV-listed RCE CVE-2026-33017, reinforces the KEV-timeline thread: the proxy layer is generating actively-exploited maximum-severity CVEs.','AutoGPTのSSRFバイパス(CVE-2026-56663、0.6.52で修正)は、この6月10日の見立てが追うのと同じ、エージェントのゲートウェイ上のSSRFという原始的機能で、外向きエグレスの制限で是正される。実環境で発火したLangflowのテナント横断IDOR(CVE-2026-55255、CVSS 9.9)は、インスタンス上でKEV掲載のRCE CVE-2026-33017と連鎖し、KEVのタイムラインの筋を補強する。プロキシ層が、現に悪用される深刻度最大のCVEを生み出している。','El bypass SSRF de AutoGPT (CVE-2026-56663, corregido en 0.6.52) es la misma primitiva SSRF sobre un gateway de agentes que esta tesis del 10 de junio rastrea, remediada al restringir el egreso saliente. El IDOR entre inquilinos de Langflow disparado de forma activa (CVE-2026-55255, CVSS 9.9), encadenado en la instancia con el RCE listado en KEV CVE-2026-33017, refuerza el hilo del plazo KEV: la capa de proxy está generando CVE de severidad máxima activamente explotados.','Ang AutoGPT SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663, inayos sa 0.6.52) ay siya mismong SSRF-on-an-agent-gateway na primitive na sinusubaybayan ng June 10 na thesis na ito, na inaayos sa pamamagitan ng paghadlang sa papalabas na egress. Pinapatibay ng Langflow cross-tenant IDOR na lumitaw sa totoong mundo (CVE-2026-55255, CVSS 9.9), na ikinabit sa instance kasama ang KEV-listed na RCE na CVE-2026-33017, ang sinulid ng KEV-timeline: ang proxy layer ay gumagawa ng aktibong pinagsasamantalahang maximum-severity na mga CVE.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The AutoGPT SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663, fixed in 0.6.52) is the same SSRF-on-an-agent-gateway primitive this June 10 thesis tracks, remediated by constraining outbound egress. The Langflow cross-tenant IDOR fired in the wild (CVE-2026-55255, CVSS 9.9), chained on-instance with KEV-listed RCE CVE-2026-33017, reinforces the KEV-timeline thread: the proxy layer is generating actively-exploited maximum-severity CVEs.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.d2dae7b11831688e','source.7b7cc2df80db0f54','2026-06-27','prediction.01cc486a859af01b','Agent-framework SQL tools ship read-only-by-default execution guards by Q1 2027','Agent-framework SQL tools ship read-only-by-default execution guards by Q1 2027','Agent-framework SQL tools ship read-only-by-default execution guards by Q1 2027','Agent-framework SQL tools ship read-only-by-default execution guards by Q1 2027','2026-06-05','[REVIVED] Layer-2 semantic match: this dormant row''s signals -- prompt injection arbitrary execution, framework execution-wrapper enforcement, least-privilege read-only-by-default credentials -- map directly onto today''s agent-execution-layer CVEs. The Langflow cross-tenant IDOR fired in the wild (CVE-2026-55255, CVSS 9.9, get_flow_by_id_or_endpoint_name with no owner check) and the AutoGPT SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663, CVSS 8.5, a fetch primitive reaching internal services) are both instances of the same root cause this prediction''s defensive answer targets: agent frameworks execute broadly-scoped operations without least-privilege, deny-by-default guards at the execution wrapper. The prediction''s specific landing is agent-framework SQL tools shipping read-only-by-default, parser-validated SELECT-only execution guards with write/DDL opt-in -- the SQL analogue of the per-object authorization and egress gating today''s CVEs argue for. The gap to the bar: today''s flaws are an IDOR and an SSRF rather than a text-to-SQL injection, and no agent SQL toolkit shipped read-only-by-default guards today; the contact is the shared default-deny-execution structural argument, not a SQL-tool release.','[{"url": "https://webflow.sysdig.com/blog/understanding-langflow-cve-2026-55255-and-why-higher-cvss-vulnerabilities-arent-always-the-most-exploited", "title": "Sysdig - Understanding Langflow CVE-2026-55255, and why higher-CVSS vulnerabilities aren''t always the most exploited"}, {"url": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-56663", "title": "NVD - CVE-2026-56663 Detail (AutoGPT SSRF-protection bypass via IPv4-mapped IPv6 addresses, fixed in 0.6.52)"}]',3,'The Langflow cross-tenant IDOR fired in the wild (CVE-2026-55255, no owner check) and the AutoGPT SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663) both stem from the root cause this June 5 thesis answers: agent frameworks execute broadly-scoped operations without least-privilege, deny-by-default guards at the execution wrapper. Read-only-by-default SELECT-only SQL guards are the same structural argument applied to the SQL tool.','実環境で発火したLangflowのテナント横断IDOR(CVE-2026-55255、所有者チェックなし)とAutoGPTのSSRFバイパス(CVE-2026-56663)は、ともにこの6月5日の見立てが答える根本原因に由来する。エージェントのフレームワークが、実行ラッパーの段階で最小権限・拒否を既定とする防護なしに、広く権限を持つ操作を実行してしまう。読み取り専用を既定とするSELECTのみのSQL防護は、同じ構造的な主張をSQLツールに当てはめたものだ。','El IDOR entre inquilinos de Langflow disparado de forma activa (CVE-2026-55255, sin comprobación de propietario) y el bypass SSRF de AutoGPT (CVE-2026-56663) provienen ambos de la causa raíz a la que responde esta tesis del 5 de junio: los frameworks de agentes ejecutan operaciones de alcance amplio sin guardas de mínimo privilegio que denieguen por defecto en el envoltorio de ejecución. Las guardas SQL de solo lectura por defecto y limitadas a SELECT son el mismo argumento estructural aplicado a la herramienta SQL.','Ang Langflow cross-tenant IDOR na lumitaw sa totoong mundo (CVE-2026-55255, walang owner check) at ang AutoGPT SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663) ay parehong nag-uugat sa sanhi na tinutugunan ng June 5 na thesis na ito: nagpapatakbo ang mga agent framework ng malawak na sakop na operasyon nang walang least-privilege at deny-by-default na guard sa execution wrapper. Ang read-only-by-default at SELECT-only na SQL guard ay ang parehong istruktural na argumento na inilapat sa SQL tool.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Langflow cross-tenant IDOR fired in the wild (CVE-2026-55255, no owner check) and the AutoGPT SSRF bypass (CVE-2026-56663) both stem from the root cause this June 5 thesis answers: agent frameworks execute broadly-scoped operations without least-privilege, deny-by-default guards at the execution wrapper. Read-only-by-default SELECT-only SQL guards are the same structural argument applied to the SQL tool.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.681c06454f9c0473','source.b724a4e00814e972','2026-06-28','prediction.0c569408626bbdd3','Sub-gigabyte on-device LLM gains same-week Unsloth tuning support by Q3 2026','Sub-gigabyte on-device LLM gains same-week Unsloth tuning support by Q3 2026','Sub-gigabyte on-device LLM gains same-week Unsloth tuning support by Q3 2026','Sub-gigabyte on-device LLM gains same-week Unsloth tuning support by Q3 2026','2026-06-28','Today''s two lead items are the origin signals this thesis is built on. Liquid AI''s June 27 LFM2.5-230M is a 230-million-parameter, text-only model that ships open-weight base and instruction-tuned checkpoints on Hugging Face with launch-day runtime support for llama.cpp, MLX, vLLM, SGLang and ONNX, a 4-bit footprint of 293-375 MB, and 213 tokens/second on a Galaxy S25 Ultra -- a sub-gigabyte on-device model that lands against the full local-inference stack on day one. The paired signal is Unsloth''s v0.1.471-beta (June 18), which added first-class LoRA/QLoRA support for Z.ai''s GLM-5.2 just two days after its June 16 open-weight drop, plus Gemma 4 multi-token prediction and DiffusionGemma -- demonstrating the tightening release-to-tuning turnaround the prediction extrapolates to the edge tier. The prediction''s falsifiable bar: a sub-1B on-device model published this cycle gains LoRA/QLoRA fine-tuning support in a mainstream tuning toolkit within the same week its weights drop. The gap to the bar: today supplies the edge release (LFM2.5-230M) and the proven two-day frontier turnaround, but not yet a mainstream toolkit landing same-week tuning for that specific sub-1B checkpoint.','[{"url": "https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/06/27/liquid-ai-ships-lfm2-5-230m-with-llama-cpp-mlx-vllm-sglang-and-onnx-support-for-on-device-inference/", "title": "MarkTechPost - Liquid AI ships LFM2.5-230M with llama.cpp, MLX, vLLM, SGLang, and ONNX support for on-device inference"}, {"url": "https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-230M", "title": "Hugging Face - LiquidAI/LFM2.5-230M model card"}, {"url": "https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth/releases/tag/v0.1.471-beta", "title": "GitHub - unslothai/unsloth release v0.1.471-beta (June 18 2026)"}]',5,'Liquid AI''s June 27 LFM2.5-230M lands a sub-gigabyte on-device model against the full local-inference stack on day one, while Unsloth''s v0.1.471-beta added LoRA/QLoRA for GLM-5.2 just two days after its weights dropped. Together the edge release and the proven two-day frontier turnaround make the same-week edge-tuning extrapolation the natural next step.','Liquid AIが6月27日に公開したLFM2.5-230Mは、1ギガバイト未満のオンデバイスモデルを初日からローカル推論スタック一式に対応させて投入した。一方でUnslothのv0.1.471-betaは、ウェイト公開のわずか2日後にGLM-5.2向けのLoRA/QLoRAを追加した。このエッジ向けの公開と、実証された2日という間隔が重なることで、同じ週にエッジ層をチューニングするという外挿が、自然な次の一歩になる。','El LFM2.5-230M de Liquid AI, del 27 de junio, sitúa un modelo en dispositivo por debajo del gigabyte junto a toda la pila de inferencia local el mismo día, mientras que la v0.1.471-beta de Unsloth añadió LoRA/QLoRA para GLM-5.2 apenas dos días después de la publicación de sus pesos. Juntos, la publicación de borde y el plazo de dos días ya probado en la frontera convierten la extrapolación al ajuste de borde en la misma semana en el siguiente paso natural.','Ang LFM2.5-230M ng Liquid AI noong June 27 ay naghahatid ng sub-gigabyte na on-device na modelo kasabay ng buong local-inference stack sa unang araw mismo, samantalang ang v0.1.471-beta ng Unsloth ay nagdagdag ng LoRA/QLoRA para sa GLM-5.2 dalawang araw lamang matapos ilabas ang weights nito. Magkasama, ang edge release at ang napatunayang dalawang-araw na agwat sa frontier ang ginagawang likas na susunod na hakbang ang ekstrapolasyon tungo sa same-week na edge-tuning.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Liquid AI''s June 27 LFM2.5-230M lands a sub-gigabyte on-device model against the full local-inference stack on day one, while Unsloth''s v0.1.471-beta added LoRA/QLoRA for GLM-5.2 just two days after its weights dropped. Together the edge release and the proven two-day frontier turnaround make the same-week edge-tuning extrapolation the natural next step.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.9e2795a3104162e8','source.b724a4e00814e972','2026-06-28','prediction.6095c8445805dcf4','Rival accelerator vendor buys a CUDA-agnostic inference compiler by Q1 2027','Rival accelerator vendor buys a CUDA-agnostic inference compiler by Q1 2027','Rival accelerator vendor buys a CUDA-agnostic inference compiler by Q1 2027','Rival accelerator vendor buys a CUDA-agnostic inference compiler by Q1 2027','2026-06-28','Today''s lead business item is the precipitating trigger for this thesis. Qualcomm''s June 24 agreement to acquire Modular -- the startup behind the Mojo language and the MAX inference engine that runs the same model code across Nvidia, AMD, Intel and Qualcomm chips without per-processor rewrites -- is reported as a roughly $3.92 billion all-stock deal expected to close in the second half of 2026, and read explicitly as a move on Nvidia''s CUDA lock-in for enterprise inference. Qualcomm''s own release frames the goal as a silicon-agnostic compute layer across devices, edge and data centers. The acquisition arrives with two reinforcing signals: a committed custom-silicon ship to a leading hyperscaler before year-end and reported $8-10 billion Tenstorrent talks, together committing roughly $14 billion toward a full-stack, open-instruction-set challenger to Nvidia. The prediction''s falsifiable bar: at least one rival accelerator buyer (AMD, Intel, or a hyperscaler silicon arm) responds by acquiring or taking a controlling stake in a comparable cross-vendor inference-compiler or runtime startup. The gap to the bar: today supplies the catalyzing Qualcomm-Modular deal that removes the largest neutral compiler asset, but no rival counter-acquisition has been announced.','[{"url": "https://investor.qualcomm.com/news-events/press-releases/news-details/2026/Qualcomm-to-Acquire-Modular/default.aspx", "title": "Qualcomm - Qualcomm to Acquire Modular (press release, June 24 2026)"}, {"url": "https://techstartups.com/2026/06/24/qualcomm-acquires-ai-startup-modular-in-4-billion-deal-to-challenge-nvidias-cuda-dominance/", "title": "Tech Startups - Qualcomm acquires AI startup Modular in $4 billion deal to challenge Nvidia''s CUDA dominance"}]',5,'Qualcomm''s June 24 roughly $3.92 billion acquisition of Modular pulls the largest neutral cross-vendor inference compiler off the board, reading explicitly as a strike at CUDA lock-in. That removal is the structural force the prediction names: once the dominant silicon-agnostic asset is captured, rival buyers face pressure to secure comparable runtime independence themselves.','Qualcommが6月24日に約39億2000万ドルでModularを買収したことで、最大の中立的なベンダー横断型推論コンパイラが市場から消え、CUDA囲い込みへの一撃とはっきり読み取れる。この除去こそ、予測が指し示す構造的な力だ。シリコン非依存の支配的資産がいったん押さえられると、競合の買い手は同等のランタイム独立性を自ら確保しなければならない圧力に直面する。','La adquisición por Qualcomm el 24 de junio de Modular, por unos 3.920 millones de dólares, retira del tablero el mayor compilador de inferencia neutral y multifabricante, y se lee explícitamente como un golpe contra el bloqueo de CUDA. Esa retirada es la fuerza estructural que la predicción señala: una vez capturado el activo dominante independiente del silicio, los compradores rivales enfrentan presión para asegurar por su cuenta una independencia comparable de entorno de ejecución.','Ang humigit-kumulang $3.92 billion na akisisyon ng Qualcomm sa Modular noong June 24 ay naglalabas ng pinakamalaking neutral na cross-vendor inference compiler sa larangan, na malinaw na binabasa bilang atake sa CUDA lock-in. Ang pag-aalis na iyon ang istrukturang puwersang tinutukoy ng prediksyon: kapag nakuha na ang nangingibabaw na silicon-agnostic na asset, haharap sa presyon ang mga karibal na bumibili na siguruhin din ang katulad na kalayaan sa runtime para sa kanilang sarili.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Qualcomm''s June 24 roughly $3.92 billion acquisition of Modular pulls the largest neutral cross-vendor inference compiler off the board, reading explicitly as a strike at CUDA lock-in. That removal is the structural force the prediction names: once the dominant silicon-agnostic asset is captured, rival buyers face pressure to secure comparable runtime independence themselves.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.7550e5c4c67857b1','source.b724a4e00814e972','2026-06-28','prediction.6ba7ca6e01ab313e','Coding-agent platform ships trifecta capability gate as default by Q1 2027','Coding-agent platform ships trifecta capability gate as default by Q1 2027','Coding-agent platform ships trifecta capability gate as default by Q1 2027','Coding-agent platform ships trifecta capability gate as default by Q1 2027','2026-06-28','Today''s security lead is the architectural premise this thesis rests on. The OWASP GenAI Security Project''s version 2.01 State of Agentic AI Security and Governance reframes prompt injection from another CVE into a design constraint: it is the universal joint connecting most agentic-AI incidents and now maps to six of the ten categories in OWASP''s Top 10 for Agentic Applications. Because a model treats system prompt, user request and retrieved text as one undifferentiated token stream, there is no reliable way to mark tokens as commands versus data, so the flaw is mitigated by design budgets, not patched -- the report leans on Simon Willison''s lethal trifecta and Meta''s Agents Rule of Two. Crucially, it names coding agents the epicenter: 28 of 53 tracked agentic projects are coding agents, with the most-advisoried repositories being n8n (57), Claude Code (22), AutoGPT (15), Dify (13) and Roo-Code (11). The prediction''s falsifiable bar: at least one leading coding-agent platform ships a default-on capability gate enforcing a Rule-of-Two constraint -- at most two of private-data access, untrusted-content exposure, and external communication before pausing for human approval. The gap to the bar: today supplies the unpatchable-by-design argument and the epicenter naming, but no platform has shipped a default-on trifecta gate.','[{"url": "https://genai.owasp.org/resource/state-of-agentic-ai-security-and-governance/", "title": "OWASP GenAI Security Project - State of Agentic AI Security and Governance 2.01"}, {"url": "https://simonwillison.net/2025/Jun/16/the-lethal-trifecta/", "title": "Simon Willison - The lethal trifecta for AI agents: private data, untrusted content, and external communication"}]',5,'OWASP''s June 28 reframing makes prompt injection an unpatchable design constraint mapping to six of ten agentic categories, and names coding agents the epicenter with Claude Code, n8n and AutoGPT topping the advisory tally. That forces the conclusion the prediction rests on: defenses must be orchestration-layer capability budgets, exactly the Rule-of-Two gate the thesis expects a platform to ship default-on.','OWASPの6月28日の捉え直しは、プロンプトインジェクションをパッチ不能な設計上の制約とし、10あるエージェント型カテゴリのうち6つに対応づける。さらにコーディングエージェントを震源地と名指しし、勧告件数ではClaude Code、n8n、AutoGPTが上位を占める。これは予測が立脚する結論を強いる。すなわち、防御はオーケストレーション層の機能予算でなければならず、それはまさに、プラットフォームがデフォルト有効で出荷すると本仮説が見込むRule-of-Twoゲートそのものだ。','El replanteamiento de OWASP del 28 de junio convierte la inyección de prompts en una restricción de diseño imposible de parchear, asignada a seis de diez categorías agénticas, y señala a los agentes de programación como el epicentro, con Claude Code, n8n y AutoGPT encabezando el recuento de advisories. Eso fuerza la conclusión sobre la que descansa la predicción: las defensas deben ser presupuestos de capacidades en la capa de orquestación, justamente la compuerta Rule-of-Two que la tesis espera que una plataforma incorpore activada por defecto.','Ang muling pagbabalangkas ng OWASP noong June 28 ay ginagawang isang hindi-mapapatch na design constraint ang prompt injection na tumutugma sa anim sa sampung agentic na kategorya, at pinangalanan ang mga coding agent bilang sentro na ang Claude Code, n8n at AutoGPT ang nangunguna sa bilang ng advisory. Pinipilit nito ang konklusyong pinagbabatayan ng prediksyon: ang mga depensa ay dapat na capability budgets sa orchestration layer, mismong ang Rule-of-Two na gate na inaasahan ng tesis na ihahatid na default-on ng isang platform.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'OWASP''s June 28 reframing makes prompt injection an unpatchable design constraint mapping to six of ten agentic categories, and names coding agents the epicenter with Claude Code, n8n and AutoGPT topping the advisory tally. That forces the conclusion the prediction rests on: defenses must be orchestration-layer capability budgets, exactly the Rule-of-Two gate the thesis expects a platform to ship default-on.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.65a8ff083680f3c8','source.b724a4e00814e972','2026-06-28','prediction.3abbcb892f7919d6','Frontier-class open-weight LLM runs single-node under 256GB by Q4 2026','Frontier-class open-weight LLM runs single-node under 256GB by Q4 2026','Frontier-class open-weight LLM runs single-node under 256GB by Q4 2026','Frontier-class open-weight LLM runs single-node under 256GB by Q4 2026','2026-06-23','Today''s Unsloth item bears on the open-weight-frontier half of this thesis. Unsloth''s v0.1.471-beta added full support for Z.ai''s GLM-5.2 -- the MIT-licensed ~753B-parameter mixture-of-experts that topped agentic-coding benchmarks this month -- across all reasoning levels, two days after its June 16 release, alongside Gemma 4 and an improved auto-fit memory algorithm credited with roughly 3x longer usable context plus tensor-parallel reliability and vLLM 0.22+ compatibility. The relevance is that the frontier open-weight wave (GLM-5.2 at MoE scale, with sparse active-parameter routing) is exactly the class this prediction expects to become single-node-runnable: a sparse 753B-parameter MoE activates only a fraction of weights per token, and the memory-efficiency tooling Unsloth is shipping is the kind that pushes such a model toward a sub-256GB single-node envelope. The gap to the bar: today documents tuning-toolkit coverage and memory improvements, not an independently demonstrated single-node run of a frontier-class open-weight model under 256GB. The contact is the open-weight-frontier and memory-efficiency thread, not a measured single-node footprint.','[{"url": "https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth/releases/tag/v0.1.471-beta", "title": "GitHub - unslothai/unsloth release v0.1.471-beta (June 18 2026)"}, {"url": "https://www.datacamp.com/blog/glm-5-2", "title": "DataCamp - GLM-5.2: Features, Setup, Benchmarks, and Model Switching Guide"}]',3,'Unsloth''s June 18 beta lands full GLM-5.2 support -- a sparse ~753B MoE activating only a fraction of weights per token -- alongside an auto-fit memory algorithm crediting roughly 3x longer usable context, exactly the open-weight-frontier scale and memory-efficiency tooling that pushes such a model toward a sub-256GB single-node envelope.','Unslothの6月18日betaは、トークンごとにウェイトの一部しか活性化しない疎な約7530億のMoEであるGLM-5.2への完全対応を、使える文脈長を約3倍に伸ばすとされる自動フィットのメモリアルゴリズムとあわせて投入した。これはまさに、そうしたモデルを256GB未満の単一ノードの枠へ押し進める、オープンウェイトのフロンティアスケールとメモリ効率化ツールだ。','La beta de Unsloth del 18 de junio incorpora soporte completo para GLM-5.2 -una MoE dispersa de unos 753.000 millones de parámetros que activa solo una fracción de los pesos por token- junto con un algoritmo de ajuste automático de memoria al que se atribuyen aproximadamente 3 veces más de contexto utilizable, justamente la escala de la frontera de pesos abiertos y las herramientas de eficiencia de memoria que empujan a un modelo así hacia un margen de un solo nodo por debajo de 256GB.','Ang June 18 beta ng Unsloth ay naghahatid ng buong GLM-5.2 support -- isang sparse na ~753B MoE na nag-aaktibo lamang ng bahagi ng weights kada token -- kasama ang isang auto-fit memory algorithm na kinikilalang nagbibigay ng humigit-kumulang 3x na mas mahabang magagamit na context, mismong ang open-weight-frontier na sukat at memory-efficiency tooling na nagtutulak sa naturang modelo tungo sa isang sub-256GB na single-node na sukat.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Unsloth''s June 18 beta lands full GLM-5.2 support -- a sparse ~753B MoE activating only a fraction of weights per token -- alongside an auto-fit memory algorithm crediting roughly 3x longer usable context, exactly the open-weight-frontier scale and memory-efficiency tooling that pushes such a model toward a sub-256GB single-node envelope.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.40f8a5e1e158dbf2','source.b724a4e00814e972','2026-06-28','prediction.3a5fa9315f58608d','Agentic coding platforms ship token budgets and caps as default by Q2 2027','Agentic coding platforms ship token budgets and caps as default by Q2 2027','Agentic coding platforms ship token budgets and caps as default by Q2 2027','Agentic coding platforms ship token budgets and caps as default by Q2 2027','2026-06-25','Today''s OWASP report bears on this thesis on the broader default-posture pressure rather than on token budgeting specifically. OWASP''s 2.01 reframing names coding agents the epicenter of agentic-AI risk -- 28 of 53 tracked agentic projects are coding agents, with Claude Code, AutoGPT, Dify and Roo-Code among the most-advisoried repositories -- and argues the durable mitigations are orchestration-layer design budgets rather than token-stream filtering. That argument that coding-agent platforms must add default-on guardrails at the orchestration layer is the same competitive-and-advisory pressure this prediction expects to drive token-budget and cap defaults, since unbounded autonomous loops are part of the same uncontrolled-execution risk surface. The gap to the bar: today''s report addresses capability gating against the lethal trifecta, not cost or token-budget caps; no agentic coding platform shipped token budgets or caps as a default today. The contact is the shared default-on-guardrail pressure, not a budgeting release.','[{"url": "https://genai.owasp.org/resource/state-of-agentic-ai-security-and-governance/", "title": "OWASP GenAI Security Project - State of Agentic AI Security and Governance 2.01"}]',2,'Unsloth''s June 18 v0.1.471-beta adds full GLM-5.2 coverage two days after that MIT-licensed ~753B mixture-of-experts shipped, plus an auto-fit memory algorithm credited with roughly 3x longer usable context. A sparse MoE activates only a fraction of weights per token, and exactly this memory-efficiency tooling is what pushes such a model toward a sub-256GB single-node envelope, reinforcing the thesis''s underlying reason.','Unslothの6月18日のv0.1.471-betaは、MITライセンスの約7530億のMixture-of-Expertsの公開から2日後にGLM-5.2への完全対応を加え、さらに使える文脈長を約3倍に伸ばすとされる自動フィットのメモリアルゴリズムを追加した。疎なMoEはトークンごとにウェイトの一部しか活性化せず、まさにこのメモリ効率化ツールが、そうしたモデルを256GB未満の単一ノードの枠へ押し進める。これが本仮説の根底にある理由を補強する。','La v0.1.471-beta de Unsloth, del 18 de junio, añade cobertura completa de GLM-5.2 dos días después de que esa mezcla de expertos con licencia MIT de unos 753.000 millones de parámetros se publicara, además de un algoritmo de ajuste automático de memoria al que se atribuyen aproximadamente 3 veces más de contexto utilizable. Una MoE dispersa activa solo una fracción de los pesos por token, y justamente estas herramientas de eficiencia de memoria son las que empujan a un modelo así hacia un margen de un solo nodo por debajo de 256GB, lo que refuerza la razón de fondo de la tesis.','Ang v0.1.471-beta ng Unsloth noong June 18 ay nagdagdag ng buong GLM-5.2 na saklaw dalawang araw matapos ipadala ang MIT-licensed na ~753B mixture-of-experts na iyon, dagdag pa ang isang auto-fit memory algorithm na kinikilalang nagbibigay ng humigit-kumulang 3x na mas mahabang magagamit na context. Isang sparse na MoE ang nag-aaktibo lamang ng bahagi ng weights kada token, at mismong ang memory-efficiency tooling na ito ang nagtutulak sa naturang modelo tungo sa isang sub-256GB na single-node na sukat, na nagpapatibay sa pinagbabatayang dahilan ng tesis.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Unsloth''s June 18 v0.1.471-beta adds full GLM-5.2 coverage two days after that MIT-licensed ~753B mixture-of-experts shipped, plus an auto-fit memory algorithm credited with roughly 3x longer usable context. A sparse MoE activates only a fraction of weights per token, and exactly this memory-efficiency tooling is what pushes such a model toward a sub-256GB single-node envelope, reinforcing the thesis''s underlying reason.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.ee0cb63032344e8d','source.b724a4e00814e972','2026-06-28','prediction.079ca77d11decc5f','AI accelerator ships confidential-inference tier with attestation by H1 2027','AI accelerator ships confidential-inference tier with attestation by H1 2027','AI accelerator ships confidential-inference tier with attestation by H1 2027','AI accelerator ships confidential-inference tier with attestation by H1 2027','2026-06-26','Today''s news touches this thesis through the AI-chip strategy and venue calendar. AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 is confirmed for July 22-23 at Moscone, with the keynote and Instinct MI400-series focus on July 23 -- exactly the kind of stage where a confidential-inference part with attestation would surface, and within this prediction''s window. Qualcomm''s roughly $14 billion full-stack push (the Modular acquisition, reported Tenstorrent talks, and a committed hyperscaler custom-silicon ship before year-end) keeps the merchant-accelerator roadmap contested, the competitive backdrop against which a differentiated confidential-inference SKU would be announced. The prediction expects a purpose-built AI inference accelerator to ship or be unveiled with confidential computing as a named, load-bearing feature: on-die root-of-trust, TEE-I/O keeping weights and activations encrypted in use across the CPU-accelerator boundary, and signed-model attestation marketed as a named tier. The gap to the bar: today gives the upcoming AMD venue and the broader chip-rivalry backdrop, not a shipping part. A generic confidential-computing line on a spec sheet or a confidential-VM offering without TEE-I/O or model attestation does not count; no named confidential-inference tier has been disclosed.','[{"url": "https://www.ai.engineer/worldsfair/2026/llms.md", "title": "AI Engineer - World''s Fair 2026 program (main program June 29 - July 2, Moscone West, San Francisco)"}]',2,'AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23, Moscone) puts the Instinct MI400-series keynote inside the prediction window, the natural stage for a confidential-inference part, while Qualcomm''s roughly $14 billion full-stack push keeps the merchant-accelerator race contested enough to reward a differentiated security SKU. Both are backdrop and venue, not a shipping accelerator with named attestation.','AMDのAdvancing AI 2026(7月22〜23日、Moscone)は、Instinct MI400シリーズの基調講演を予測の期間内に置き、機密推論パーツにふさわしい舞台となる。一方でQualcommの約140億ドルのフルスタック攻勢は、マーチャント型アクセラレータ競争を、差別化されたセキュリティSKUに報いるだけの争われた状態に保つ。いずれも背景と会場であって、名指しのアテステーションを備えた出荷アクセラレータではない。','El Advancing AI 2026 de AMD (22-23 de julio, Moscone) sitúa la keynote de la serie Instinct MI400 dentro de la ventana de la predicción, el escenario natural para una pieza de inferencia confidencial, mientras que el empuje de pila completa de Qualcomm, de unos 14.000 millones de dólares, mantiene la carrera de aceleradores comerciales lo bastante disputada como para recompensar una SKU de seguridad diferenciada. Ambos son telón de fondo y escenario, no un acelerador en distribución con atestación nombrada.','Ang Advancing AI 2026 ng AMD (July 22-23, Moscone) ay naglalagay sa keynote ng Instinct MI400-series sa loob ng bintana ng prediksyon, ang likas na entablado para sa isang confidential-inference na bahagi, samantalang ang humigit-kumulang $14 billion na full-stack na pagtutulak ng Qualcomm ay pinananatiling pinaglalabanan ang merchant-accelerator na karera nang sapat upang gantimpalaan ang isang naiibang security SKU. Pareho silang backdrop at venue, hindi isang ipinapadalang accelerator na may pinangalanang attestation.','landing',NULL,NULL,NULL,'AMD''s Advancing AI 2026 (July 22-23, Moscone) puts the Instinct MI400-series keynote inside the prediction window, the natural stage for a confidential-inference part, while Qualcomm''s roughly $14 billion full-stack push keeps the merchant-accelerator race contested enough to reward a differentiated security SKU. Both are backdrop and venue, not a shipping accelerator with named attestation.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.009784698efcdc4e','source.b724a4e00814e972','2026-06-28','prediction.4814a487eb010b3e','DiffusionGemma seeds an open-weight text-diffusion training category by Q2 2027','DiffusionGemma seeds an open-weight text-diffusion training category by Q2 2027','DiffusionGemma seeds an open-weight text-diffusion training category by Q2 2027','DiffusionGemma seeds an open-weight text-diffusion training category by Q2 2027','2026-06-14','[REVIVED] Layer-1 keyword match on this dormant row''s signals -- DiffusionGemma run-and-train, Gemma 4 multi-token prediction, second local training/inference stack native support, llama.cpp Ollama LM Studio MLX Axolotl TRL -- against today''s Unsloth item. Unsloth''s v0.1.471-beta ships the DiffusionGemma image-generation path with live denoising visualization and Gemma 4 with multi-token prediction for roughly 2x faster inference, directly extending the open-weight diffusion training/inference coverage this prediction tracks. The prediction''s bar is that DiffusionGemma seeds an established open-weight text-diffusion training category -- a second local stack natively supporting diffusion-LM denoising for fine-tune and inference on consumer edge hardware. Today''s beta is a concrete second-stack step in exactly that direction: a mainstream tuning toolkit landing first-class DiffusionGemma support alongside Gemma 4 multi-token prediction. The gap to the bar: today''s signal is the DiffusionGemma image-generation/denoising path within one toolkit''s beta, not yet an independent second open-weight text-diffusion family or a settled multi-stack training category for text diffusion specifically.','[{"url": "https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth/releases/tag/v0.1.471-beta", "title": "GitHub - unslothai/unsloth release v0.1.471-beta (June 18 2026)"}]',4,'AMD''s Advancing AI on July 22-23, with its Instinct MI400-series keynote, lands squarely inside the prediction''s window and is exactly the stage where a confidential-inference part with attestation would surface, while Qualcomm''s roughly $14 billion full-stack push keeps the merchant-accelerator field contested enough to reward a differentiated security SKU. These are the conditions under which the bar gets cleared, not the clearing itself.','AMDのAdvancing AIは7月22〜23日に開かれ、Instinct MI400シリーズの基調講演とともに予測の期間内にぴたりと収まる。これはまさに、認証付きの機密推論パーツが姿を見せそうな舞台だ。一方でQualcommの約140億ドルのフルスタック攻勢は、マーチャント型アクセラレータの分野を、差別化されたセキュリティSKUに報いるだけの争われた状態に保つ。これらはラインが満たされる条件であって、満たすこと自体ではない。','El Advancing AI de AMD, el 22-23 de julio, con su keynote de la serie Instinct MI400, cae de lleno dentro de la ventana de la predicción y es justamente el escenario donde aparecería una pieza de inferencia confidencial con atestación, mientras que el empuje de pila completa de Qualcomm, de unos 14.000 millones de dólares, mantiene el campo de aceleradores comerciales lo bastante disputado como para recompensar una SKU de seguridad diferenciada. Estas son las condiciones bajo las que se supera el umbral, no la superación en sí.','Ang Advancing AI ng AMD sa July 22-23, kasama ang keynote ng Instinct MI400-series nito, ay lumalapag mismo sa loob ng bintana ng prediksyon at mismong ang entablado kung saan lilitaw ang isang confidential-inference na bahagi na may attestation, samantalang ang humigit-kumulang $14 billion na full-stack na pagtutulak ng Qualcomm ay pinananatiling pinaglalabanan ang merchant-accelerator na larangan nang sapat upang gantimpalaan ang isang naiibang security SKU. Ito ang mga kondisyon kung saan malalampasan ang hangganan, hindi ang paglampas mismo.','given',NULL,NULL,NULL,'AMD''s Advancing AI on July 22-23, with its Instinct MI400-series keynote, lands squarely inside the prediction''s window and is exactly the stage where a confidential-inference part with attestation would surface, while Qualcomm''s roughly $14 billion full-stack push keeps the merchant-accelerator field contested enough to reward a differentiated security SKU. These are the conditions under which the bar gets cleared, not the clearing itself.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
INSERT INTO "validation_rows" VALUES('validation.2146426d6c8b6323','source.b724a4e00814e972','2026-06-28','prediction.33fd149797573e02','Local fine-tune-to-agent stack ships as a managed hyperscaler service by H2 2026','Local fine-tune-to-agent stack ships as a managed hyperscaler service by H2 2026','Local fine-tune-to-agent stack ships as a managed hyperscaler service by H2 2026','Local fine-tune-to-agent stack ships as a managed hyperscaler service by H2 2026','2026-06-03','[REVIVED] Layer-2 semantic match: this dormant row''s signals -- Unsloth build, QLoRA small open model, consumer-class memory, fine-tune-to-deployed-agent pipeline, managed hyperscaler MLOps console -- map onto today''s Unsloth item. v0.1.471-beta tightens the local fine-tuning loop with frontier open-weight coverage (GLM-5.2, Gemma 4 multi-token prediction, DiffusionGemma), an auto-fit memory algorithm credited with roughly 3x longer usable context, enhanced Blackwell RTX 50X/60X support, vLLM 0.22+ compatibility, and a parallel-execution mode that lets a user chat, train, export and run recipes simultaneously -- the consumer-class fine-tune-to-agent toolchain this prediction expects a hyperscaler to absorb into a managed service. The prediction''s bar is that this local loop ships as a managed hyperscaler service with a curated tool catalog and synthetic-data generator. The gap to the bar: today''s signal is open-source toolkit maturation on consumer hardware, not a hyperscaler productizing the loop as a managed console; the contact is the fine-tune-to-agent pipeline thread, not a managed-service launch.','[{"url": "https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth/releases/tag/v0.1.471-beta", "title": "GitHub - unslothai/unsloth release v0.1.471-beta (June 18 2026)"}]',3,'Unsloth''s June 18 beta tightens exactly the consumer-class loop this thesis expects a hyperscaler to absorb: frontier open-weight coverage (GLM-5.2, Gemma 4 multi-token prediction, DiffusionGemma), an auto-fit memory algorithm worth roughly 3x longer context, Blackwell RTX 50X/60X support, vLLM 0.22+ compatibility, and a parallel mode that chats, trains, exports and runs recipes at once. The fine-tune-to-agent toolchain is maturing into the productizable shape the prediction''s structural force assumes.','Unslothの6月18日betaは、この仮説がハイパースケーラーに取り込まれると見込む、まさにそのコンシューマー級のループを引き締める。フロンティアのオープンウェイト対応(GLM-5.2、Gemma 4のマルチトークン予測、DiffusionGemma)、文脈長を約3倍に伸ばす価値のある自動フィットのメモリアルゴリズム、Blackwell RTX 50X/60X対応、vLLM 0.22+互換、そしてチャット・学習・エクスポート・レシピ実行を一度にこなす並列モードだ。ファインチューニングからエージェントへのツールチェーンは、予測の構造的な力が前提とする製品化可能な形へと成熟しつつある。','La beta de Unsloth del 18 de junio estrecha justamente el bucle de clase consumo que esta tesis espera que un hiperescalador absorba: cobertura de frontera de pesos abiertos (GLM-5.2, predicción multitoken de Gemma 4, DiffusionGemma), un algoritmo de ajuste automático de memoria que vale aproximadamente 3 veces más de contexto, soporte para Blackwell RTX 50X/60X, compatibilidad con vLLM 0.22+ y un modo en paralelo que chatea, entrena, exporta y ejecuta recetas a la vez. La cadena de herramientas de ajuste fino a agente está madurando hacia la forma convertible en producto que asume la fuerza estructural de la predicción.','Ang June 18 beta ng Unsloth ay humihigpit mismo sa consumer-class na loop na inaasahan ng tesis na ito na isasama ng isang hyperscaler: frontier open-weight na saklaw (GLM-5.2, Gemma 4 multi-token prediction, DiffusionGemma), isang auto-fit memory algorithm na nagkakahalaga ng humigit-kumulang 3x na mas mahabang context, Blackwell RTX 50X/60X support, vLLM 0.22+ na pagkakatugma, at isang parallel mode na nag-chat, nag-train, nag-export at nagpapatakbo ng recipes nang sabay-sabay. Ang fine-tune-to-agent na toolchain ay humihinog tungo sa nape-produkto na anyo na pinagpapalagayan ng istrukturang puwersa ng prediksyon.','because',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Unsloth''s June 18 beta tightens exactly the consumer-class loop this thesis expects a hyperscaler to absorb: frontier open-weight coverage (GLM-5.2, Gemma 4 multi-token prediction, DiffusionGemma), an auto-fit memory algorithm worth roughly 3x longer context, Blackwell RTX 50X/60X support, vLLM 0.22+ compatibility, and a parallel mode that chats, trains, exports and runs recipes at once. The fine-tune-to-agent toolchain is maturing into the productizable shape the prediction''s structural force assumes.',NULL,'<CAPTURE_DAY> 09:13:04');
